msgid "Uncover low rank cards before building on higher rank cards on top of them. Use cards already on the foundations to assist in moving rows."
msgstr "先翻出低点数的牌，再往它们上面那些高点数的牌叠放。可以利用王牌区已有的牌来协助移动整行。"

