msgstr "上上（Up and Up）"

msgid "Use caution when playing the Wizards on the reserve stack. If you play a lower rank Wizard on top of a higher rank one, you will have to move it off before the high rank one will play to the foundation."
msgstr "把法师（Wizard）放到预备堆时要小心。如果你把低点数的法师压在高点数的法师上面，就得先把它移开，那张高点数的法师才能进到王牌区。"

msgid "Use enter to select/move a card, or shift+enter for a quick play move."
msgstr "按 enter 选取或移动牌，按 shift+enter 可快速出牌。"

msgid "Use the + (or =) key to select an additional card in the same stack. Use the - key to select one fewer card."
msgstr "用 + （或 =）键可以在同一堆多选一张牌，用 - 键可以少选一张。"

msgid "Use the Trumps to open spots for suit cards."
msgstr "用将牌替花色牌腾出位置。"

msgid "Use the arrow keys to navigate around the different stacks."
msgstr "用方向键在不同堆之间移动光标。"

msgid "Use the reserve stack to allow buried cards to play. The best times to use it are just before a redeal. Once played to the reserve a card may only be moved from it to a foundation."
msgstr "用预备堆让被压住的牌有地方出牌。最好的时机是循环发牌之前。牌一到预备堆，就只能从那里移到王牌区。"

msgid "Use the reserve stack to allow buried cards to play. The best times to use it are just before a redeal. Once played to the reserve a card may only be played from it to a foundation."
msgstr "用预备堆让被压住的牌有地方出牌。最好的时机是循环发牌之前。牌一到预备堆，就只能从那里出到王牌区。"

msgid "Use the reserve stacks to release the fourth rank cards first."
msgstr "先用预备堆把第四点的牌放出来。"

msgid "Use the tab key to navigate quickly between talon, waste, tableau, foundation, and reserve."
msgstr "用 tab 键可以快速在牌山、弃牌堆、牌列、王牌区与预备堆之间切换。"

