msgid "When the hand is dealt there are two rows of six cards face down with six more face up on top. You can play a card on another card if it's in the same suit and in descending rank order. The third and fourth rank cards are interchangeable for all suits except Rain. Plum 4 on Plum 3 is OK. Plum 3 on Plum 4 is OK. Gaji can only be played on Rain 3."
msgstr "发完牌后有两行各六张面朝下的牌，上面再压六张面朝上的牌。只要同花色且点数递减，你就能把一张牌放到另一张牌上。除了雨（Rain）之外，所有花色的第三点与第四点牌都能互换。李（Plum）4 放李 3 可以，李 3 放李 4 也可以。Gaji 只能放在雨 3 上面。"

msgid "When the talon is empty after each round the cards are gathered up from the tableau and dealt to the rows without being shuffled using the same dealing rules as in the first round. The foundations take two complete rounds of a suit. After the last card of the first round is played to a foundation the first card of the second round will play."
msgstr "每一轮把牌山发完之后，会将牌列的牌收回，不洗牌就依第一轮相同的发牌规则发到各行。一个王牌区需要同一花色完整两轮。第一轮最后一张牌进入王牌区之后，第二轮的第一张牌才能接着进去。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the top of the talon to each tableau pile. The game is won if you're able to organize all the cards into complete sequences from king to ace."
msgstr "没有步可走时，你可以从牌山顶各发一张牌到每个牌列堆。能把所有牌整理成从 K 到 A 的完整顺子就算获胜。"

msgid "When you are out of moves, you can deal one card from the talon to the top of each tableau pile."
msgstr "没有步可走时，你可以从牌山各发一张牌到每个牌列堆的最上面。"

msgid "When you click on the talon, one card is turned over onto the waste pile. There is no limit to the number of times you go through the talon."
msgstr "点牌山会翻一张牌到弃牌堆。你可以无限次翻遍牌山。"

