msgid "24 cards are dealt to the tableau, in five rows of 1, 3, 5, 7, and 9 cards respectively. No building on the tableau is allowed - cards from the tableau can only be moved to the foundations, which are built up by same suit from ace to king. Empty tableau piles are immediately filled from the waste pile or talon."
msgstr "发 24 张牌到牌列，分成五排，依序为 1、3、5、7、9 张。牌列不允许叠放——牌列的牌只能移到王牌区，王牌区从 A 到 K 按同花色递增叠放。空的牌列堆会立即由弃牌堆或牌山补齐。"

