msgid "Auto drop will automatically move all cards that can be moved to foundations to the foundations. It can also be enabled in the options menu to auto drop all the time without needing to select the option."
msgstr "自动放置会把能移到王牌区的牌全部移到王牌区。也可以在选项菜单里设定一律自动放置，不必每次选择。"

