msgid "Because of this, the game is won when there are only two piles left (it is impossible to get only one pile under these rules)."
msgstr "也因为如此，只要剩下两堆就算获胜（依这些规则不可能只剩一堆）。"

msgid "Beeswax"
msgstr "蜂蜡（Beeswax）"

msgid "Beetle"
msgstr "甲虫（Beetle）"

msgid "Before you report a bug, please verify that you are running the latest version of PySolFC. Also, check the"
msgstr "报告错误之前，请先确定你跑的是最新版 PySolFC，并查一下"

msgid "Begin in the upper left hand corner and complete one row before starting the next."
msgstr "左上角开始，一横排排完再排下一排。"

msgid "Beleaguered Castle type. 1 joker deck. No redeal."
msgstr "围城堡（Beleaguered Castle）游戏类型。1 组鬼牌牌组。不循环发牌。"

