msgstr "Dashavatara Ganjifa = 8"

msgid "Dashavatara Ganjifa game type. 1 deck. No redeal."
msgstr "达萨瓦塔拉甘吉发游戏类型。1 副牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Dashavatara Ganjifa game type. 2 decks. 3 redeals."
msgstr "达萨瓦塔拉甘吉发游戏类型。2 副牌。3 次循环发牌。"

msgid "Dashavatara Ganjifa type. 1 deck. No redeal."
msgstr "达萨瓦塔拉甘吉发类型。1 副牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Dashavatara Ganjifa type. One deck. One redeal."
msgstr "达萨瓦塔拉甘吉发类型。1 副牌。1 次循环发牌。"

msgid "David Svoboda &lt;svoboda@users.sourceforge.net&gt;"
msgstr "David Svoboda &lt;svoboda@users.sourceforge.net&gt;"

msgid "Deal cards from the stock one at a time. Cards can be moved from the waste pile to the appropriate foundation as mentioned above. Foundations must be built up by alternate colors, and all of the foundations must be built up using the same sequence of suits. One redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张。弃牌堆的牌可如前述移到合适的王牌区。王牌区要依红黑交替递增叠放，而且所有王牌区必须使用相同的花色顺序。允许循环发牌 1 次。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "Deal cards from the stock one at a time. Cards from the waste pile may be moved to foundations, which are built down by rank, wrapping down from ace to king as necessary. A card cannot be placed in a foundation unless the foundation to the left of it has cards in it."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张。弃牌堆的牌可移到王牌区，王牌区依点数递减叠放，必要时从 A 循环到 K。若左边相邻的王牌区还没有牌，就不能把牌放进去。"

msgid "Deal cards from the stock one at a time. Cards from the waste pile may be moved to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张。弃牌堆的牌可移到牌列或王牌区。"

msgid "Deal cards from the stock one at a time. Each card dealt from the stock must be moved to one of three special reserve piles. Cards from these reserves can be moved to the body of the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张。每张从牌山发出的牌都必须移到三个特殊预备堆之一。这些预备堆的牌可以移到牌列本体或王牌区。"

msgid "Deal cards from the stock one at a time. You go through the talon twice. During the first deal, each card must be played to one of three special reserve piles. The top card from any of these can be moved to the foundations only. When redealing, these reserve piles are put together to form a new deck. During the second deal, these reserve piles are unused, and cards are simply dealt to the waste pile."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张，一共走两轮。第一轮每张牌都必须放到三个特殊预备堆之一，各堆最上面那张只能移到王牌区。循环发牌时，这些预备堆会合并成新一副牌。第二轮不使用预备堆，牌只直接发到弃牌堆。"

msgid "Deal cards from the stock two at a time. Pairs of cards of the same rank can be moved to the foundation. Once the stock is empty, the two piles are flipped over and create a new stock."
msgstr "牌山每次发两张。点数相同的两张牌可以移到王牌区。牌山发完后，把两堆翻过来组成新的牌山。"

msgid "Deal cards from the talon one at a time, and these cards can be moved to the tableau or foundation. One redeal is allowed, so you can go through the deck twice."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张，这些牌可移到牌列或王牌区。允许循环发牌 1 次，所以一副牌可以走两轮。"

msgid "Deal cards from the talon one at a time. You can move cards from the tableau to build the waste stack up or down by alternate color. Kings cannot be moved to the waste stack."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张。你可以从牌列移牌到弃牌堆，依红黑交替递增或递减叠放。K 不能移到弃牌堆。"

msgid "Deal cards one at a time from the stock. Cards from the waste pile can be moved to the foundation, building up or down by rank. You are allowed to redeal twice, meaning you can go through the deck a total of three times."
msgstr "牌山每次发一张。弃牌堆的牌可移到王牌区，依点数递增或递减叠放。你可以循环发牌 2 次，也就是整副牌总共能走 3 轮。"

msgid "Deal first cards to foundations"
msgstr "开局先发牌到王牌区"

msgid "Deal five cards to your hand. Cards in your hand may be either moved to one of twelve columns, discarded, or held. Any card can be played to an empty column, but if a column is not empty, only a card of the same suit but a lower rank can be played on the column."
msgstr "发五张牌到手牌。手里的牌可以移到十二列中的某一列、弃掉、或留着不动。空列可以放任何一张牌；列里已有牌时，只能放同花色但点数较低的牌。"

msgid "Deal five cribbage hands to get a total score of 80 points or more."
msgstr "玩五局克里比奇手牌，总分要达到 80 点或以上。"

msgid "Deal four cards at a time from the deck. These cards represent the dungeon room. After dealing cards, you may either run, or attempt to clear the room. If you run, click the talon, place the four cards at the bottom of the deck, and deal four new cards. But you may not run from two rooms in a row."
msgstr "一次从牌堆发四张牌，这四张代表地牢的房间。发完牌后，你可以逃跑，或试着清房。想逃跑就点牌山，让这四张回到牌堆底部，再发四张新的。但不能连续两个房间都逃。"

msgid "Deal four cribbage hands to get a total score of 80 points or more."
msgstr "玩四局克里比奇手牌，总分要达到 80 点或以上。"

msgid "Deal the eight kings to eight tableau piles. Then, deal five cards on top of each king - the bottom-most one face-down and the others face-up."
msgstr "把八张 K 发到八个牌列堆，再在每张 K 上面发五张牌——最底那张面朝下，其余面朝上。"

msgid "Deauville"
msgstr "多维尔"

msgid "Decade, and its related games, can be played with cards dealt manually by the player one at a time, or all cards dealt at once. This option can be set in the options menu."
msgstr "年代（Decade）及其相关游戏，可以由玩家一张张手动发牌，也可以一次把所有牌发完。这个选项能在选项菜单里设定。"

msgid "Decide carefully if you build the foundations up or down."
msgstr "王牌区要递增还是递减，要仔细决定。"

msgid "Deck is a variation of"
msgstr "Deck 是下列玩法的变化版"

