msgid "Diamonds represent weapons. You can collect one and play it to the weapon space. If a weapon was previously played here, discard it, along with any slain monsters played next to it."
msgstr "方块代表武器。你可以拿到一张并打到武器格。若这里已有先前放上的武器，就把它连同旁边被击毙的怪物牌一起弃掉。"

