msgid "Each deal flips one card from the Stock to each pile of the Tableau. There are no redeals."
msgstr "每次发牌从牌山翻一张到每个牌列堆。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Each deal flips one card from the Stock to the top of each of the reserve piles. There is no redeal."
msgstr "每次发牌从牌山翻一张到每个预备堆的最上面。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Each foundation must be started with a card with the same suit as the card in the foundation directly to the left (except in the leftmost column, of course)."
msgstr "每个王牌区的第一张牌，花色必须与左边相邻王牌区里那张相同（最左边那一列当然除外）。"

msgid "Each tile placed on the board scores depending on the number of adjacent tiles. Tiles placed on the edge of the play area do not score:"
msgstr "每放上一块牌块的分数，取决于相邻牌块的数量。放在游戏区边缘的牌块不计分："

