msgid "Grandmother's Game is a complex strategic solitaire game which cannot be solved very often. A good way to get to a satisfactory solution is to establish at least one, better two or even more, free spaces to get room for moving the cards and fit them together to descending suits."
msgstr "奶奶的游戏（Grandmother's Game）是一款复杂的策略接龙，很少能解开。想解得漂亮，最好先腾出至少一个、理想是两个甚至更多空位，才有空间移动牌、把它们凑成同花色的递减顺子。"

