msgid "Group all cards on the tableau in sets of 13 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Ace to King. The first row in Club, the second in Spade, the third in Heart and the last in Diamond."
msgstr "把牌列上所有牌整理成 13 张一组、依花色从 A 递增排到 K。第一排梅花、第二排黑桃、第三排红心、最后一排方块。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 12 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Ace to King."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 12 张一组、依花色从 A 递增排到 K。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 12 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Ace to Queen. There may be empty spaces between but not within such sequences. The tableau wraps around."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 12 张一组、依花色从 A 递增排到 Q。顺子之间可以有空位，但顺子内部不行。牌列是首尾相连的。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Two to King, plus one of 22 with the trump of 2 to the Fool/Skiz."
