msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in descending sequence by same suit and move such sets to the foundations. The sequence may wrap around."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成同花色 13 张一组的递减顺子，并将这些组移到王牌区。顺子可以循环相接。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in descending sequence by suit and move such sets to the foundations."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成依花色 13 张一组的递减顺子，再移到王牌区。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in descending sequence by suit from King to Ace and move such sets to the Foundations."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成依花色从 K 递减到 A 的 13 张一组，再移到王牌区。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 17 cards in ascending sequence by suit from 1 to 16, with a wizard at the end of each row."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 17 张一组、依花色从 1 递增排到 16，每排最后再放一张法师。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 8 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Seven to King."
