msgid "Hungary = 1015"
msgstr "匈牙利 = 1015"

msgid "Hunter"
msgstr "猎人"

msgid "Hussars"
msgstr "骠骑兵"

msgid "I created Daddy Longlegs in the early 1980's to amuse myself with a different solitaire variant. Over the years, I have implemented this game many times under the name of \"Deal Four\" as an exercise when learning new programming languages."
msgstr "我在 1980 年代初设计长腿爸爸（Daddy Longlegs），想以另一种接龙变体自我娱乐。多年来，我曾数度重制这个游戏，名为「Deal Four」，作为学习新编程语言的练习。"

msgid "I first met Gypsy almost fifteen years ago in the nice Atari ST game"
msgstr "约十五年前，我在一款很棒的 Atari ST 游戏中初次认识吉普赛"

msgid "I learned of pysol in 2006 and almost immediately realized that it is a perfect platform for Daddy Longlegs. Thank you, Markus Oberhumer!"
msgstr "我在 2006 年得知 pysol，几乎立刻察觉它是长腿爸爸的完美平台。多谢，Markus Oberhumer！"

msgid "I received an error that there is no module named \"formatter\"."
msgstr "我收到错误消息，指出没有名为 \"formatter\" 的模块。"

