msgid "ISHIDO DECK"
msgstr "伊希多牌组"

msgid "Idle Year"
msgstr "悠闲之年"

msgid "If a card can legally be played on an existing foundation, it cannot be used to start a new one."
msgstr "一张牌若合法能放到既有的王牌区，就不能拿去开新的王牌区。"

msgid "If a game has a foundation, the game is usually won by placing all the cards in the foundation pile(s)."
msgstr "若游戏有王牌区，通常要设法把所有牌都放进王牌区堆才算获胜。"

msgid "If a game of Anno Domini is saved and loaded, it will continue to use the year that the game was started in."
msgstr "公元（Anno Domini）的游戏若存档再加载，会沿用该局开始时的年份。"

msgid "If a king would be dealt to the tableau, the current tableau pile is completed, and the king is used to start a new pile. Cards are dealt to this pile before the next pile."
msgstr "若 K 将被发入牌列，目前的牌列堆即算完成，并以这张 K 另起新堆。接下来的牌会先发到这个堆，再发下一个堆。"

msgid "If a pair of black jokers is flipped, the game is lost. If all eight sequences are removed before this happens, the game is won."
msgstr "只要翻出一对黑色鬼牌即算输。若在此之前把全部八组顺子移除，即算获胜。"

msgid "If a pile in the tableau is emptied, all of the face-up cards on the tableau pile directly to the right of it are moved to fill the empty pile. If there are no cards to the right of it, the tableau pile remains empty, and can be filled with a king."
msgstr "若牌列中有一堆被清空，其右边那个牌列堆上的所有明牌会移入该空堆。若它右边没有牌，该牌列堆保持空的，并可放入一张 K。"

msgid "If a queen would be dealt to the tableau, the current tableau pile is completed, and the queen is used to start a new pile. Cards are dealt to this pile before the next pile."
msgstr "若 Q 将被发入牌列，目前的牌列堆即算完成，并以这张 Q 另起新堆。接下来的牌会先发到这个堆，再发下一个堆。"

msgid "If a red joker is flipped, all of the remaining unmatched cards that were not flipped are reshuffled and redealt (after you've flipped all three cards)."
msgstr "若翻出红色鬼牌，其余尚未翻开且未成对的牌会全部重新洗牌并重发（在你翻完三张牌之后）。"

msgid "If all of the face-up cards on a tableau pile are removed, the face-down cards are dealt to the other tableau piles, one on each (none to the pile that was just exposed). Then, if there are cards left in the talon, eight more cards are dealt to that empty pile in the same manner as before. If there are no cards left in the talon, that tableau pile remains empty, and any card or sequence can be moved to it."
msgstr "若某牌列堆上的明牌全被移除，其暗牌会逐张发到其他牌列堆（每堆一张，刚露出的那堆除外）。然后若牌山还有牌，会以先前相同的方式再发八张补入该空堆。若牌山已无牌，该牌列堆保持空的，任何牌或顺子都可移入。"

msgid "If any reserves are used, the top card of the tableau pile next to it is flipped face-down and that pile can't be used until that reserve is emptied."
msgstr "若使用了预备堆，该堆旁牌列堆的顶牌会翻成暗面，且在该预备堆清空前，该堆都不能使用。"

