msgstr "若上方的免责声明与责任限制无法依其条款产生当地法律效力，审理法院应适用最接近于完全放弃与本程序相关之一切民事责任的当地法律，除非随本程序副本附有担保或责任承担以换取费用。"

msgid "If the reserve contains multiple visible cards of the same suit, only the one with the lowest rank can be used to start a foundation."
msgstr "若预备堆中有多张同花色的明牌，只有点数最低的那张能用来开创王牌区。"

msgid "If the top card of the reserve can be moved to the foundation, it is done so immediately, then all of the cards in the foundation are immediately moved to a second foundation on the right. Then, the first foundation is built with the starting card based on the next card in the reserve."
msgstr "若预备堆顶牌可移至王牌区，便立即移入；接着该王牌区的所有牌立即移入右侧的第二王牌区。然后依预备堆的下一张牌作为起始牌，重建第一个王牌区。"

msgid "If there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the stock to all 24 piles."
msgstr "若已无步可走，你可以从牌山对全部 24 个牌堆各发一张牌。"

msgid "If there are still cards in the talon, three cards are dealt from the talon to fill in empty tableau piles. Once the talon is empty, empty tableau piles can no longer be filled."
msgstr "若牌山仍有牌，会从牌山发三张补入空的牌列堆。牌山一旦清空，空的牌列堆便不能再补。"

msgid "If two peaks are empty the points added are quadrupled."
msgstr "若两个峰都是空的，加分会变成四倍。"

msgid "If you add terms to a covered work in accord with this section, you must place, in the relevant source files, a statement of the additional terms that apply to those files, or a notice indicating where to find the applicable terms."
msgstr "若你依本节规定在受涵盖作品中加入条款，必须在相关源文件中放置声明，说明那些文件适用哪些附加条款，或放置通知指出可取得附加条款的位置。"

msgid "If you are getting your copy from your Linux distribution's package manager, please contact the people who maintain the packages for your distribution. You can always get the latest version from the PySolFC website or from Flathub."
msgstr "若你的副本来自 Linux 发行版的套件管理器，请联系该发行版的套件维护者。你也可以随时从 PySolFC 网站或 Flathub 获取最新版本。"

msgid "If you are stuck, you can deal one card from the talon to the top of each tableau pile."
msgstr "若你卡住了，可以从牌山对每个牌列堆顶各发一张牌。"

msgid "If you are using a cardsets package from a Linux distribution, it may not align with the app if running from source or a different installer. Uninstall the distro's cardsets package and install the one from SourceForge."
msgstr "若你使用 Linux 发行版的 cardsets 套件，而程序是取自源代码或另有安装来源，两者可能不兼容。请移除发行版的 cardsets 套件，改安装 SourceForge 上的版本。"

msgid "If you clear a space at the bottom it will be automatically filled with a card from the talon. But if the talon is gone and you clear a space at the bottom, then you can fill it with any card. When no further moves are possible, click on the talon for a fresh row of cards at the bottom."
msgstr "若你在底部清出一个空位，会自动由牌山的牌补上。但牌山已空而你在底部清出空位时，就能以任意牌补入。当无步可走时，点一下牌山，底部就会出现新的一排牌。"

msgid "If you clear a space at the bottom it will get automatically filled with a card from the talon. But if the talon is gone and you clear a space at the bottom, then you can fill it with any card. When no further moves are possible, click on the talon for a fresh row of cards at the bottom."
msgstr "若你在底部清出一个空位，会自动由牌山的牌补上。但牌山已空而你在底部清出空位时，就能以任意牌补入。当无步可走时，点一下牌山，底部就会出现新的一排牌。"

msgid "If you clear a space at the bottom it will get automatically filled with a card from the talon. If the talon is empty, clear spaces in the talon cannot be filled."
msgstr "若你在底部清出一个空位，会自动由牌山的牌补上。若牌山已空，底部清出的空位就无法再补牌。"

