msgid "If you do not want to exchange a card just click on the talon."
msgstr "若不想交换某张牌，直接点牌山即可。"

msgid "If you don't want to score a lost game you can temporarily change the player options."
msgstr "若不想让输掉的游戏列入成绩，你可以暂时变更玩家选项。"

msgid "If you found a bug in PySolFC, the best place to report it is on GitHub. To do so, create an issue at"
msgstr "如果你在 PySolFC 中发现错误，最好的报告渠道是 GitHub。要提交，请在"

msgid "If you get a missing cardset types warning, update the cardsets package. Certain games may not work properly otherwise."
msgstr "若出现缺少 cardset 类型的警告，请更新 cardsets 套件。否则某些游戏可能无法正常运作。"

msgid "If you have an enhancement or a new feature for PySolFC you'd like to request, this can also be done by creating issues in the same place."
msgstr "若想为 PySolFC 建议改进或新功能，也可以在同样的地方提交 issue。"

msgid "If you try to clear the room, you must play three of the four cards, as follows:"
msgstr "若想清掉一个房间，必须打出四张牌中的三张，方式如下："

msgid "If you use a hint, the game will be marked as a loss if completed. However, if you enable the \"Free Hints\" option, the game will be marked as a win, just not a perfect game."
msgstr "若使用提示，完成游戏时会被记为输。但若启用「免费提示」选项，游戏会被记为赢，只是不算完美游戏。"

msgid "If you want a variation without this rule, you can play Relaxed Spider instead."
msgstr "若想要不含这条规则的变化玩法，可以改玩宽松蜘蛛。"

msgid "If you win a game without using"
msgstr "若你赢得一局游戏，且过程中没有使用"

msgid "If you're confused by all this, just watch a demo game :-)"
msgstr "若觉得这些太复杂，看一场示范游戏就懂了 :-)"

