msgid "In the following three paragraphs, a \"patent license\" is any express agreement or commitment, however denominated, not to enforce a patent (such as an express permission to practice a patent or covenant not to sue for patent infringement). To \"grant\" such a patent license to a party means to make such an agreement or commitment not to enforce a patent against the party."
msgstr "在本节以下三段中，「专利许可」指任何明示的协议或承诺（无论名称为何），表明不执行某专利（例如明示允许实施专利的许可，或不提起专利侵权诉讼的承诺）。向一方「授予」此种专利许可，意即作出不在该方行使专利的此种协议或承诺。"

msgid "In the game, the Queen of Hearts represents Fair Rosamund, the King represents King Henry II, with the Jack representing a sinister assailant who wants to take Rosamund for himself. The circle of cards around the queen are the guards of her bower, and the face-down stack under the king are the king's guards. At the end of the game, the king and queen are together at the bottom of the deck, symbolizing Henry II united in love with Fair Rosamund."
msgstr "游戏中，红心 Q 代表美女罗莎蒙（Fair Rosamund），K 代表亨利二世国王，J 代表想强夺罗莎蒙的邪恶歹徒。包围王后的一圈牌是她凉亭的侍卫，国王下方暗扣的牌堆是国王的卫兵。游戏结尾，国王与王后同处牌组最底，象征亨利二世与美女罗莎蒙因爱结合。"

msgid "In the rules written by Lady Cadogan, the queen of diamonds and eight kings are placed above the foundations, with the queen being the \"Sovereign\", the red kings being the \"Judges\", and the black kings the \"Bishops\". Since their role is entirely thematic and decorative, this is left out of most modern variants of the game, though it does explain why they are omitted from the deck."
msgstr "在卡多根夫人（Lady Cadogan）撰写的规则里，方块 Q 与八张 K 放在王牌区上方，其中 Q 是「君主」，红色 K 是「法官」，黑色 K 是「主教」。由于这些角色纯属主题与装饰，多数现代变体都略去了它们，但这也解释了为什么牌组中没有这些牌。"

msgid "In this game, the foundations are often called the \"Government\" with the tableau called the \"Constitution\", the top row being the \"Privy Council\" and the bottom being the \"People Row\"."
msgstr "在这个游戏中，王牌区常被称为「政府」，牌列称为「宪法」，第一横排是「枢密院」，最后一横排是「平民列」。"

msgid "In this game, the red cards are called \"fire\" cards and the black cards are called \"ice\" cards. The object is to move all of the \"fire\" cards to the leftmost five tableau piles, and all the \"ice\" cards to the rightmost five. When dealing, a gap is left between the two sets of tableau piles to show this clearer."
msgstr "这个游戏中，红牌称作「火」牌，黑牌称作「冰」牌。目标是把所有「火」牌移到最左侧的五个牌列堆，把所有「冰」牌移到最右侧的五个。发牌时两组牌列堆之间会留一个空档，让分野更清楚。"

msgid "In variations with scoring, undo is disabled in this game."
msgstr "在有计分的变体中，这个游戏停用复原。"

