msgstr "在取下一轮牌之前，尽量多出牌，别让太多预备堆被填满。优先设法把罗阇（Raja）与 Pradhan 归位。"

msgid "Make every play possible before dealing the next round. While the cards will play in rank order only, it's helpful to also work on playing them by suit."
