msgid "Move 103 cards (all cards except the last King) to the foundations."
msgstr "把 103 张牌（除最后一张 K 外的所有牌）移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move 51 cards (all cards except the last King) to the foundations."
msgstr "把 51 张牌（除最后一张 K 外的所有牌）移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all but one card to the single foundation."
msgstr "除一张牌外，把所有牌移到单一王牌区。"

msgid "Move all but two cards to the single foundation."
msgstr "除两张牌外，把所有牌移到单一王牌区。"

msgid "Move all cards except the four Aces and the Fool to the single foundation."
msgstr "除 4 张 A 与愚者（Fool）外，把所有牌移到单一王牌区。"

msgid "Move all cards except the four Kings to the single foundation."
msgstr "除 4 张 K 外，把所有牌移到单一王牌区。"

msgid "Move all cards except the kings to the waste stack."
msgstr "除 K 外，把所有牌移到弃牌堆。"

msgid "Move all cards except the picture cards to the single foundation. The picture cards are to be arranged in the tableau with the jacks in the corners, kings on the top and bottom, and queens on the sides."
msgstr "除人头牌外，把所有牌移到单一王牌区。人头牌要在牌列中排成：J 在四角，K 在上、下两排，Q 在两侧。"

msgid "Move all cards to the Foundation."
msgstr "把所有牌移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all cards to the bottom in a single row."
msgstr "把所有牌移到最下方，排成一个横排。"

msgid "Move all cards to the columns."
msgstr "把所有牌移到各直行。"

msgid "Move all cards to the correct pile in the tableau, before the fourth king is revealed, and the extra pile you drew a card from is filled."
msgstr "在第四张 K 翻出、且你抽过牌的那个额外牌堆被填满之前，把所有牌移到牌列中正确的堆。"

msgid "Move all cards to the correct pile in the tableau, before the fourth king is revealed."
msgstr "在第四张 K 翻出之前，把所有牌移到牌列中正确的堆。"

msgid "Move all cards to the different foundations."
msgstr "把所有牌移到各自的王牌区。"

msgid "Move all cards to the tableau"
msgstr "把所有牌移到牌列"

msgid "Move all cards to the tableau, in eight columns with complete sequences from ace to king."
msgstr "把所有牌移到牌列，排成八直行，每行都是从 A 到 K 的完整顺子。"

msgid "Move all cards to the tableau, in four columns with two complete sequences each from ace to king, from ace to king, then wrapping around, and up to king again."
msgstr "把所有牌移到牌列，排成四直行，每行各含两组完整顺子：从 A 叠到 K，接着循环转回 A，再叠到 K。"

msgid "Move all of the cards except the queens to the foundations."
msgstr "除 Q 外，把所有牌移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all of the cards to the rightmost stack."
msgstr "把所有牌移到最右边的堆。"

msgid "Move all suit cards to the Foundations."
msgstr "把所有花色的牌移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the cards except the picture cards to the foundations."
msgstr "除人头牌外，把所有牌移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the cards to the foundation in a single sequence."
msgstr "把所有牌以单一顺子移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the cards to the foundation."
msgstr "把所有牌移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the cards to the foundations, except for the kings."
msgstr "除 K 外，把所有牌移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the cards to the right foundation."
msgstr "把所有牌移到正确的王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the cards to the upper step/foundations."
msgstr "把所有牌移到上阶／王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the hearts to the foundation."
msgstr "把所有红心移到王牌区。"

msgid "Move all the red \"fire\" cards to the left five tableau piles and the black \"ice\" cards to the right five tableau piles."
msgstr "把所有红色「火」牌移到左侧五个牌列堆，黑色「冰」牌移到右侧五个牌列堆。"

msgid "Move all tiles to the playing area, and get the highest score possible."
msgstr "把所有牌块移到游戏区，并尽量拿到最高分。"

msgid "Move cards back and forth on the rows to make every play possible on the first pass through the talon. Don't let the waste stack get too deep on the second pass."
msgstr "让牌在横排之间来回移动，确保第一轮过牌山时每一张都出得掉。第二轮过牌山时，别让弃牌堆累积太深。"

msgid "Move cards back and forth on the rows to make every play possible. Don't let the waste stack get too deep."
msgstr "让牌在横排之间来回移动，确保每一张都出得掉。别让弃牌堆累积太深。"

msgid "Move cards off of the deepest stacks first."
msgstr "优先清掉最长的堆。"

msgid "Move cards one at a time from the tableau to the foundation in sequence. There are four free cells. Cards from the tableau can be moved to them, but from the free cells, they can only be moved to the foundation later. The game is won if all the cards can be moved to the foundation in a single continuous sequence."
msgstr "一次一张，把牌列的牌依顺序移到王牌区。有四个自由格。牌列的牌可以移进自由格，但从自由格只能再移到王牌区。所有牌能以一条连续顺子移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "Move cards to the foundations until the top of each foundation is the clock number for that position. Jack equals 11, Queen equals 12, and Aces must be placed on Kings."
msgstr "移牌到王牌区，直到每个王牌区的顶牌等于该位置对应的时钟点数。J 等于 11，Q 等于 12，A 必须放在 K 上。"

msgid "Move cards to the foundations until the top of each foundation is the clock number for that position. Jack equals 11, Queen equals 12, and Aces must be placed on Kings. The foundations are built up by same suit."
msgstr "移牌到王牌区，直到每个王牌区的顶牌等于该位置对应的时钟点数。J 等于 11，Q 等于 12，A 必须放在 K 上。王牌区依同花色递增叠放。"

msgid "Move four cards to each of the seven tableau piles, with each pile totaling 10."
msgstr "发四张牌到七个牌列堆的每一个，使每堆点数合计为 10。"

msgid "Move the tableau cards with the objective of releasing the Aces first. Keep the reserve stacks open as much as possible. Build piles on the Mirs so they can be moved to open rows."
msgstr "移牌时以先释出 A 为优先目标。尽量让预备堆保持空着。在 Mir 上叠牌，好让它能移到空的横排。"

