msgid "Obstruction is an original game by PySol developer Joe R. It is designed as a more strategic version of Michael Keller's Ephemeral FreeCell, requiring the player to block two of the free cells as the game progresses."
msgstr "阻断（Obstruction）是 PySol 开发者 Joe R. 的原创游戏，设计为比 Michael Keller 的 Ephemeral FreeCell 更具策略性的版本，要求玩家随着牌局推进封锁两个自由格。"

msgid "Ocean Towers"
msgstr "海洋高塔（Ocean Towers）"

msgid "Of the remaining cards, they are dealt to eight piles of four cards each, with only the top cards face-up, and nine cards are dealt to a reserve. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles, and single cards from the top of the reserve can be moved to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "剩下的牌发成 8 堆，每堆 4 张，只有顶牌正面朝上，另发 9 张到预备堆。牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放，牌列堆之间可移动单张牌或有效顺子，预备堆顶端可拿单张牌移到牌列或王牌区。"

msgid "Old Mole"
msgstr "老鼹鼠（Old Mole）"

msgid "Old Patience"
msgstr "老式接龙（Old Patience）"

msgid "Oliver Xymoron &lt;oxymoron@waste.org&gt;"
msgstr "Oliver Xymoron &lt;oxymoron@waste.org&gt;"

msgid "On the bottom row, a set of found foundations built up by same suit using odd-numbered ranks, from ace to jack. These are built in the sequence A-3-5-7-9-J. The remaining four aces are dealt to these foundations."
msgstr "底排是一组王牌区，依同花色用奇数点从 A 递增叠到 J，顺序为 A-3-5-7-9-J。其余 4 张 A 发到这些王牌区上。"

msgid "On the bottom row, two pairs of foundations on each side of the ace foundation mentioned above. These are built up by suit from twos, using the even numbered ranks, in the sequence 2-4-6-8-10-Q. A two of each suit is dealt to each of these."
msgstr "底排另有两对王牌区，位于上述 A 王牌区的两侧。这些王牌区依花色从 2 起、用偶数点递增叠放，顺序为 2-4-6-8-10-Q。每个王牌区各发一张该花色的 2。"

msgid "On the top row, four foundations built up by same suit from ace to king. An ace of each suit is dealt to each of these."
msgstr "上排有四个王牌区，依同花色从 A 递增叠到 K。每种花色的 A 各发到一个王牌区。"

msgid "On the top row, to the left and right of the first foundations, two pairs of foundations that only accept a single king of each suit each."
msgstr "上排中，最初那组王牌区的左右两侧各有两对王牌区，每个王牌区对每种花色只收一张 K。"

msgid "Once a card from the seven piles is moved, that pile is split into two separate piles, with the top card of both being playable. Piles with only one card that are formed this way turn into foundations, and are built up by same suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "七个堆中任何一堆被移走一张牌后，该堆就拆成两堆，两堆的顶牌都可出。这样形成的单张牌堆会转成王牌区，依同花色递增叠放，必要时从 K 转回 A 循环。"

msgid "Once a foundation is filled, cards are no longer dealt to the tableau pile directly below it. The game is won if all the cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "一旦王牌区叠满，就不再直接发牌到它正下方的牌列堆。把所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "Once all of the cards have been dealt to the tableau, tableau piles containing only the queens can be treated as empty piles, and any single card can be moved to them."
msgstr "所有牌都发入牌列后，只剩 Q 的牌列堆可视为空列，任何单张牌都能移到上面。"

msgid "Once all of the cards have been moved into the grid, another card from the deck is flipped up to be used as the starter. The starter is mostly treated as a fifth card for each hand. The starter cannot be moved to reserve or waste stacks."
msgstr "所有牌都移进格子后，从牌组再翻出一张作为起手牌。起手牌大致视为每手牌的第五张。起手牌不能移到预备堆或弃牌堆。"

msgid "Once all of the cards have been moved to the zodiac and equator, and the talon and waste pile are both empty, you can start to move cards to the foundations. Also, at this point, cards can be moved between piles in the zodiac."
msgstr "所有牌都移到黄道与赤道，且牌山与弃牌堆都空之后，才可以开始把牌移到王牌区。也是从这时起，黄道各堆之间可以互相移牌。"

msgid "Once all three cards have been played correctly, the monster is slain, and all four cards are immediately removed (to the foundation). Cards in the tableau cannot be moved or removed otherwise."
msgstr "三张牌都正确打出后，怪兽即被斩杀，四张牌立刻移除（移到王牌区）。除此之外，牌列的牌不能移动或移除。"

msgid "Once no more cards can be moved, twenty cards are dealt from the talon, one at a time, and can be moved to reserve piles. Until all twenty cards have been moved (or the talon is empty) no further cards can be moved from the reserve to the foundation. Cards dealt from the talon may be moved directly to foundations, but these do not count towards the twenty."
msgstr "当无牌可移时，从牌山一次一张共发 20 张，可移到预备堆。在这 20 张全部移走（或牌山发完）之前，不能从预备堆移任何牌到王牌区。从牌山发的牌可直接移到王牌区，但不算在那 20 张之内。"

msgid "Once the first foundation card is chosen, deal five cards into the remaining five tableau piles. Cards may be moved between tableau piles one at a time, building down by alternating colors. Sequences can turn the corner, so kings can be played on aces. If a tableau pile is empty, fill the pile using the card from the top of the waste pile, or the stock if it's empty. If both are empty, any other card from the tableau may be moved there to fill the space."
msgstr "选定第一张王牌区基牌后，发 5 张牌到剩余的 5 个牌列堆。牌列堆之间一次只能移动一张牌，采红黑交替递减叠放。顺子可以首尾循环，所以 A 上可以放 K。若牌列堆空了，用弃牌堆顶牌补，弃牌堆也空就从牌山补。两边都空时，可从牌列拿任何其他牌过去补位。"

msgid "Once the stock and waste piles are empty, the last chance card is flipped up and can be played to a foundation pile."
msgstr "牌山与弃牌堆都空后，会翻开最后机会牌，可打到王牌区。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you are allowed additional redeals, by taking the pile in the bottom right, and dealing the cards from it to other tableau piles, one each, starting with the pile directly to the right of it (or the top left pile for the bottom right pile). After this, you can do the same for each tableau pile, going right to left, bottom to top, until you've redealt each pile once."
msgstr "牌山清空后，允许额外的循环发牌：拿起右下角的堆，把牌逐张发到其他牌列堆，从它正右边的堆开始（右下角那堆则从左上堆开始）。之后每个牌列堆依样处理，由右至左、由下至上，直到每堆都重发过一次。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you can combine the tableau piles, placing the rightmost one on top of the next rightmost one, and so on. You can redeal like this twice in the game."
msgstr "牌山清空后，你可以合并牌列堆，把最右的堆叠到右数第二堆上，依此类推。一局里可以这样循环发牌两次。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you can pick up the tableau piles and combine them to form a new talon. You can do this as many times as necessary."
msgstr "牌山清空后，你可以收起牌列堆，合并成新的牌山。需要的话可以做任意多次。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you may move cards between the stacks, building down by suit, or playing any card on empty stacks once the waste pile is empty. The game is won when all of the foundations are filled."
msgstr "牌山清空后，你可以在各堆之间移牌，依花色递减叠放；弃牌堆也空之后，任何牌都可以放到空堆。所有王牌区都叠满即获胜。"

msgid "Once there is only one open space in the grid remaining, the last four cards in the deck are dealt out and you can play any one of them into the last space. The game is won if 49 cards can be successfully played into the grid."
msgstr "当格子里只剩最后一个空格时，会发出牌组最后 4 张牌，你可以任选一张填入那个空格。成功填入 49 张牌即获胜。"

msgid "Once three cards have been played, deal three new cards from the talon to replace them to set up the next room."
msgstr "打出 3 张牌后，从牌山发 3 张新牌补上，布置下一个房间。"

msgid "Once you've set the configuration options, you can start the solver, and then demo the found solution."
msgstr "设定完配置选项后，就可以启动解题器，再演示找到的解法。"

msgid "One Away Three Away"
msgstr "差一差三（One Away Three Away）"

msgid "One Dashavatara Ganjifa deck. No redeal."
msgstr "1 副达萨瓦塔拉甘吉发牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "One Foundation"
msgstr "单一王牌区（One Foundation）"

msgid "One Jack and Queen of diamonds are dealt to the foundations. An additional card is dealt to each of sixteen tableau piles. There are two sets of foundations, one built down by rank from Jack to Queen, and the other built up from Queen to Jack, all turning the corner from King to Ace or Ace to King as necessary. Each set contains one foundation of each suit."
msgstr "方块 J 与方块 Q 各一张发到王牌区。另发一张牌到 16 个牌列堆。王牌区分成两组：一组依点数从 J 递减叠到 Q，另一组从 Q 递增叠到 J，必要时从 K 转到 A 或从 A 转到 K 循环。每组王牌区各含每种花色一个。"

msgid "One Mughal Ganjifa deck. No redeal."
msgstr "1 副莫卧儿甘吉发牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "One adjacent tile: 1 point"
msgstr "相邻 1 个牌块：1 分"

msgid "One can deal all"
msgstr "玩家可以一次全部发出"

msgid "One can optionally load the Freecell Solver and the Black Hole Solver using their DLLs (for better speed)."
msgstr "可以选择通过 DLL 加载 Freecell Solver 与 Black Hole Solver（速度更快）。"

msgid "One card is dealt to the foundations at the start of the game. This card determines the base rank of the foundations. The foundations are built up by suit, wrapping from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "开局发一张牌到王牌区，这张牌决定王牌区的基础点数。王牌区依花色递增叠放，必要时从 K 循环到 A。"

msgid "One card is flipped over at a time and moved onto one of eight the row stacks. There are no restrictions on which card may go where on the stacks. Once on a stack, a card can only be moved onto a foundation."
msgstr "每次翻开一张牌，移到八个横排堆之一。哪张牌能放哪个堆没有限制。牌一旦上了堆，就只能再移到王牌区。"

msgid "One card is flipped over at a time and moved onto one of four stacks. There are no restrictions on which card may go where on the stacks. Once on a stack, a card can only be moved onto a foundation."
msgstr "每次翻开一张牌，移到四个堆之一。哪张牌能放哪个堆没有限制。牌一旦上了堆，就只能再移到王牌区。"

msgid "One card is flipped over at a time and moved onto the stacks. There are no restrictions on which card may go where on the stacks. Once on a stack, a card can only be moved onto a foundation."
msgstr "每次翻开一张牌，移到堆上。哪张牌能放哪个堆没有限制。牌一旦上了堆，就只能再移到王牌区。"

msgid "One deck type. 1 deck. 2 redeals."
msgstr "单副牌类型。1 副牌。2 次循环发牌。"

msgid "One deck type. 1 deck. Varying number of redeals."
msgstr "单副牌类型。1 副牌。循环发牌次数不定。"

msgid "One deck type. 1 stripped deck. No redeal."
msgstr "单副牌类型。1 副精简牌组。不循环发牌。"

msgid "One king and ace of each suit are dealt to the foundations. Ten cards are dealt to a row in the tableau. Cards from the tableau can be moved to the foundations, with the foundations with the aces built up by same suit to king, and the foundations with the kings are built down by same suit to ace. There is no building in the tableau."
msgstr "每种花色各一张 K 与一张 A 发到王牌区。发 10 张牌到牌列的一横排。牌列的牌可移到王牌区：有 A 的王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠到 K，有 K 的王牌区依同花色从 K 递减叠到 A。牌列不可叠牌。"

msgid "One nine is dealt to the first foundation pile, and a tableau pile of cards is dealt underneath it. When each nine is dealt, that is dealt to the next foundation, and the next tableau pile is started underneath it, until all cards are dealt."
msgstr "一张 9 发到第一个王牌区，其下再发一叠牌。之后每张 9 发到下一个王牌区，并在下方另起牌列堆，直到所有牌发完。"

msgid "One set of foundations for each suit is built up by suit from ace to king, and one set is built down by suit from king to ace."
msgstr "每种花色的一组王牌区依花色从 A 递增叠到 K，另一组依花色从 K 递减叠到 A。"

msgid "One set of foundations is built up by same suit from ace to king, and a second is built down by same suit from king to ace. Each set of foundations gets one sequence for each suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "一组王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠到 K，另一组依同花色从 K 递减叠到 A。每组王牌区每种花色各一条顺子。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "One set of foundations is built up by same suit from ace to king, and the other is built down from king to ace. Each set of foundations gets one sequence for each suit. The game is won if all cards can be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "一组王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠到 K，另一组依同花色从 K 递减叠到 A。每组王牌区每种花色各一条顺子。所有牌都能移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "One tile left: 500 points"
msgstr "剩一个牌块：500 分"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 deck. 3 redeals."
msgstr "单副牌游戏类型。1 副牌。3 次循环发牌。"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 deck. Varying number of redeals."
msgstr "单副牌游戏类型。1 副牌。循环发牌次数不定。"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 decks. 2 redeals."
msgstr "单副牌游戏类型。1 副牌。2 次循环发牌。"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 stripped deck. No redeal."
msgstr "单副牌游戏类型。1 副精简牌组。不循环发牌。"

msgid "One-Handed"
msgstr "单手（One-Handed）"

msgid "Only a single card can be in the waste pile at a time. If there are no more moves, you can place the four tableau piles at the bottom of the deck, without shuffling them, then move the waste card to one of the piles, and deal a single card from the stock to the other three."
msgstr "弃牌堆一次只能放一张牌。若无步可走，可把四个牌列堆放到牌组最底而不洗牌，然后把弃牌堆那张移到其中一堆，并从牌山各发一张牌到其他三堆。"

msgid "Only kings or sequences that begin with kings can be moved to empty tableau piles. The game is won if all the cards can be arranged in four same suit sequences from king to ace."
msgstr "只有 K 或以 K 开头的顺子可以移到空的牌列堆。所有牌排成四条从 K 到 A 的同花色顺子即获胜。"

msgid "Only once all the other cards have been moved to the foundation can the Queen of Hearts or King of Spades be moved. Once they are moved to the foundation, and all cards have been moved to the foundation, the game is won."
msgstr "只有先把其他牌全部移入王牌区后，才能移动红心 Q 或黑桃 K。等这两张移到王牌区、且所有牌都已进入王牌区，即获胜。"

msgid "Only one card can be moved at a time and empty piles can be filled with any single card."
msgstr "一次只能移动一张牌，空列可用任何单张牌补上。"

msgid "Only the card that is of the same rank and suit as the top card of the waste can be moved. This card can be exchanged with any card on the same row or on the same column of the tableau."
msgstr "只有与弃牌堆顶牌点数、花色都相同的牌才能移动。这张牌可以与牌列中同一横排或同一直行上的任何牌交换。"

msgid "Only the next smaller card may be played, so that the stacks are in descending sequence except when the previous card is an Ace, in which only the King may be played."
msgstr "只能打出点数小一号的牌，因此各堆呈递减顺序；但上一张是 A 时，只能放 K。"

msgid "Only the top card is available for play on the piles. When no more moves are possible, click on the talon to deal a new card."
msgstr "每堆只有顶牌可以出牌。当无步可走时，点击牌山发一张新牌。"

msgid "Oonsoo Times Two"
msgstr "翁苏加倍（Oonsoo Times Two）"

msgid "Oonsoo Too"
msgstr "翁苏再来（Oonsoo Too）"

msgid "Open Jumbo"
msgstr "开放特大（Open Jumbo）"

msgid "Opening deal"
msgstr "开局发牌"

msgid "Operating Systems = 17"
msgstr "操作系统 = 17"

msgid "Order of Precedence"
msgstr "优先次序（Order of Precedence）"

msgid "Organize all cards in four columns with complete same suit sequences from king to ace."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成四直行，每行都是从 K 到 A 的完整同花色顺子。"

msgid "Osmium is based on an altered version of the Osmosis rules used in older versions of PySolFC."
msgstr "锇（Osmium）基于旧版 PySolFC 中渗透（Osmosis）规则的修改版。"

msgid "Other Types of Decks"
msgstr "其他副牌类型"

msgid "Other fixes and cleanups."
msgstr "其他修正与清理。"

msgid "Over 40 new games, bringing the total to 1,200!"
msgstr "新增超过 40 款游戏，总数达 1,200 款！"

msgid "PILE"
msgstr "PILE"

msgid "PUZZLE DECK"
msgstr "PUZZLE DECK"

msgid "Pack of Thieves"
msgstr "贼群（Pack of Thieves）"

msgid "Pair off cards until you empty the talon."
msgstr "把牌逐对配完，直到牌山清空。"

msgid "Pairing game type. 2 decks. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "配对游戏类型。2 副牌。无限循环发牌。"

msgid "Pairing type. 2 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "配对类型。2 副牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Pairs of cards can be removed when the numerical values of the two cards adds up to 13. Queen is worth 12 and Jack is worth 11. You do not have to follow suit."
msgstr "当两张牌的点数合计为 13 时，该牌对可以移除。Q 值 12，J 值 11。不必同一花色。"

msgid "Pairs of exposed cards between the top card of each column and the four reserve cards may be moved to the foundation. You win if all cards can be paired off."
msgstr "各直行顶牌与四张预备牌之间露出的牌对可移到王牌区。所有牌都能配对移除即获胜。"

msgid "Pairs of exposed number cards can be removed if they total up to 11. Jacks are removed in pairs. A queen can be removed if it is paired off with a king, but not if they are of the same suit. Removed cards are moved to a single foundation, and the game is won if all cards are paired off."
msgstr "露出的数字牌合计为 11 时可成对移除。J 要成对移除。Q 与 K 配对可移除，但同花色时不行。移除的牌移到同一王牌区，全部配对移除即获胜。"

msgid "Parashumrama"
msgstr "帕拉舒摩罗（Parashumrama）"

msgid "Parashurama"
msgstr "帕拉舒拉摩（Parashurama）"

msgid "Parisian"
msgstr "巴黎（Parisian）"

msgid "Park and Ride"
msgstr "停车转乘（Park and Ride）"

msgid "Partners"
msgstr "搭档（Partners）"

msgid "Patient Pairs (Open)"
msgstr "耐心配对（开放）（Patient Pairs (Open)）"

msgid "Paulownia - December"
msgstr "桐 - 十二月（Paulownia - December）"

msgid "Pause when showing statistics"
msgstr "显示统计数据时暂停"

msgid "Pegged"
msgstr "跳钉（Pegged）"

msgid "Pegged 6x6"
msgstr "跳钉 6x6（Pegged 6x6）"

msgid "Pegged 7x7"
msgstr "跳钉 7x7（Pegged 7x7）"

msgid "Pegged Cross 1"
msgstr "跳钉十字 1（Pegged Cross 1）"

msgid "Pegged Cross 2"
msgstr "跳钉十字 2（Pegged Cross 2）"

msgid "Pegged Diamond"
msgstr "跳钉菱形（Pegged Diamond）"

msgid "Pegged Hexagon"
msgstr "跳钉六角（Pegged Hexagon）"

msgid "Pegged Octagon"
msgstr "跳钉八角（Pegged Octagon）"

msgid "Pegged Star"
msgstr "跳钉星形（Pegged Star）"

msgid "Pegged Triangle 1"
msgstr "跳钉三角 1（Pegged Triangle 1）"

msgid "Pegged Triangle 2"
msgstr "跳钉三角 2（Pegged Triangle 2）"

msgid "Pegged is a classic puzzle game also known as pegged solitaire. It is traditionally played with pegs on a board rather than cards."
msgstr "跳钉（Pegged）是经典益智游戏，又称跳钉接龙（pegged solitaire），传统上是在棋盘上移动木钉，而不是用牌来玩。"

msgid "Pelmanism"
msgstr "记忆配对（Pelmanism）"

msgid "Penguin was invented by David Parlett, and the original rules can be found"
msgstr "企鹅（Penguin）由 David Parlett 发明，原始规则请见"

msgid "Peony - June"
msgstr "牡丹 - 六月（Peony - June）"

msgid "People = 19"
msgstr "人物 = 19"

msgid "Persian Patience"
msgstr "波斯接龙（Persian Patience）"

msgid "Phase One -- Click on the Stock to move a card into the empty Waste pile. If card is a:"
msgstr "第一阶段 -- 点击牌山，把一张牌移入空的弃牌堆。若该牌是："

msgid "Phase Two -- Remove 10's singly by clicking on them. Remove pairs that add up to 10 by dragging one card on top of its pair."
msgstr "第二阶段 -- 点击 10 可单独移除。把一张牌拖到它的配对牌上，即可移除合计为 10 的牌对。"

msgid "Picture Gallery (Die Bildgallerie)"
msgstr "画廊（Picture Gallery (Die Bildgallerie)）"

msgid "Picture Gallery type. 2 decks. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "画廊类型。2 副牌。无限循环发牌。"

msgid "Picture Matrix 10x10"
msgstr "图片矩阵 10x10（Picture Matrix 10x10）"

msgid "Picture Matrix 3x3"
msgstr "图片矩阵 3x3（Picture Matrix 3x3）"

msgid "Picture Matrix 4x4"
msgstr "图片矩阵 4x4（Picture Matrix 4x4）"

msgid "Picture Matrix 5x5"
msgstr "图片矩阵 5x5（Picture Matrix 5x5）"

msgid "Picture Matrix 6x6"
msgstr "图片矩阵 6x6（Picture Matrix 6x6）"

msgid "Picture Matrix 7x7"
msgstr "图片矩阵 7x7（Picture Matrix 7x7）"

msgid "Picture Matrix 8x8"
msgstr "图片矩阵 8x8（Picture Matrix 8x8）"

msgid "Picture Matrix 9x9"
msgstr "图片矩阵 9x9（Picture Matrix 9x9）"

msgid "Picture cards are removed in a set of Jack, Queen, King. A single picture card of each type can be moved to the three reserves, and the tableau pile is filled behind it. Once the three reserves contain one of each picture card, they are all removed to the foundation."
msgstr "人头牌以 J、Q、K 为一组移除。每种人头牌各一张可移到三个预备堆，牌列堆随即在其后补满。一旦三个预备堆中 J、Q、K 各齐一张，就全部移除到王牌区。"

msgid "Picture cards are removed in a set of Jack, Queen, King. A single picture card of each type can be moved to the three reserves, but they must all be discarded at the same time - no further cards can be dealt from the talon or filled from the waste until a set of three has been removed."
msgstr "人头牌以 J、Q、K 为一组移除。每种人头牌各一张可移到三个预备堆，但三张必须同时舍弃 - 一组三张移除之前，不能从牌山再发牌或由弃牌堆补牌。"

msgid "Pigtail"
msgstr "辫子（Pigtail）"

msgid "Piles build down by suit, and you can only move Kings to empty slots."
msgstr "各堆依花色递减叠放，只有 K 可以移到空位。"

msgid "Piles build from first rank to fourth, and an empty space cannot be filled."
msgstr "各堆从第一级点数叠到第四级点数，空格不可补牌。"

msgid "Piles in the frame are built up or down by same suit, but you cannot switch direction mid-sequence. Cards from the frame can be moved to another pile. Cards from the picture can be moved to a frame pile, but only if it's in the same row or column. The piles in the picture are then immediately filled from the waste, or the talon if the waste is empty."
msgstr "外框中的各堆依同花色递增或递减叠放，但顺子中途不可变向。外框的牌可以移到其他堆。图片区的牌可移到外框的堆，但必须与该堆同一横排或同一直行。接着图片区的堆立即由弃牌堆补满，弃牌堆空则由牌山补。"

msgid "Piles in the lower step are built down by alternating color, wrapping from ace to king as needed. Any card can be used to fill an empty pile in the lower step, but only single cards may be moved. No building is allowed in the middle step. Cards from the lower step can be moved to empty piles in the middle step, but not the other way around. Cards can only be moved to the foundation from the middle step or the waste (they may be moved directly from the lower step if there's an empty pile in the middle step)."
msgstr "下阶的各堆采红黑交替递减叠放，必要时从 A 循环到 K。下阶的空堆可用任何牌补，但只能移动单张牌。中阶不准叠牌。下阶的牌可以移到中阶的空堆，反之不行。牌只能从中阶或弃牌堆移到王牌区（中阶若有空堆，下阶的牌也可直接移到中阶）。"

msgid "Piles in the tableau/garden are built by the same rank. Once all four cards of the same rank are in a tableau pile, that pile may be moved to the foundation. If a tableau pile is empty, the top card from the reserve/beehive is dealt in its place. If the reserve is empty, any card from the tableau or waste pile may be dealt in its place."
msgstr "牌列／花园中的各堆依相同点数叠放。同一点数的 4 张牌齐于一堆后，该堆便可移到王牌区。若牌列堆空了，就从预备堆／蜂巢顶端发一张补位。预备堆空时，可从牌列或弃牌堆拿任何一张牌补位。"

msgid "Pine - January"
msgstr "松 - 一月（Pine - January）"

msgid "Pirate Gold"
msgstr "海盗黄金（Pirate Gold）"

msgid "Place the 16 cards on the tableau to get a score of 61 points or more."
msgstr "把 16 张牌放到牌列上，取得 61 分以上。"

msgid "Place the 25 cards on the tableau to get a score of 100 points or more."
msgstr "把 25 张牌放到牌列上，取得 100 分以上。"

msgid "Places = 20"
msgstr "地点 = 20"

msgid "Plain = 21"
msgstr "素面 = 21"

msgid "Plait"
msgstr "辫纹（Plait）"

msgid "Plan ahead carefully. If you block a card on a reserve with the card it would need to be played to, you won't be able to free it later and the game will be unwinnable."
msgstr "谨慎规划。若挡在预备堆那张牌上的，正是它出牌时需要的牌，之后就再也解不开，这局也会变得无解。"

msgid "Play is somewhat similar to"
msgstr "玩法大致类似"

msgid "Play is the same as Lara's Game except that there are three redeals. When the talon is empty after each round the cards are gathered up from the tableau and dealt to the rows without being shuffled using the same dealing rules as in the first round. The foundations take two complete rounds of a suit. After the first Raja is played to a foundation the second Ace will play."
msgstr "玩法与拉拉的游戏（Lara's Game）相同，差别在于有 3 次循环发牌。每轮牌山发完后，把牌从牌列收齐，不洗牌，依第一轮相同的发牌规则发到各横排。王牌区可容纳同一花色完整两轮的牌。第一张罗阇（Raja）进入王牌区后，第二张 A 就能跟上。"

msgid "Play is the same as Lara's Game except that there is one redeal. When the talon is empty after the first round the cards are gathered up from the tableau and dealt to the rows without being shuffled using the same dealing rules as in the first round."
msgstr "玩法与拉拉的游戏（Lara's Game）相同，差别在于有 1 次循环发牌。第一轮牌山发完后，把牌从牌列收齐，不洗牌，依第一轮相同的发牌规则发到各横排。"

msgid "Play is the same as Lara's Game with two exceptions. The first exception is that there are two redeals. When the talon is empty after the one round the cards are gathered up from the tableau and dealt to the rows without being shuffled using the same dealing rules as in the first round."
msgstr "玩法与拉拉的游戏（Lara's Game）相同，但有两个例外。第一个例外是有 2 次循环发牌。一轮之后牌山发完，把牌从牌列收齐，不洗牌，依第一轮相同的发牌规则发到各横排。"

msgid "Plugins are written in raw Python code. Because Python scripts can run based on Operating System level permissions, they could theoretically access your local files, run system commands, or make network connections."
msgstr "插件是以原生 Python 代码写成。由于 Python 脚本可按操作系统级别的权限运行，理论上能访问你的本地文件、执行系统命令，或建立网络连接。"

