msgid "Remember that lines only may cross the empty border. If you are stuck, you can use the Hint feature to find two tiles which may be removed. Clicking a tile with the right mouse button will show you all corresponding tiles, no matter if they are removable at the moment or not."
msgstr "记得，连线只能穿过空白的边界。如果你卡住了，可以用提示功能找出两张可以移除的牌块。用鼠标右键点牌块，会显示所有相符的牌块，不论它们当下一刻能不能移除。"

msgid "Remember that you can move cards between foundations."
msgstr "记得，你可以在王牌区之间移牌。"

msgid "Remove all but one card."
msgstr "移除所有牌，只剩一张。"

msgid "Remove all but two cards."
msgstr "移除所有牌，只剩两张。"

msgid "Remove all cards but one to a single pile."
msgstr "除一张牌以外，把所有牌移到同一堆。"

msgid "Remove all cards but picture cards (Jacks, Queens, and Kings). You have won if your Tableau looks like this --"
msgstr "移除人头牌（J、Q、K）以外的所有牌。你的牌列变成下面这个样子就算获胜 --"

msgid "Remove all diamonds to the foundation and have all the other cards in suit and sequence with Aces being low in the Tableau."
msgstr "把所有方块移到王牌区，其余牌在牌列依同花色排成顺子，A 算最小。"

msgid "Remove all groups of jack-queen-king of the same suit."
msgstr "移除所有同花色的 J-Q-K 组合。"

msgid "Remove all the cards except the one card declared at the start."
msgstr "移除所有牌，只留下开局宣告的那一张。"

msgid "Remove all tiles from the tableau."
msgstr "移除牌列中的所有牌块。"

msgid "Remove tiles from the deepest stacks first."
msgstr "先移除最深牌堆里的牌块。"

msgid "Removing a line of 3 is worth 100 points, plus 20 points for each additional piece in the sequence. If the tiles cascade, the score is multiplied by 1.5 after the first cascade, 2 after the second, and 2.5 for any cascades after."
msgstr "移除一列 3 个可得 100 分，顺子里每多一个再加 20 分。若牌块会连锁掉落，第一次连锁后分数乘以 1.5，第二次乘以 2，之后每次乘以 2.5。"

