msgstr "各行依同花色、点数递减叠放。一次只能移动一张牌。空行只能放 K 或 Skis（点数最高的将牌）。没有步可走时，点牌山即可循环发牌。"

msgid "Rows build down in rank in alternating color. The Trumps can play as either color. Only one card can be moved at a time. Foundations build up in rank by suit. Any card can be played on an empty row. Cards can be played from the foundations."
msgstr "各行依点数递减、红黑交替叠放。将牌可以当做任一颜色。一次只能移动一张牌。王牌区依同花色、点数递增叠放。空行可放任何牌。王牌区的牌也可以拿出来用。"

msgid "Rows build down in rank in alternating color. Wizards are wild, so any card can be played on one, and a wizard can be played on any card. Only one card can be moved at a time. Foundations build up in rank by suit. Any card can be played on an empty row. Cards can be played from the foundations."
msgstr "各行依点数递减、红黑交替叠放。法师是万用牌，所以任何牌都能放到法师上，法师也能放到任何牌上。一次只能移动一张牌。王牌区依同花色、点数递增叠放。空行可放任何牌。王牌区的牌也可以拿出来用。"

msgid "Rows build down in rank regardless of suit. Only one card can be moved at a time. Foundations build up in rank by suit. An empty row stack cannot be filled. For this reason the Kings and the highest Trump are dealt to the bottoms of the rows. Cards can be played from the foundations."
msgstr "各行依点数递减叠放、不分花色。一次只能移动一张牌。王牌区依同花色、点数递增叠放。空的横排堆不能补牌，因此 K 与点数最高的将牌会发在各行的最底下。王牌区的牌也可以拿出来用。"

