msgid "Sequences are built in a series of three free cells, and are then moved to the foundation once the sequence is complete. The game is won when there is only one card left on the tableau."
msgstr "顺子先在三个自由格中依序建成，完成后移至王牌区。当牌列只剩一张牌时即获胜。"

msgid "Sequences do not wrap around, i.e. only Twos may be placed on Aces and only Queens may be placed on Kings."
msgstr "顺子不循环，也就是只有 2 能放在 A 上，只有 Q 能放在 K 上。"

msgid "Sequences follow suit, so once a single card is played in a row, the remaining cards of that suit go in the same row."
msgstr "顺子跟随花色，所以一旦在某横排放了一张牌，该花色剩下的牌也要放在同一横排。"

msgid "Sequences starting in a two must be in the top row, sequences starting with a three must be in the middle row, and sequences starting with a four must be in the bottom row. You may start building sequences even if they are in the wrong row, but they must ultimately be moved to the correct row to win the game."
msgstr "从 2 起的顺子必须放在最上排，从 3 起的必须放在中间排，从 4 起的必须放在最下排。位置不对也可以先建顺子，但最后必须移到正确的排才能过关。"

msgid "Sequences wrap around, i.e. Kings may be placed on Aces."
msgstr "顺子可循环，也就是 K 能放在 A 上。"

msgid "Setting up a Cardset"
msgstr "设定牌组"

msgid "Sevastopol was invented by Jan Wolter, and first appeared in his app"
msgstr "塞瓦斯托波尔（Sevastopol）由简·沃尔特发明，最早出现在他的应用程序"

msgid "Seven Devils is widely regarded as one of the most difficult solitaire games, due to the high likelihood of unwinnable games if certain key cards are inaccessible due to one of the devils."
msgstr "七恶魔（Seven Devils）被公认为最难的接龙游戏之一；一旦某些关键牌被其中一叠恶魔压住拿不到，这局就很容易无解。"

msgid "Seven Up, and its related games, can be played with cards dealt manually by the player one at a time, or all cards dealt at once. This option can be set in the options menu."
msgstr "七张向上（Seven Up）及其相关玩法，可以由玩家一张一张手动发牌，也可以一次发完所有牌。这个选项可在选项菜单中设置。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt into a layout of four rows, and the remaining four cards are set aside to form the stock. A card is dealt in the stock, and may be played in its correct position in the layout, depending on its rank. Eights go in the leftmost column, with aces on the far right, and the remaining cards in sequence. Sevens are played in a column to the left of the main layout."
msgstr "发 7 张牌排成四横排的布局，剩下 4 张搁置作为牌山。每次从牌山发一张牌，可依其点数放到布局中的正确位置。8 放在最左栏，A 放在最右栏，其余点数依顺序排列。7 则放在主布局左侧的一栏。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt to each of seven piles. The remaining three cards are dealt to three of four reserve piles."
msgstr "七个牌堆各发 7 张牌。剩余 3 张牌发到 4 个预备堆中的 3 个。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt to each of seven tableau piles, with every other card dealt face-down (the second, fourth, and sixth cards in each pile will be face-down). Tableau piles are built down by same suit. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "七个牌列堆各发 7 张牌，其中隔一张盖一张（每堆第 2、4、6 张面朝下）。牌列堆依同花色递减叠放。任何牌或有效顺子都能在牌列堆间移动。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt to seven tableau piles. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles. Empty tableau spaces are immediately filled from the top card of the waste."
msgstr "7 张牌发到七个牌列堆。牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放，任何有效顺子可在堆间移动。牌列出现空列时，立即以弃牌堆的顶牌补满。"

