msgid "Subjects - The remaining cards are played to the subjects foundation, built down by same suit from nine through two. Cards can only be moved to the subjects foundation once the king, queen, and jack of the same suit have all been played to the castle."
msgstr "主题堆 - 其余的牌移到主题王牌堆，由 9 依同花色递减叠放到 2。只有同花色的 K、Q、J 都已移到城堡之后，牌才能移到主题王牌堆。"

