msgid "The \"System Libraries\" of an executable work include anything, other than the work as a whole, that (a) is included in the normal form of packaging a Major Component, but which is not part of that Major Component, and (b) serves only to enable use of the work with that Major Component, or to implement a Standard Interface for which an implementation is available to the public in source code form. A \"Major Component\", in this context, means a major essential component (kernel, window system, and so on) of the specific operating system (if any) on which the executable work runs, or a compiler used to produce the work, or an object code interpreter used to run it."
msgstr "可执行作品的「系统库」包含除作品整体以外，符合（a）以主要组件的正常打包形式包含在内、但不属于该主要组件，且（b）仅用于让作品能搭配该主要组件使用，或实现某个已有公开源代码实现的标准接口的任何东西。此上下文中的「主要组件」指可执行作品所运行的特定操作系统（若有）的主要必要组件（内核、窗口系统等），或用以产出作品的编译器，或用以执行作品的目标代码解释器。"

msgid "The \"source code\" for a work means the preferred form of the work for making modifications to it. \"Object code\" means any non-source form of a work."
msgstr "作品的「源代码」指便于修改作品的首选形式。「目标代码」指作品的任何非源代码形式。"

msgid "The 16 piles build down by suit. Only one card can be moved at a time. Empty piles are not filled."
msgstr "16 个牌堆依花色递减叠放。一次只能移动一张。空列不补牌。"

msgid "The 16 reserve piles on the right can hold a single card and are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "右侧 16 个预备堆各放一张牌，并自动由弃牌堆或牌山补满。"

msgid "The 18 piles build down by rank ignoring suit. Only one card can be moved at a time, and empty piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "18 个牌堆不分花色依点数递减叠放。一次只能移一张，空列不能补牌。"

msgid "The 18 piles build down by rank. Only one card can be moved at a time. Empty piles are not filled."
msgstr "18 个牌堆依点数递减叠放。一次只能移一张。空列不补牌。"

msgid "The 18 piles build down by suit. Only one card can be moved at a time, and empty piles can be filled with a King only."
msgstr "18 个牌堆依花色递减叠放。一次只能移一张，空列只能用 K 补。"

msgid "The 18 piles build up or down regardless of suit. Each pile can hold no more than three cards. Only one card can be moved at a time. Empty piles are not filled."
msgstr "18 个牌堆不分花色递增或递减叠放。每堆最多三张。一次只能移一张。空列不补牌。"

msgid "The 20 reserve piles can hold any single card."
msgstr "20 个预备堆各可放任意一张牌。"

msgid "The 4 foundations in the corners build down by rank from King to Ace."
msgstr "四角的 4 个王牌堆依点数从 K 递减叠放到 A。"

msgid "The 4 reserve piles on the left can only play to the foundations."
msgstr "左侧 4 个预备堆只能出到王牌区。"

msgid "The 7 reserve piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "7 个预备堆自动由弃牌堆或牌山补满。"

msgid "The 8 reserve piles can hold a single card and are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "8 个预备堆各放一张牌，并自动由弃牌堆或牌山补满。"

msgid "The 8 row stacks build both up and down in suit, also wrapping around. Only a single card can be moved, and free rows can be filled with any single card."
msgstr "8 个横排堆依花色递增也递减叠放，且可循环。一次只能移一张，空的横排可用任意单张补入。"

msgid "The 9 reserve piles can hold a single card and are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "9 个预备堆各放一张牌，并自动由弃牌堆或牌山补满。"

msgid "The Bogey was invented by Katharine Turner."
msgstr "幽灵（The Bogey）由凯瑟琳·透纳（Katharine Turner）发明。"

msgid "The Bouquet"
msgstr "花束（The Bouquet）"

msgid "The Complete Book of Solitaire & Patience Games"
msgstr "The Complete Book of Solitaire & Patience Games"

msgid "The Corresponding Source for a work in source code form is that same work."
msgstr "以源代码形式存在的作品，其对应源代码就是该作品本身。"

msgid "The Corresponding Source need not include anything that users can regenerate automatically from other parts of the Corresponding Source."
msgstr "对应源代码不必包含用户能从对应源代码的其他部分自动重新生成的内容。"

msgid "The FTE Text Editor"
msgstr "FTE 文字编辑器"

msgid "The Find Card feature now supports all types of games."
msgstr "找牌功能现在已支持所有游戏类型。"

msgid "The Four Continents"
msgstr "四大洲（The Four Continents）"

msgid "The Free Software Foundation may publish revised and/or new versions of the GNU General Public License from time to time. Such new versions will be similar in spirit to the present version, but may differ in detail to address new problems or concerns."
msgstr "自由软件基金会可能不时发布 GNU 通用公共授权条款的修订版或新版。新版在精神上与现行版本相近，但细节可能不同，以应对新的问题或顾虑。"

msgid "The Garden"
msgstr "花园（The Garden）"

msgid "The Hex A Deck is similar to a few card packs published in the early 20th century that had sixteen cards in each suit. Those decks were intended to be used when popular games of the period such as Whist were played by five or more players. The extra cards meant that each player had more cards in their hand which added interest to the play. The Wizards in the Hex A Deck corresponds to the Jokers in a regular pack. Their main purpose in most Hex A Deck games is to show up at the worst possible time. Either that or at the best possible time. They're very successful at doing that. In games that use alternate color stacks they may be played as either color. They have ranks from one through four and sometimes can only be played in rank order. The ranks may or may not be indicated on the cards. If they are not indicated there is usually a way to tell which is which. The rank can be determined by comparing some distinctive element of the images. The first rank Wizard will be the most elaborate in some way such as the fattest, having the tallest hat etc. They play on their foundation (if any) in descending order of rank. That is first through fourth. In some games the Wizards will not move off of the tableau until all the other cards have been moved to the foundations. In some games they don't actually enter into play at all. They are just there to make things interesting. Which is to say make things difficult. And they are very good at doing that."
msgstr "Hex A Deck 类似 20 世纪初期出版的几种牌组，那些牌组每花色有 16 张牌。当时惠斯特（Whist）等流行游戏若由五人（含）以上玩，就会用到这些牌组；多出来的牌让每位玩家手牌更多，玩起来更有趣味。Hex A Deck 中的法师相当于一般牌组里的鬼牌。在多数 Hex A Deck 游戏里，它们的主要用途就是在最糟的时刻冒出来——或者最好的时刻，它们非常擅长这件事。在采红黑交替叠放的游戏中，它们可以当作任一颜色使用。它们有点数 1 到 4，有时只能依点数顺序出牌。点数未必会标示在牌面上；若没有标示，通常也能从图案的某个特征分辨高下。第一级的法师在某方面最讲究，例如最胖、帽子最高等。它们出到自己的王牌堆（如果有的话）时依点数由高而低，也就是第一级到第四级。有些游戏中，法师要等其他所有牌都移到王牌区后才肯离开牌列。也有些游戏根本用不到法师，它们只是来让局面变有趣——也就是变困难，而它们非常擅长这件事。"

msgid "The Inno Setup Win32 Installer"
msgstr "Inno Setup Win32 安装程序"

msgid "The Jack, Queen, and King of each suit. Also called court cards or picture cards."
msgstr "每花色的 J、Q、K。也称为宫廷牌或人头牌。"

msgid "The KDE Desktop Environment"
msgstr "KDE 桌面环境"

msgid "The Last Monarch (Der letzte Monarch)"
msgstr "最后的君主（Der letzte Monarch）"

msgid "The Linux Operating System"
msgstr "Linux 操作系统"

msgid "The Magic Seven"
msgstr "魔法七（The Magic Seven）"

msgid "The Microsoft Windows binary installer now contains and supports the solver for Freecell and other games."
msgstr "Microsoft Windows 的二进制安装程序现在已内含并支持 Freecell 等游戏的解题器。"

msgid "The MikMod Sound Library"
msgstr "MikMod 音效函数库"

msgid "The Papa &lt;papalini@biancaneve.ing.unifi.it&gt;"
msgstr "The Papa &lt;papalini@biancaneve.ing.unifi.it&gt;"

msgid "The Python Programming Language"
msgstr "Python 编程语言"

msgid "The Reserve"
msgstr "预备堆（The Reserve）"

msgid "The SDL MPEG Player Library"
msgstr "SDL MPEG 播放函数库"

msgid "The SDL Simple DirectMedia Layer"
msgstr "SDL 简易直接媒体层"

msgid "The Solitaire Wizard is a feature in PySol that allows you to create and play custom solitaire games. The Solitaire Wizard is an easy way to create custom games, though its options are a bit limited. More complex games can be created with"
msgstr "接龙法师（Solitaire Wizard）是 PySol 的一项功能，让你创建并游玩自定义接龙游戏。用接龙法师做自定义游戏很方便，只是选项略为有限。更复杂的游戏则可以用"

msgid "The Style of the cardset (this field can hold one or more comma separated values)"
msgstr "牌组的风格（此字段可填入一个或多个用逗号分隔的值）"

msgid "The Tableau is built down by alternate color. Any group of cards may be moved regardless of sequence, so long as the bottom card of the group is placed on top of a card (in a different pile) that is the next higher card in rank and of the opposite color. An empty pile in the Tableau can be filled with any group of cards, even a single card."
msgstr "牌列采红黑交替递减叠放。整组牌不问顺序皆可移动，只要该组最底张放到另一堆的顶牌上，且该顶牌点数恰好高一级、颜色相反。牌列中的空列可放入任意一组牌，一张也行。"

msgid "The Talon is the stack of cards remaining in the deck, not yet played upon any of the piles, and not yet placed in the discard pile. Some people also call it the Stock or the Hand."
msgstr "牌山是整副牌剩下、还没放到任何牌堆上、也还没进弃牌堆的那一叠。也有人称之为 Stock 或 Hand。"

msgid "The Tcl/Tk GUI Toolkit"
msgstr "Tcl/Tk 图形界面工具组"

msgid "The Tengu is a mythical Japanese character of exceptional fighting skill. You will need great skill (and more than a little luck) yourself to overcome six of them."
msgstr "天狗是传说中武艺超群的日本角色。要对付六只天狗，你自己也得有高超技巧（外加多一点的好运）。"

msgid "The Windows installer now includes the revitalised PySol-music package. For more info, see"
msgstr "Windows 安装程序现在收录了重新整理的 PySol-music 软件包。更多信息请见"

msgid "The Wish (Open)"
msgstr "Wish (Open)"

msgid "The Wizards may play to the foundation at any time, but they can be very helpful in moving cards on the tableau."
msgstr "法师随时都能出到王牌堆，但它们在搬动牌列的牌时往往很有帮助。"

msgid "The Wizards will not play to their foundation until all the suit cards are on theirs. That can make the end game a bit of a puzzle. Use an empty row to move them out of the way."
msgstr "法师要等其他花色的牌全部到位后才会进自己的王牌堆，这会让残局有点像谜题。可以用空横排把它们移开。"

msgid "The Wizards will not play to their foundation until all the suit cards are on theirs. This can make the end game a real challenge."
msgstr "法师要等其他花色的牌全部进完王牌区才会进堆，这会让残局变成真正的挑战。"

msgid "The XFree86 X Window System"
msgstr "XFree86 X 窗口系统"

msgid "The Year the cardset was created (in the range 1000 to 2299)"
msgstr "牌组创建的年份（介于 1000 到 2299 之间）"

msgid "The ability to place a card (or group of cards) on another card. In regards to rank, you can BUILD UP, BUILD DOWN, BUILD BY SAME RANK, or BUILD UP/DOWN BY *. In regards to suit/color, you can BUILD BY SUIT, BUILD BY COLOR, BUILD BY ALTERNATE COLOR, BUILD BY ANY SUIT BUT OWN, or BUILD REGARDLESS OF SUIT. Note that all games that build will follow two of these rules, one from each list."
msgstr "把一张牌（或一组牌）放到另一张牌上的能力。就点数而言，可以选：递增叠放、递减叠放、同点数叠放，或依 * 递增／递减叠放。就花色／颜色而言，可以选：依花色叠放、依颜色叠放、依红黑交替叠放、依非自身花色叠放，或不分花色叠放。请注意，所有采叠放的游戏都会依循两条规则，两个清单各取其一。"

msgid "The aces are dealt to the foundation, and a card is dealt to each tableau pile. There are four rows of eight tableau piles. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, so only the top card is visible, and only cards from the row directly below can be moved to a tableau pile. Only one card can be moved at a time."
msgstr "A 全数发到王牌区，每个牌列堆各发一张牌。牌列堆共四排、每排八堆，采红黑交替递减叠放，因此只露出顶牌，而且只能从正下方那一排把牌移到牌列堆。一次只能移动一张。"

msgid "The aces are dealt to the foundations, and ten cards are dealt to each of four tableau piles. No building is allowed on these piles, but two additional tableau piles are available (with no cards dealt to them at the start), which are built down by alternate color from king to ace, with only the top card visible."
msgstr "A 发到王牌区，四个牌列堆各发 10 张牌。这些牌列堆不准叠放，但另有两个额外的牌列堆（开局不发牌），它们采红黑交替、从 K 递减叠放到 A，只露出顶牌。"

msgid "The aces are dealt to the foundations, with the two aces of each suit on a different side of the talon. Four cards are dealt to free cells next to each of the foundations."
msgstr "A 发到王牌区，每花色的两张 A 分置牌山两侧。王牌区旁的自由格共发入 4 张牌。"

msgid "The aces are dealt to the foundations. One card is dealt to each of 24 tableau piles. No building on the tableau is allowed, though empty tableau piles can be filled with a single card from the top of another pile. The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to ten. Jacks, queens, and kings cannot be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "A 发到王牌区。24 个牌列堆各发一张牌。牌列不准叠放，但空的牌列堆可用另一堆的顶牌补入。王牌区依花色从 A 递增叠放到 10。J、Q、K 不能移到王牌区。"

msgid "The aces through sixes are dealt in five rows of six cards each. The sixes are removed, creating blank spaces."
msgstr "A 到 6 发成五行、每行六张。接着移走所有 6，制造出空位。"

msgid "The aim of the game is to remove all tiles from the board. Only two matching tiles can be removed at a time. Two tiles can only be removed if they can be connected with a maximum of three connected lines. Lines can be horizontal or vertical, but not diagonal."
msgstr "游戏目标是把盘面上所有牌块都移除。一次只能移除两张相同的牌块，且两张牌块必须能用最多三条连续的线连接。线可以是水平或垂直，但不能是斜线。"

msgid "The animation is too slow..."
msgstr "动画太慢了……"

msgid "The app's install directory also contains bundled cardsets and data; the folders above are where per-user content and settings are stored."
msgstr "应用程序的安装目录也包含内置的牌组和数据；上面的文件夹则是存放每个用户的内容与设置。"

msgid "The auto-solver is completely clueless."
msgstr "自动解题器完全没头绪。"

msgid "The auto-solver is hopeless. Don't believe the hints."
msgstr "自动解题器很不靠谱。别轻信提示。"

msgid "The auto-solver is hopeless. Don't believe the hints. They tend to be right but it doesn't figure everything out (there may be valid moves that it won't guess)."
msgstr "自动解题器很不靠谱。别轻信提示。提示虽然多半正确，但它无法算出一切（可能有它猜不到的合法步）。"

msgid "The average rank of the cards in a deck is 7, and the total of all cards of each suit is 91, which is a multiple of 7. Thus, the total of all cards in the entire deck is 364, also a multiple of 7."
msgstr "一副牌中每张牌的平均点数是 7，每个花色所有牌的点数总和是 91，正好是 7 的倍数。因此整副牌的点数总和是 364，也是 7 的倍数。"

msgid "The base rank for the foundation is determined at game start, and it builds up by doubling the rank ignoring suit:"
msgstr "王牌区的基准点数在开局决定，之后不分花色、点数加倍递增叠放："

msgid "The base ranks for the foundation are based on the current year. Each base rank is one rank higher than that digit in the year, with tens representing zeros. This way, when the game is won, the cards on the top of the foundations will show the current year."
msgstr "王牌区的基准点数依当年年份而定。每个基准点数比年份中对应的那位数字大一点，十位那格代表 0。这样一来，过关时王牌堆的顶牌就会显示出今年的年份。"

msgid "The card in that position is then turned up and may be likewise moved to its correct position. If a seven was played, draw a new card from the stock to play."
msgstr "该位置的牌接着翻开，同样可以移到它正确的位置。如果刚打出的是 7，就从牌山再抽一张新牌来出。"

msgid "The card is one rank higher than the card on top of the foundation, and of the same suit."
msgstr "该牌比王牌堆顶牌大一点数，且花色相同。"

msgid "The card is one rank lower than the card on top of the foundation, and of the opposite suit of the same color."
msgstr "该牌比王牌堆顶牌小一点数，且为同色的另一花色。"

msgid "The card is the same rank as the card on top of the foundation, and of the opposite color."
msgstr "该牌与王牌堆顶牌点数相同，且颜色相反。"

msgid "The cards are all dealt to eight piles - four piles of seven and four piles of six."
msgstr "所有牌发到八个牌堆——四堆各 7 张、四堆各 6 张。"

msgid "The cards are dealt into eight piles of five cards. Cards in tableau are built down by same suit - groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence. Any card or sequence can be used to fill an empty pile."
msgstr "牌发成八堆、每堆五张。牌列中的牌依同花色递减叠放——整组牌不问顺序皆可移动。任何牌或顺子都能补空列。"

msgid "The cards are dealt into eight reserve stacks, and the top card of any of these stacks may be moved to one of eight tableau stacks, one at a time. Cards may not be moved between the reserve stacks."
msgstr "牌发到八个预备堆，任何预备堆的顶牌都能一张一张移到八个牌列堆之一。预备堆之间不能移牌。"

msgid "The cards are dealt into fifteen piles of three cards and three piles of two. The remaining card is dealt to a foundation. Foundations are built up by suit, starting from the rank of the dealt card, turning the corner as needed (ace can be played on king)."
msgstr "牌发成十五堆每堆三张，另有三堆每堆两张。剩下一张发到王牌堆。王牌区依花色递增叠放，从那张发出的牌的点数开始，需要时可拐角循环（A 可放在 K 上）。"

msgid "The cards are dealt into four tableau stacks of 13 face-up cards each. Cards may be moved to one of the six foundations one at a time. Any card may be used to start one of the foundations, but after that, the foundations are built in sequence up or down in rank. Turning the corner is allowed, so aces may be played on kings, and vice versa."
msgstr "牌发成四个牌列堆，每堆 13 张全部正面朝上。牌可一张一张移到六个王牌堆之一。王牌堆可由任意一张牌起堆，之后便依点数顺序递增或递减叠放。可以拐角循环，也就是 A 可放在 K 上，K 也可放在 A 上。"

msgid "The cards are dealt into seven piles of three cards each. Cards in tableau are built down by same suit - groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence, and only kings can be used to fill an empty pile."
msgstr "牌发成七堆、每堆三张。牌列中的牌依同花色递减叠放——整组牌不问顺序皆可移动，空列只能用 K 补入。"

msgid "The cards are dealt to 24 piles of four cards each, with the kings dealt to the foundations. No building is allowed on the tableau. The foundations with the kings are built down by same suit, while a second set is built up from ace."
msgstr "牌发到 24 个牌堆、每堆四张，K 则发到王牌区。牌列不准叠放。有 K 的王牌堆依同花色递减叠放，另一组王牌堆则从 A 起递增叠放。"

msgid "The cards are dealt to eight piles of thirteen cards. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color. Any card or sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles, and any card can fill an empty tableau pile. Cards can be moved to the foundations, which are built up by same suit, starting from ace."
msgstr "牌发到八个牌堆、每堆十三张。牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放。任何牌或顺子都能在牌列堆间移动，任何牌都能补空的牌列堆。牌可移到王牌区，王牌区依同花色从 A 起递增叠放。"

msgid "The cards are dealt to eight piles of thirteen cards. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color. Single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Cards can be moved to the foundations, which are built up by same suit, starting from the ace. Any card can fill an empty tableau column."
msgstr "牌发到八个牌堆、每堆十三张。牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放。只能单张在牌列堆间移动。牌可移到王牌区，王牌区依同花色从 A 起递增叠放。任何牌都能补空的牌列栏。"

msgid "The cards are dealt to eight tableau piles, four with seven cards and four with six, all face-up. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card or sequence can fill an empty pile. There are four free cells, that any single cards can be moved to/from."
msgstr "牌发到八个牌列堆，四堆七张、四堆六张，全部正面朝上。牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放，任何牌或有效顺子都能在牌列堆间移动，任何牌或顺子都能补空列。另有四个自由格，可自由移入移出任一张牌。"

msgid "The cards are dealt to eight tableau piles, four with six cards and four with seven. No building on the tableau is allowed. The foundation is built up by rank, regardless of suit, wrapping from ace to king as needed. Any card can be used to start the foundation."
msgstr "牌发到八个牌列堆，四堆六张、四堆七张。牌列不准叠放。王牌堆不分花色依点数递增叠放，必要时可从 A 循环到 K。王牌堆可由任意一张牌起堆。"

msgid "The cards are dealt to seven tableau piles, with one card in the first, and the remaining piles containing 3, 5, 7, 4, 6, and 2 cards respectively, and the remaining cards dealt over top."
msgstr "牌发到七个牌列堆：第一堆 1 张，其余各堆分别为 3、5、7、4、6、2 张，剩下的牌再叠盖在堆上。"

msgid "The cards are dealt to thirteen tableau piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built up or down by rank, regardless of suit. Cards can be moved between tableau piles, one at a time."
msgstr "牌发到十三个牌列堆、每堆四张。牌列堆不分花色依点数递增或递减叠放。牌可一张一张在牌列堆间移动。"

msgid "The cards build down by rank and by suit on the tableau, no more than twelve to a row. Any card or movable pile may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "牌列上依点数与花色递减叠放，每排最多十二张。任何牌或可动的整堆牌都能放到空排上。"

msgid "The cards build down by rank in alternate colors on the tableau, no more than twelve to a row. Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "牌列上依点数、红黑交替递减叠放，每排最多十二张。任何牌或顺子都能放到空排上。"

msgid "The cards build down by rank in alternating force on the tableau, no more than twelve to a row. Only the Rajas may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "牌列上依点数、交替势力递减叠放，每排最多十二张。只有罗阇（Raja）能放到空排上。"

msgid "The cards build down by rank only on the tableau. The ten reserve stacks hold one card each. The game is won when all cards are on the tableau in suit and rank order."
msgstr "牌列上只能依点数递减叠放。十个预备堆各放一张牌。当所有牌都以花色与点数顺序排回牌列时即过关。"

msgid "The cards can be reshuffled and redealt twice. If there are any empty spaces, three cards from the stock can be dealt to fill that pile (this does not count as a redeal)."
msgstr "牌可以重新洗牌并循环发牌两次。若有空列，可从牌山发三张牌补满该堆（这不算一次循环发牌）。"

msgid "The cards can only be moved to the foundation as entire suits, in order. As in"
msgstr "只能把同花色整组依序移到王牌堆，如同"

msgid "The cards in the body of the casket are built down by same suit, whereas the cards in the lid of the casket can't be built. A card from the lid of the casket can only be moved to a non-empty pile in the body of the casket or a foundation. Empty piles in the lid of the casket are immediately filled with the top card from the jewels, while piles in the body can be filled freely."
msgstr "宝盒主体的牌依同花色递减叠放，盒盖的牌则不能叠放。盒盖的牌只能移到主体中非空的牌堆或王牌堆。盒盖的空列会立即以「宝石」的顶牌补入，主体的牌堆则可自由补牌。"

msgid "The cards in the tableau build from first rank to fourth, without regard to suit. The third and fourth rank cards are interchangeable. Any card can be played on the canvas."
msgstr "牌列上的牌从第一级排到第四级，不分花色。第三级与第四级的牌可以互换。任何牌都能出到王牌区。"

msgid "The cards may be built down by rank only on the tableau. The twelve reserve stacks hold one card each. The game is won when all cards are on the tableau in suit and rank order."
msgstr "牌列上只能依点数递减叠放。十二个预备堆各放一张牌。当所有牌都以花色与点数顺序排回牌列时即过关。"

msgid "The cards must be arranged from forth rank to first in the top three rows as follows:"
msgstr "上方三排必须由第四级排到第一级，如下："

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down by rank in alternate colors. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. Only the Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. The Mughal Ganjifa deck has eight suits and each suit has it's own color. This makes it a bit of a challenge at times to know what colors are the \"alternates\". If a card doesn't play one place, try a different card of the same rank. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. There are no redeals. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数、红黑交替递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。莫卧儿甘吉发牌组有八个花色，每个花色自成一色，有时很难判断哪些颜色算「交替」。如果某张牌放不进去，就换一张同点数的牌试试。牌山每次发三张。不循环发牌。牌可以从王牌区移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down by rank in alternate colors. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. Only the Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. The Mughal Ganjifa deck has eight suits and each suit has it's own color. This makes it a bit of a challenge at times to know what colors are the \"alternates\". If a card doesn't play one place, try a different card of the same rank. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. There is no limit on redeals. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数、红黑交替递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。莫卧儿甘吉发牌组有八个花色，每个花色自成一色，有时很难判断哪些颜色算「交替」。如果某张牌放不进去，就换一张同点数的牌试试。牌山每次发三张。循环发牌次数不限。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down by rank regardless of suit, no more than twelve to a row. Any card or movable pile may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数递减叠放、不分花色，每排最多十二张。任何牌或可动的整堆牌都能放到空排上。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down by rank regardless of suit. No more than twelve cards may be placed in one row. The four reserve stacks below the foundations will hold one card each. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. Only the Mirs (Kings) may be played on empty rows."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数递减叠放、不分花色，每排最多十二张。王牌区下方四个预备堆各放一张牌。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down by rank. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. Only the Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. There are no redeals. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。牌山每次发一张。不循环发牌。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down by rank. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. Only the Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. There is only one redeal. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。牌山每次发三张。只循环发牌一次。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down by ranks of the same suit. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. Any card or movable pile may be played on an empty row. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. There is no limit on the number of redeals. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依同花色按点数递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。任何牌或可动的整堆牌都能放到空排上。牌山每次发一张。循环发牌次数不限。牌可以从王牌区移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down in rank by suit. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. The cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. There are unlimited redeals. Any card or movable pile may be played on an empty row. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依花色按点数递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。牌山每次发三张，循环发牌不限次数。任何牌或可动的整堆牌都能放到空排上。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down in rank in alternate colors. The Dashavatara Ganjifa deck has ten suits and each suit has it's own color. This makes it a bit problematic at times knowing which colors are alternate. If a card of one suit doesn't play in a spot, try a different card of the same rank. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. The cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. There is no redeal. Only the Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数、红黑交替递减叠放。达萨瓦塔拉甘吉发牌组有十个花色，每个花色自成一色，有时很难判断哪些颜色是交替色。如果某花色的牌在某个位置放不进去，就换一张同点数的牌试试。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。牌山每次发一张。不循环发牌。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。牌可以从王牌区移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down in rank in alternate colors. The Dashavatara Ganjifa deck has ten suits and each suit has it's own color. This makes it a bit problematic at times knowing which colors are alternate. If a card of one suit doesn't play in a spot, try a different card of the same rank. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. The cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. There are unlimited redeals. Only Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数、红黑交替递减叠放。达萨瓦塔拉甘吉牌组有十个花色，每个花色自成一色，有时很难判断哪些颜色是交替色。如果某花色的牌放不进某个位置，就换一张同点数的牌试试。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。牌山每次发三张，循环发牌次数不限。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down in rank of the same suit. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. The cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. Any card or movable pile may be played on an empty row. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依同花色按点数递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。牌山每次发一张。任何牌或可动的整堆牌都能放到空排上。牌可以从王牌区移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down in rank regardless of suit. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. The cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. There is no redeal. Only Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数递减叠放、不分花色。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。牌山每次发一张。不循环发牌。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down in rank regardless of suit. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. The cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. There is one redeal. Only Mirs (Kings) may be played on an empty row. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依点数递减叠放、不分花色。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。牌山每次发三张。循环发牌一次。只有米尔（Mir）能放到空排上。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The cards on the tableau build down in ranks of the same suit. The foundations build up in rank by suit starting with the Ace. Any card or movable pile of cards may be played on an empty row. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. There is no limit on redeals. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "牌列上的牌依同花色按点数递减叠放。王牌区依花色从 A 起递增叠放。任何牌或可动的整堆牌都能放到空排上。牌山每次发三张，循环发牌次数不限。牌可以从王牌区移出。"

msgid "The cards' height (the card image height)"
msgstr "牌的高度（牌图信息的高度）"

msgid "The cards' width (the card image width)"
msgstr "牌的宽度（牌图信息的宽度）"

msgid "The cardset version number that belongs to the number of fields divided through \";\" on the first line (e.g."
msgstr "第一行以 ; 分隔的字段数所对应的牌组版本号（例如"

msgid "The code is now compatible with both Python 2.7.x and Python 3.x"
msgstr "代码现在同时兼容 Python 2.7.x 与 Python 3.x"

msgid "The code now passes flake8 validation."
msgstr "代码现在能通过 flake8 检查。"

msgid "The color depth (mostly 8)"
msgstr "色彩深度（多数为 8）"

msgid "The concept of Accordion's Revenge was invented by Mark Masten."
msgstr "手风琴的复仇（Accordion's Revenge）这个构想由马克·马森（Mark Masten）发明。"

msgid "The deck is dealt evenly to thirteen piles. Single cards may be moved between piles without restriction. If the total rank of the top cards of all thirteen piles totals 91 (kings are 13, queens are 12, jacks are 11), those cards are removed."
msgstr "整副牌均分成十三堆发出。单张牌可在堆间任意移动。若十三堆的顶牌点数总和为 91（K 为 13、Q 为 12、J 为 11），就移除这些顶牌。"

msgid "The decks are dealt into twelve piles of eight cards each. An ace and king of each suit are moved to the foundations. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and any card can be moved to fill an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "牌发成十二堆、每堆八张。每花色的 A 与 K 移到王牌区。牌列堆依同花色递增或递减叠放。牌列堆之间只能单张移动，空堆可用任何牌补入。"

msgid "The decks are separated. From one deck, four cards are dealt to each of eleven tableau piles, with alternating cards face-up and face-down (the bottom and third from the bottom cards are face-down). The remaining eight cards from that deck are combined with the other deck to form the talon."
msgstr "两副牌分开使用。从其中一副牌，十一个牌列堆各发 4 张，明牌与暗牌交错（最底张与由下数第三张面朝下）。该副牌剩下的 8 张再与另一副牌合并，组成牌山。"

msgid "The deeper something is, the harder it is to get to. Try and move cards out of the Reserve whenever possible."
msgstr "埋得越深的牌越难拿到。尽量设法清空预备堆。"

msgid "The demo has the PySol autopilot automatically play through the game. Once a demo is completed, it will inform you of the status - if you don't acknowledge the success/failure window, the demo will start another game. If you use the \"Demo (all games)\" option, a different game will be randomly selected and demoed, but if you just use \"Demo\", it will start another round of the same game. Demo games are not counted towards your player statistics - the autopilot's statistics are tracked separately in the Demo Statistics window."
msgstr "示范会由 PySol 自动驾驶帮你自动玩完整局。示范结束后会告知结果——如果你不关闭成功／失败窗口，示范会再玩新的一局。选「示范（所有游戏）」会随机挑一款不一样的游戏来示范；只选「示范」则会同游戏再开一局。示范局不计入你的玩家统计——自动驾驶的成绩另外记录在示范统计窗口中。"

msgid "The easiest way to create a cardset would be to copy an existing cardset folder of the same type in your cardsets directory. All cardsets need a number of files to work."
msgstr "制作牌组最简单的方式，是在你的 cardsets 目录中复制一个同类型、已存在的牌组文件夹。每个牌组都需要一些文件才能运作。"

msgid "The eight foundations are arranged in the shape of a T. To the four foundations on the top of the T, an ace of each suit is dealt, and a king of each suit is dealt to the middle bar. Twelve cards are dealt to tableau piles, six on each side of the T."
msgstr "八个王牌堆排成 T 字形。T 字上方的四个王牌堆各发一花色一张 A，中间横杠的四个王牌堆各发一花色一张 K。12 张牌发到牌列堆，T 字两侧各六堆。"

msgid "The eight piles build down by rank regardless of suit. Only one card can be moved at a time and empty piles can be filled with any single card."
msgstr "八个牌堆不分花色依点数递减叠放。一次只能移一张，空列可用任意单张补入。"

msgid "The eight playing piles in the tableau all start with four cards showing. Piles build down by alternate color, and an empty space can be filled with any card or sequence. The single free cell at the bottom may hold one card at a time."
msgstr "牌列中的八个牌列堆开局都有四张明牌。牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放，空位可用任何牌或顺子补入。底部的自由格只有一个，一次放一张牌。"

msgid "The eight playing piles in the tableau all start with two cards face-down and one showing. Piles build down by alternate color, and an empty space can be filled with any card or sequence."
msgstr "牌列中的八个牌列堆开局都有两张面朝下、一张面朝上。牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放，空位可用任何牌或顺子补入。"

msgid "The face cards are dealt in four rows of three cards each, with only the top card of each pile face-up. These represent the dungeon monsters. The remaining cards are set aside in the talon, called the \"power deck\"."
msgstr "人头牌发成四排、每排三张，每堆只有顶牌面朝上，代表地下城里的怪物。其余的牌搁置成牌山，称为「力量牌组」。"

msgid "The face-down cards remain face-down until all of the face-up cards, except the queens, have been moved to the foundation. Then, they are all revealed."
msgstr "面朝下的牌会一直保持面朝下，直到除 Q 外所有面朝上的牌都移到王牌堆，然后全部翻开。"

msgid "The find card feature will locate and highlight any face-up instances of the chosen card. Using this does not disqualify you from getting a perfect game."
msgstr "找牌功能会找出并凸显所选牌的任何正面朝上的牌。使用它不会使你失去拿到满分局的资格。"

msgid "The first card can be removed automatically, or chosen by the player and removed manually. This is based on an assist level option that can be set in the Options menu."
msgstr "第一张牌可以自动移除，或由玩家自行选取后手动移除。这取决于辅助等级选项，可在选项菜单中设置。"

msgid "The first card dealt into a foundation pile. Other foundations usually have to start with a card of this rank. See: FOUNDATION"
msgstr "第一张发入王牌堆的牌。其他王牌堆通常也要从这个点数的牌起堆。参见：王牌堆"

msgid "The first card in the bottom row can be arbitrarily selected from the top of any pile."
msgstr "最下排的第一张牌可以从任何牌堆的顶端任意挑选。"

msgid "The first card of each sequence in the reserve can be arbitrarily selected from the top of any pile."
msgstr "预备堆中每段顺子的第一张牌，可以从任何牌堆的顶端任意挑选。"

msgid "The first priority is to empty the reserve stack. Once that's done try to keep one or more row stacks open. Play high rank cards on the rows and build down on them. The same goes for the Trumps only row."
msgstr "首要任务是清空预备堆。接着设法保留一个以上的空横排堆。把高点数的牌放到横排上，再往上递减叠放。只有将牌的那一排也同样处理。"

msgid "The first row will only accept the first four suits, Pine, Plum, Cherry and Wisteria"
msgstr "第一排只接受前四个花色：松、梅、樱、藤"

msgid "The first two cards must have a total rank that's greater than or equal to the rank of the face card (Jacks are 11, Queens are 12, Kings are 13). This represents the monster's power."
msgstr "前两张牌的点数总和必须大于或等于人头牌的点数（J 为 11、Q 为 12、K 为 13），这代表怪物的战力。"

msgid "The five tableau piles build down by rank, wrapping around from Ace to King. Only the top card can be moved."
msgstr "五个牌列堆依点数递减叠放，可从 A 循环到 K。只能移动顶牌。"

msgid "The flower beds are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Only single cards can be moved between flower beds, and any card can fill an empty space. Cards from the bouquet can be moved to the garden or the foundations, but cards cannot be moved to the bouquet."
msgstr "花圃不分花色依点数递减叠放。花圃之间只能单张移动，任何牌都能补空位。花束的牌可以移到花园或王牌区，但牌不能移到花束。"

msgid "The following errors might occur during installation:"
msgstr "安装期间可能发生下列错误："

msgid "The following optional files may also be added, but are only used under certain circumstances."
msgstr "也可以加入下列选配文件，但它们只在特定情况下才会用到。"

msgid "The format of the images used - .gif, .png, .jpg, .ppm, and .bmp are supported"
msgstr "图片使用的格式—.gif、.png、.jpg、.ppm 与 .bmp 都支持"

msgid "The foundation (the"
msgstr "王牌堆（该"

msgid "The foundation in the center builds up by rank from Ace to King, four times wrapping around until it contains 52 cards."
msgstr "中央的王牌堆依点数从 A 递增叠放到 K，循环四次、共收 52 张。"

msgid "The foundation is built down from the jack, turning the corner from ace to king as necessary. When a card is moved from the piles around the queen, it is replaced with the top card from the pile below the king."
msgstr "王牌堆从 J 起递减叠放，必要时可从 A 拐角到 K。当 Q 周围牌堆中的牌被移走时，以 K 下方那堆的顶牌补入。"

msgid "The foundation is built up by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. A single card is dealt to the leftmost foundation pile at the start of the game, and this determines the base rank for all the foundations. Until the first foundation is filled with a full sequence of 13 cards, no cards can be moved to any of the remaining seven foundations, and you can only fill empty tableau piles with cards with the same rank as the foundation base rank."
msgstr "王牌堆不分花色依点数递增叠放，必要时可从 K 拐角到 A。开局时最左边的王牌堆发一张牌，决定所有王牌堆的基准点数。在第一堆叠满一组完整 13 张顺子之前，其余七堆都不能移入任何牌，而且空的牌列堆只能用与王牌基准点数相同的牌补入。"

msgid "The foundation is built up by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. Any card can be used to start the foundation, and the game is won when all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "王牌堆不分花色依点数递增叠放，必要时可从 K 拐角到 A。可用任意一张牌起堆，所有牌都移到王牌堆即获胜。"

msgid "The foundation piles are built up by rank, regardless of suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌堆依点数递增叠放，不分花色。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundation piles are built up by suit, starting from the base rank you set above, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌堆依花色递增叠放，从你在上面设定的基准点数开始，必要时可从 K 拐角到 A。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations"
msgstr "王牌区"

msgid "The foundations are arranged in four rows. The first row is built up by suit from ace to king. A queen of each suit is dealt to the second row. The third row can only contain a Jack of each suit, and the bottom row is built down by suit from ten to king, wrapping from ace to king."
msgstr "王牌堆排成四列。第一列依花色从 A 递增叠放到 K。第二列发入每花色一张 Q。第三列只能放每花色的 J。最下列依花色从 10 递减叠放到 K，并从 A 循环到 K。"

msgid "The foundations are built by same suit. The foundations can be built in any rank order, but all four foundations must have the same rank order. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌堆依同花色叠放。点数顺序可自由挑选，但四堆必须采同一种顺序。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built down by same suit from king to ace, then turning the corner from ace to king, and built down to ace a second time. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 K 递减叠放到 A，接着从 A 拐角回到 K，再递减叠放到 A 一次。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built in a matter similar to"
msgstr "王牌区的叠放方式类似"

msgid "The foundations are built up by alternate color, from ace to king, and then wrapping around for a second sequence. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区采红黑交替从 A 递增叠放到 K，再循环叠出第二组顺子。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by rank, regardless of suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依点数递增叠放，不分花色。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same rank, with one pile for each rank from six through king. The order of suits of the cards in the foundations must be the same in each pile. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌堆依相同点数叠放，从 6 到 K 每个点数各一堆。各堆中牌的花色顺序必须完全一致。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king - the game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K——所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king, and any available card can be moved to the foundations. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K，任何可用的牌都能移到王牌区。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king, followed by another King, then back down to Ace, giving 26 cards per pile when the game is won. Only cards in the frame can be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌堆依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K，接着再放一张 K，然后往下回到 A，完成时每堆 26 张。只有外框中的牌能移到王牌区。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌堆即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king. The game is won when all cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K。所有牌都移入王牌区后即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to queen, and there is one additional foundation placed next to the reserve cards where the kings are to be moved. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 Q，另在预备牌旁多放一个王牌堆，K 要移到那里。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from king, turning the corner as necessary, with the queens on top of the finished foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 K 起递增叠放，必要时拐角循环，完成后 Q 刚好各在王牌堆顶端。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from king, turning the corner to ace, then building all the way up to queen. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 K 起叠放，拐角到 A，再接着往上叠到 Q。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, from ace to king, and then wrapping around for a second sequence. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K，再循环叠出第二组顺子。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, starting from the rank dealt to the first foundation at the start of the game, wrapping from king to ace as necessary. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色递增叠放，从开局发到第一王牌堆的点数起头，必要时从 K 循环到 A。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, starting with kings. The ace is then played on the king and the foundations are built up to queen. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 K 起头递增叠放。然后把 A 放到 K 上，一直往上叠到 Q。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, starting with the ace, then the seven is played on the ace and then built up to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色从 A 起头叠放，接着把 7 放到 A 上，再往上叠到 K。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, starting with the ace. Then, the seven is played on the ace, which is then built up to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色递增叠放，从 A 起头。接着把 7 放到 A 上，再一路往上叠到 K。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, starting with the rank dealt to the foundations at the start of the game, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色递增叠放，从开局发到王牌区的点数起头，必要时从 K 拐角到 A。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit, wrapping from king to ace as necessary. The suits can be in any order. Four cards are dealt to four tableau piles, which are built down by alternating colors, once again wrapping from ace to king as needed. Any card or sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles and any card or sequence can fill an empty pile."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色递增叠放，必要时从 K 循环到 A，花色顺序不拘。四个牌列堆各发 4 张牌，牌列堆采红黑交替递减叠放，必要时同样从 A 循环到 K。牌列堆间可移动任何牌或顺子，空列可用任何牌或顺子补入。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit. Cards on the foundations can't be moved. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色递增叠放。王牌区上的牌不能移动。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色递增叠放。所有牌都移入王牌区后即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by suit from ace to jack, but only cards from the top tableau row can be moved to the foundations. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依花色从 A 递增叠放到 J，但只有最上排牌列的牌能移到王牌区。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by suit from ace to king, and the game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依花色从 A 递增叠放到 K，所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by suit, starting from the base rank, and wrapping from king to ace as necessary. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依花色递增叠放，从基准点数起头，必要时从 K 循环到 A。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by suit, with sevens being placed on top of aces. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依花色递增叠放，7 要放在 A 上面。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by suit. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依花色递增叠放。所有牌都移入王牌区后即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations are dealt in a circle of twelve piles, similar to the twelve numbers on a clock, with a thirteenth pile placed in the middle. Each pile represents cards of the number in that position on a clock, with Jacks in the 11 o'clock pile and queens in the 12 o'clock pile. Kings go in the middle."
msgstr "王牌堆发成十二堆的圆环，像时钟上的十二个数字，第十三堆放在中央。每堆对应时钟该位置的数字：J 放 11 点那一堆，Q 放 12 点那一堆，K 放中间那堆。"

msgid "The foundations are of two types. The finish foundations at the top on the left and right, and the build foundations on the bottom. Cards must be played on the foundations by rank in suit order. The finish foundations will only accept cards as a complete set of all twelve suits. The build foundations will accept only one card at a time. The finish foundations will accept three complete sets of suits. The build foundations will accept one. When all four decks are on the foundations in order, you have won. Cards can be moved from the build foundations to the finish foundations or to the tableau. They cannot be moved from the finish foundations."
msgstr "王牌堆分为两类：上方的完成王牌堆分列左右两侧，下方的建构王牌堆在底部。牌必须依点数、按花色顺序出到王牌堆。完成王牌堆只收全十二个花色的完整一轮，且可容纳三轮；建构王牌堆一次只收一张，只收一轮。当四副牌全部依序上到王牌堆时，你就获胜了。牌可以从建构王牌堆移到完成王牌堆或牌列，但不能从完成王牌堆移走。"

msgid "The foundations build either up or down in suit, depending on the first card you play there. They wrap around from King to Ace and Ace to King."
msgstr "王牌堆依花色递增或递减叠放，方向取决于你放入的第一张牌。K 与 A 之间双向皆可循环。"

msgid "The foundations build in ascending suit order from Pine to Paulownia by rank. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time and two redeals are allowed. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依点数往上叠放，花色则按松到桐的升幂顺序。牌山每次发一张，可循环发牌两次。王牌区的牌不能再移出。"

msgid "The foundations build up by rank - suits and colors are irrelevant."
msgstr "王牌区依点数递增叠放——花色与颜色不拘。"

msgid "The foundations build up by rank ignoring color and suit, wrapping around from King to Ace. The base rank is determined at initial dealing."
msgstr "王牌区依点数递增叠放，不问颜色与花色，可从 K 循环到 A。基准点数在初始发牌时决定。"

msgid "The foundations build up by rank ignoring suit. At game start the four Aces are dealt here."
msgstr "王牌区依点数递增叠放，不分花色。开局时四张 A 发到这里。"

msgid "The foundations build up by rank in the same suit."
msgstr "王牌区依同花色按点数递增叠放。"

msgid "The foundations build up from Seven to King and then Ace. You may only move a card from the rows (and not from the reserves) to the foundations if it has an empty left neighbour - this implies that you cannot drop a card from the leftmost column without moving it somewhere else first."
msgstr "王牌区从 7 起往上叠到 K，再接 A。只有左边邻位为空的牌，才能从横排（不能从预备堆）移到王牌区——这代表最左栏的牌若不移到别处，就直接丢不下去。"

msgid "The foundations build up in rank by suit. The Wizards will not move off of the tableau until all the other cards have been moved to the foundations. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌区依花色按点数递增叠放。法师要等其他所有牌都移到王牌区后才肯离开牌列。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations build up in suit from Ace to King."
msgstr "王牌区依花色从 A 递增叠放到 K。"

msgid "The foundations build up in suit from Ace to King. You can only move cards to the foundations once all cards have been placed on the row stacks and the talon is empty."
msgstr "王牌区依花色从 A 递增叠放到 K。必须等所有牌都放到横排堆、且牌山清空后，才能把牌移到王牌区。"

msgid "The foundations build up in suit starting with Ace, then from Seven up to King."
msgstr "王牌区依花色叠放，从 A 起头，接着从 7 往上叠到 K。"

msgid "The foundations build up in suit, wrapping around from King to Ace. The first card moved to the foundations determines the base rank."
msgstr "王牌区依花色递增叠放，可从 K 循环到 A。第一张移入王牌区的牌决定基准点数。"

msgid "The foundations in Moojub are unique in that there are four rows of foundations, containing a number of different columns. If a foundation has been started (at least one card in it), it is built up by suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. An empty foundation can be started by playing a card to it, following these rules:"
msgstr "穆朱布（Moojub）的王牌堆很特别：王牌堆共四排，每排的堆数各不相同。已起堆的王牌堆（至少一张牌）依花色递增叠放，必要时可从 K 拐角到 A。空的王牌堆可依下列规则放入一张牌来起堆："

msgid "The foundations take four complete rounds of a suit. After the last card of the first round is played to a foundation the first card of the second round will play."
msgstr "王牌堆各收同一花色完整四轮。第一轮的最后一张上牌后，第二轮的第一张紧接着上。"

msgid "The foundations take two complete rounds of a suit. After the last card of the first round is played to a foundation the first card of the second round will play."
msgstr "王牌堆各收同一花色完整两轮。第一轮的最后一张上牌后，第二轮的第一张紧接着上。"

msgid "The foundations that start with aces are built up by same suit, while the foundations that start with kings are built down by same suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "以 A 起头的王牌堆依同花色递增叠放，以 K 起头的王牌堆依同花色递减叠放。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations that start with sixes are built down by suit to ace while the foundations that start with sevens are built up by suit to king. A card can be moved from the waste or the tableau to an appropriate foundation. Empty spaces on the tableau can be filled by any other card."
msgstr "以 6 起头的王牌堆依花色递减叠放到 A，以 7 起头的王牌堆依花色递增叠放到 K。牌可以从弃牌堆或牌列移到适合的王牌堆。牌列中的空位可用其他任何牌补入。"

msgid "The foundations with aces are built up by same suit from ace to king, and the foundations with kings are built down by same suit from king to ace."
msgstr "有 A 的王牌堆依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K，有 K 的王牌堆依同花色从 K 递减叠放到 A。"

msgid "The foundations with aces are built up by same suit from ace to king, while the foundations with kings are built down by same suit from king to ace. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "有 A 的王牌堆依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K，有 K 的王牌堆依同花色从 K 递减叠放到 A。所有牌都移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations with kings are built down by same suit, while the foundations with aces are built up by same suit. Only cards from the top six piles can be moved to the top row of foundations, and only cards from the bottom six piles can be moved to the bottom row of foundations."
msgstr "有 K 的王牌区依同花色从 K 往下叠到 A，有 A 的王牌区则依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K。只有上面六堆的牌能移到上排的王牌区，也只有下面六堆的牌能移到下排的王牌区。"

msgid "The foundations with the aces are built up by same suit, while the foundations with the kings are built down by same suit. Cards can be moved between foundations."
msgstr "有 A 的王牌区依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K，有 K 的王牌区则依同花色从 K 往下叠到 A。牌可以在王牌区之间移动。"

msgid "The foundations with the queens are built down by same suit to king, turning the corner from ace to king as necessary, while the middle foundation is built up by same suit to queen, wrapping from king to ace as necessary. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "有 Q 的王牌区依同花色往下叠到 K，必要时可从 A 转角接到 K；中间的王牌区依同花色往上叠到 Q，必要时可从 K 循环到 A。所有牌移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The foundations, located in the corners of the game, are built up by same suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "位于游戏四角的王牌区依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K。所有牌移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The four Aces are dealt to the foundations at game start. The remaining cards are dealt to twelve piles of four cards each, with alternating cards face-down."
msgstr "开局时四张 A 直接发入王牌区。其余的牌发成十二堆、每堆四张，每隔一张发成暗牌。"

msgid "The four Foundations build up by suit the following way: The first pile from Ace, by one. The second pile from Two, by two. The third pile from Three, by three. The fourth pile from Four, by four."
msgstr "四个王牌区依花色往上叠放，方式如下：第一堆从 A 开始、每次加 1；第二堆从 2 开始、每次加 2；第三堆从 3 开始、每次加 3；第四堆从 4 开始、每次加 4。"

msgid "The four aces are dealt to the foundations, and 20 cards are dealt to reserve piles. The reserve piles can hold a single card and are automatically filled from the waste or talon when empty."
msgstr "四张 A 发入王牌区，另有 20 张牌发到预备堆。每个预备堆只能放一张牌，空了会自动由弃牌堆或牌山补满。"

msgid "The four foundations are built up in suit from Ace to King."
msgstr "四个王牌区依花色从 A 往上叠到 K。"

msgid "The four foundations at the top are out of play."
msgstr "上方的四个王牌区不参与游戏。"

msgid "The four foundations below build regardless of suit the following way: The first pile from Two, by one. The second pile from Four, by two. The third pile from Six, by three. The fourth pile from Eight, by four."
msgstr "下方的四个王牌区不分花色叠放，方式如下：第一堆从 2 开始、每次加 1；第二堆从 4 开始、每次加 2；第三堆从 6 开始、每次加 3；第四堆从 8 开始、每次加 4。"

msgid "The four foundations build regardless of suit the following way: The first pile by one. The second pile by two. The third pile by three. The fourth pile by four."
msgstr "四个王牌区不分花色叠放，方式如下：第一堆每次加 1；第二堆每次加 2；第三堆每次加 3；第四堆每次加 4。"

msgid "The four foundations build regardless of suit the following way: The first pile from Ace, by one. The second pile from Two, by two. The third pile from Three, by three. The fourth pile from Four, by four."
msgstr "四个王牌区不分花色叠放，方式如下：第一堆从 A 开始、每次加 1；第二堆从 2 开始、每次加 2；第三堆从 3 开始、每次加 3；第四堆从 4 开始、每次加 4。"

msgid "The four foundations build regardless of suit the following way: The first pile from One, by one. The second pile from Two, by two. The third pile from Three, by three. The fourth pile from Four, by four."
msgstr "四个王牌区不分花色叠放，方式如下：第一堆从 1 开始、每次加 1；第二堆从 2 开始、每次加 2；第三堆从 3 开始、每次加 3；第四堆从 4 开始、每次加 4。"

msgid "The four foundations in the corners build up in suit, wrapping around from King to Ace. The base rank is determined at initial dealing."
msgstr "四角的四个王牌区依花色往上叠放，并从 K 循环到 A。基准点数在最初发牌时决定。"

msgid "The four free cells are located directly above, below, and to the left and right of the center foundation. These can contain a single card, and can only be moved to the foundations. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "四个自由格分别位于中央王牌区的正上方、正下方、左边与右边。每个只能放一张牌，且只能移往王牌区。不允许循环发牌。所有牌移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The four leftmost foundations are built up from ace to king, while the four foundations on the right are built down from king to ace."
msgstr "最左边的四个王牌区从 A 往上叠到 K，右边的四个王牌区从 K 往下叠到 A。"

msgid "The four red aces and four black kings are placed in foundation piles in the middle of the play area. Sixteen cards are dealt in a circle around these foundations, forming the tableau. Specific cards are dealt to the top, bottom, and left, and right-most piles as follows:"
msgstr "四张红色 A 与四张黑色 K 放在游戏区中央的王牌区。十六张牌围着这些王牌区发成一圈，构成牌列。上方、下方、最左与最右各堆会按下述发入特定的牌："

msgid "The four top foundations build up from Ace, while the left four Foundations build down from King. Only the top card of any stack is playable, and the rest of the cards are hidden."
msgstr "上方四个王牌区从 A 开始往上叠，左边四个王牌区从 K 开始往下叠。每堆只有最上面那张牌能出，其余都盖着。"

msgid "The game Maverick was introduced in the 1958 episode of the TV Western \"Maverick\" entitled \"Rope of Cards\"."
msgstr "Maverick 这款游戏出现在 1958 年西部剧集《Maverick》的「Rope of Cards」一集。"

msgid "The game also goes by the name Queen's Foundation. In some variations, depending on which name is used, either the King or Queen is placed on top in the king-queen foundations."
msgstr "这游戏也叫王后的王牌区（Queen's Foundation）。有些变体会依所用名称不同，把 K 或 Q 放在 K、Q 王牌区的最上面。"

msgid "The game begins with five cards on each of the ten rows and the twelve reserve stacks empty. Cards are dealt from the talon ten at a time, one to each row. Rows can be built with cards of any suit in descending rank. Only Rajas can be played on an empty row. All ten suits must be in descending rank order for the game to be won."
msgstr "游戏开始时十个横排各放五张牌，十二个预备堆全空。牌从牌山每次发十张，每个横排各一张。横排可放任何花色的牌，依点数往下叠。只有拉惹（Raja）能放进空的横排。十种花色都要依点数递减排好才算获胜。"

msgid "The game begins with five cards on each of the twelve rows and the ten reserve stacks empty. Cards are dealt from the talon twelve at a time, one to each row. Rows can be built with cards of any suit in descending rank. Only Mirs can be played on an empty row. All twelve suits must be in descending rank order for the game to be won."
msgstr "游戏开始时十二个横排各放五张牌，十个预备堆全空。牌从牌山每次发十二张，每个横排各一张。横排可放任何花色的牌，依点数往下叠。只有米尔（Mir）能放进空的横排。十二种花色都要依点数递减排好才算获胜。"

msgid "The game continues until all four sevens are played. The game is won if all four sequences are completed."
msgstr "游戏进行到四张 7 全部出完为止。四个顺子都完成即获胜。"

msgid "The game ends at 30 moves, but you can continue playing until you get stuck, to try and earn as many points as possible."
msgstr "游戏在第 30 步结束，但你可以继续玩到卡住为止，设法尽量多拿分数。"

msgid "The game is over when all cards have been flipped over in one sequence, from ace through king. A winning score is 75 points or more."
msgstr "所有牌在同一轮中从 A 依序翻到 K，游戏就结束。获胜分数为 75 分以上。"

msgid "The game is played similar to"
msgstr "这游戏的玩法类似"

msgid "The game is played with only the cards ranked from seven through king, and aces. Cards are dealt into eight piles of four cards. Exposed cards of the same rank in the tableau can be removed."
msgstr "这游戏只用 7 到 K 以及 A 的牌。牌发成八堆、每堆四张。牌列中点数相同且面朝上的牌可以移除。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "所有牌移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations, resulting in the Sultan surrounded by his queens."
msgstr "所有牌移入王牌区即获胜，结果是苏丹被他的王后们环绕。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards are moved to the waste pile, except for the immovable kings."
msgstr "除了动不了的 K 之外，所有牌都移入弃牌堆即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards are removed from the tableau."
msgstr "牌列中的所有牌都被移除即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards aside from the unmovable tens are removed."
msgstr "除了无法移动的 10 之外，其余牌全部移除即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards can be moved to their appropriate foundations, thus uniting the four kingdoms."
msgstr "所有牌都能移到各自合适的王牌区即获胜，四个王国因此团聚。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards have been discarded to the foundation."
msgstr "所有牌都弃入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards have been moved to the foundations, except the four aces and the fool, which are to be moved to the separate piles."
msgstr "所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜，但四张 A 与愚者牌要移到另外独立的牌堆。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards have been moved to the foundations, except the four aces, which are to be moved to the separate piles."
msgstr "所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜，但四张 A 要移到另外独立的牌堆。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards other than the queens are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "除了 Q 之外，所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all the cards can be moved to the foundation in a single sequence."
msgstr "所有牌能以同一段顺子移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all the clubs have been moved to the foundation."
msgstr "所有梅花都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if all tiles from the talon can be played to the playing area."
msgstr "牌山的牌块全都能放到游戏区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if every card is flipped face-down at the same time."
msgstr "所有牌同时都面朝下即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if the talon is emptied."
msgstr "牌山被清空即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if you can remove all cards in four groups of 91."
msgstr "能把所有牌分成四组总和 91 全部移除即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if you manage to clear all of the tiles."
msgstr "能清掉所有牌块即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if you're able to discard all the monster cards in the tableau."
msgstr "能把牌列中所有怪兽牌都丢掉即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won if you're able to move all cards to the rows, and all the piles are placed correctly."
msgstr "能把所有牌移到横排上、且各堆都摆对位置即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won once all cards are moved to the foundations. Unlimited redeals are allowed, so all games should turn out eventually."
msgstr "所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。循环发牌次数不限，所以每局最终都应该能过关。"

msgid "The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations in the two rings."
msgstr "所有牌都移入两圈王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won when all cards are removed in this way except for the four aces."
msgstr "除了四张 A 之外，所有牌都以这种方式移除即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won when all cards have been matched up and moved to the foundation."
msgstr "所有牌都配对完成并移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won when all eight foundations are filled."
msgstr "八个王牌区全部填满即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won when all of the cards have been moved to the foundation."
msgstr "所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won when all of the cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won when only one card remains."
msgstr "只剩一张牌时即获胜。"

msgid "The game is won when the king of hearts is brought to his \"bride\", the queen, as in, all cards between them have been removed."
msgstr "红心 K 能送到他的「新娘」Q 身边即获胜，也就是两者之间的牌全部移除。"

msgid "The goal of The Bogey is to get all the cards in as few columns as possible. Though the maximum you are allowed to win the game is 12, you can get a better score by using even fewer columns:"
msgstr "幽灵（The Bogey）的目标是把所有牌尽量放到最少的几栏。虽然最多允许用 12 栏过关，但用更少的栏数可以拿到更高分："

msgid "The highest possible score for a single hand is 2336 points."
msgstr "单局最高可能得分是 2336 分。"

msgid "The horizontal offset of the cards"
msgstr "卡牌的水平位移量"

msgid "The invention of Rittenhouse is credited to Captain Geoffrey T. Spaulding, the notable African explorer. Captain Spaulding is actually a character played by Groucho Marx in the 1930 film, Animal Crackers. The name Rittenhouse comes from Mrs. Rittenhouse, a millionaire he tries to impress during the film."
msgstr "Rittenhouse 据说是著名的非洲探险家斯鲍汀队长（Captain Geoffrey T. Spaulding）发明的。斯鲍汀队长其实是格鲁乔·马克斯（Groucho Marx）在 1930 年电影《Animal Crackers》中饰演的角色。Rittenhouse 这个名字则来自瑞登豪斯太太（Mrs. Rittenhouse），是电影中他极力想讨好的百万富翁。"

msgid "The layout consist of 4 foundations in the middle, 8 row stacks (4 on each of the left and right side), 2 reserve stacks (one on each of the left and right side), and a free cell in the middle."
msgstr "版面由中间的 4 个王牌区、8 个横排堆（左右各 4 个）、2 个预备堆（左右各 1 个），以及中央的 1 个自由格组成。"

msgid "The layout consist of a Braid of 20 cards, two groups of four helper fields, four braid fields (each showing a picture of a braid), the waste pile, and the eight foundations. The first card automatically dealt to a Foundation sets the beginning value for all foundations, and an indicator displays the value of that card."
msgstr "版面由一条 20 张牌的辫子（Braid）排列、两组各四个辅助格、四个辫子格（每个显示一张辫子图案）、弃牌堆，以及八个王牌区组成。第一张自动发入王牌区的牌会决定所有王牌区的起始值，并由指示器显示那张牌的点数。"

msgid "The layout consists of three rows of playing piles, a row for newly- dealt cards, and a castoff pile for Aces."
msgstr "版面由三排牌列堆、一排新发的牌，以及一个专门丢 A 的舍牌堆组成。"

msgid "The leftmost foundation starts with a king, and each foundation starts with one rank lower than the one to the left of it. Therefore, the foundations begin with K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-6 from left to right, and are built to A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7 respectively."
msgstr "最左边的王牌区以 K 起头，每个王牌区的起点都比它左边那个低一个点数。因此王牌区由左到右依次以 K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-6 起头，并分别叠到 A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7。"

msgid "The license was changed to the GPLv3 or newer."
msgstr "授权条款改为 GPLv3 或更新版本。"

msgid "The main tableau is set up in the shape of a casket, with the body of the casket containing 8 cards, with a 5 card lid on top. A face-down reserve of 13 cards is placed inside the casket. This reserve is called the jewels."
msgstr "主牌列排成棺柩的形状，棺身放 8 张牌，上面盖着 5 张牌的棺盖。棺内再放 13 张面朝下的预备牌，这组预备堆称为珠宝。"

msgid "The max iterations setting controls how many game states the solver can review for that given game. A higher number means the solver is more accurate, but takes longer to run."
msgstr "最大迭代次数的设定会控制解题器一局中能检查多少个游戏状态。数字越大，解题器越准确，但执行也越久。"

msgid "The most common layout is the Traditional layout, in which the tiles are arranged as follows:"
msgstr "最常见的版面是传统版面（Traditional），牌块的排列方式如下："

msgid "The name \"Proil\" is a distortion of \"Pair Royal\", which describes a three-of-a-kind in Cribbage."
msgstr "「Proil」这个名称是「Pair Royal」的讹变，指的是克里比奇（Cribbage）里的三张同点。"

msgid "The name Salic Law is reference to an ancient Frankish law, which prevented women from claiming the throne or earning inheritance."
msgstr "萨利克法（Salic Law）这个名称源自古代法兰克的一部法律，这部法律禁止女性继承王位或遗产。"

msgid "The name of the game comes from its objective, to \"strip\" the queens of the covering cards."
msgstr "游戏名称来自它的目标：把盖在 Q 上面的牌全部「剥掉」。"

msgid "The name of the game comes from the fact that the lower foundation cards - the Jacks with their entourages - end up adjacent to the Kings and Queens as if having an audience with them."
msgstr "游戏名称来自于：王牌区中点数较低的牌，也就是 J 和它们的随从，最后会紧挨着 K 与 Q，仿佛前去谒见一般。"

msgid "The name of the game comes from the fact that the queens are surrounded by the other foundation cards."
msgstr "游戏名称来自 Q 被其他王牌区的牌环绕这一点。"

msgid "The name of the game comes from the fact that when calculating the foundation ranks, you subtract thirteen from any number over thirteen."
msgstr "游戏名称来自计算王牌区点数时，超过 13 的数字都要减掉 13。"

msgid "The name of the game comes from the way a single card (especially an immovable king) can \"guard\" multiple cards beneath them."
msgstr "游戏名称来自一张牌（尤其是一张动不了的 K）可以「看守」下方好几张牌这件事。"

msgid "The number of cards in the cardset, generally 42, 48, 52, 68, 78, 96 or 120"
msgstr "牌组的张数，通常为 42、48、52、68、78、96 或 120"

msgid "The object is to group the cards in descending sets of 13 cards of the same suit. These sequences may wrap around as well. Such groups can then be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "目标是把牌分成同花色、点数递减的 13 张一组。这些顺子也可以循环。成组之后就能移入王牌区。"

msgid "The object is to group the cards in sets of 13 cards, from King to Ace of the same suit. Such groups can be moved to a free space and then off the game by a mouseclick."
msgstr "目标是把牌分成 13 张一组，同花色从 K 到 A。成组的牌可以移到空位，再按一下鼠标就移出游戏。"

msgid "The object is to group the cards in sets of 13 cards, from King to Ace of the same suit. Such groups can be moved to the Foundations."
msgstr "目标是把牌分成 13 张一组，同花色从 K 到 A。成组的牌可以移入王牌区。"

msgid "The object is to remove all the cards from the tableau by playing them to the waste stack. Cards from the tableau will play to the waste if they are one rank higher or lower than the card at the top of the waste. A King will play on an Ace and vice versa. Cards are played to the waste by clicking on them. In variations with scoring, points are made as follows:"
msgstr "目标是把牌列中的所有牌都出到弃牌堆来清光。只要比弃牌堆最上面的牌高或低一个点数，牌列的牌就能出到弃牌堆。K 可以出在 A 上，反之亦然。点击牌即可把它出到弃牌堆。在有计分的变体中，得分方式如下："

msgid "The object is to use up all the cards from the tableau by discarding pairs of cards that add up to fourteen in rank."
msgstr "目标是丢弃点数相加为 14 的牌对，把牌列中的所有牌用完。"

msgid "The object is to use up all the cards from the tableau by discarding pairs of cards that total up to 13, and the cards are then replaced from the talon. Kings can be removed on their own."
msgstr "目标是丢弃点数合计为 13 的牌对，把牌列中的所有牌用完，再由牌山补牌。K 可以单独移除。"

msgid "The object is to use up all the cards from the tableau by discarding pairs of cards with ranks that total 14 (Jacks are 11, Queens are 12, and Kings are 13). You can only discard pairs if the cards are in the same row or column."
msgstr "目标是丢弃点数合计为 14 的牌对（J 为 11、Q 为 12、K 为 13），把牌列中的所有牌用完。只有位于同一横排或同一直行时才能丢弃牌对。"

msgid "The object is to use up all the cards from the tableau, placing them on the single foundation. You can only put a card on top of another card when the numerical values of the two cards adds up to 13 and the two cards are touching horizontally, vertically or diagonally (i.e. the cards have to be"
msgstr "目标是把牌列中的所有牌都放到那个唯一的王牌区上。只有两张牌的数值相加为 13，而且两牌在横向、纵向或对角相邻时，才能把一张叠在另一张上（也就是牌必须"

msgid "The object is to use up all the cards from the talon, placing them on the Tower. Deal cards from the talon one at a time. You can only put a card on top of another card when the numerical values of the two cards adds up to 14. King is worth 13, Queen is worth 12 and Jack is worth 11. You do not have to follow suit."
msgstr "目标是把牌山中的所有牌都用到牌塔上。牌从牌山逐张翻出。只有两张牌的数值相加为 14 时，才能把一张叠在另一张上。K 值 13、Q 值 12、J 值 11。不必跟同花色。"

msgid "The object of each of these games is to use up all the cards in building Foundations, or to use up all cards in the Talon according to the rules of the particular game. If all the cards are used up, you win. If not, you lose."
msgstr "这些游戏的目标都是把牌全部用完来叠出王牌区，或是依各游戏的规则用完牌山中的所有牌。牌全部用完就赢，否则就输。"

msgid "The odds against winning this game are high."
msgstr "这游戏的获胜概率很低。"

msgid "The odds against winning this game are high. Try moving cards off of the deepest piles first."
msgstr "这游戏的获胜概率很低。试着先从最深的牌堆移走牌。"

msgid "The offset of the horizontal shadow (mostly 7)"
msgstr "水平阴影的偏移量（多为 7）"

msgid "The offset of the vertical shadow (mostly 7)"
msgstr "垂直阴影的偏移量（多为 7）"

msgid "The one of hearts, and a two, three, and four are dealt to the foundations. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be played to the foundations."
msgstr "红心的 A，以及一张 2、一张 3、一张 4 会发入王牌区。牌从牌山逐张翻出，可以出到王牌区。"

msgid "The only function of the Wizards in this game is to block the waste stack at the worst possible time."
msgstr "这游戏中法师唯一的作用，就是在最要命的时机堵住弃牌堆。"

msgid "The origin (country) of the cardset"
msgstr "牌组的来源（国家）"

msgid "The other exception is the extra reserve stack just to the right of the rows and the top foundations. This reserve stack has the potential to save a game that would otherwise be lost. The way it works is this. When empty it will accept any Wizard card, but only from a foundation. Once a Wizard has been played on it, it will accept any two cards from any of the row stacks. Once played on the stack, cards can only be removed by playing them to a foundation."
msgstr "另一个例外是横排与上方王牌区右侧多出来的那个预备堆。这个预备堆有机会救回本来会输的一局。它的运作方式是：空的时候可接受任何法师牌，但只能来自王牌区。放入法师牌后，就能从任何横排堆接受任意两张牌。牌放进这个堆之后，只能靠移往王牌区才能移除。"

msgid "The other exception is the extra reserve stack just to the right of the rows and the top foundations. This reserve stack has the potential to save a game that would otherwise be lost. The way it works is this. When empty it will accept any Wizard card, but only from a foundation. Once a Wizard has been played on it, it will accept one card only from any row stack. Once played on the stack, cards can only be remove from it to a foundation."
msgstr "另一个例外是横排与上方王牌区右侧多出来的那个预备堆。这个预备堆有机会救回本来会输的一局。它的运作方式是：空的时候可接受任何法师牌，但只能来自王牌区。放入法师牌后，就只能从某个横排堆接受一张牌。牌放进这个堆之后，只能移往王牌区。"

msgid "The other exception is the reserve stack just to the right of the foundations. This stack will take any three cards from any of the rows. Once played there however, a card may not be removed except by playing it to a foundation."
msgstr "另一个例外是王牌区右侧的那个预备堆。这个堆可从任何横排放入任意三张牌。但一旦放进去，除了移往王牌区之外就不能移除。"

msgid "The other exception is the reserve stack just to the right of the foundations. This stack will take any two cards from any of the rows. Once played there however, a card may not be removed except by playing it to a foundation."
msgstr "另一个例外是王牌区右侧的那个预备堆。这个堆可从任何横排放入任意两张牌。但一旦放进去，除了移往王牌区之外就不能移除。"

msgid "The other game"
msgstr "另一个游戏"

msgid "The pieces are dealt to a grid, based on the size of the matrix, with a single blank space left. Pieces may not be lifted from the canvas. They may be moved by clicking on a piece which is in either the row or the column which has the empty spot. That piece and all intervening pieces will move one space towards the empty spot."
msgstr "牌块会依矩阵大小发成网格状，并留下一个空位。牌块不能从版面上拿起来。可以点击空位所在横排或直行中的牌块来移动，该牌块与其间的所有牌块都会朝空位移动一格。"

msgid "The pieces are dealt to a grid, based on the size of the puzzle. You may swap any two pieces freely. Your goal is to arrange all the pieces to successfully, and accurately, complete the picture."
msgstr "牌块会依谜题大小发成网格状。你可以自由互换任意两块。目标是把所有牌块排好，准确拼出完整的图案。"

msgid "The piles at the bottom of the screen represent the player's hand. Whenever a card is dealt from the talon, the player picks up the corresponding pile, places the dealt card at the bottom of the hand plays any cards that can be played, and replaces the hand to the pile that was picked up."
msgstr "屏幕下方的牌堆代表玩家的手牌。每当牌山翻出一张牌，玩家就拿起对应的那堆，把发到的牌放到手牌最下面，出掉所有能出的牌，再把手牌放回原本拿起的那堆。"

msgid "The piles build down by alternate color. Only one card can be moved at a time, and empty piles can be filled with any card."
msgstr "牌堆依红黑交替往下叠。一次只能移动一张牌，空堆可用任何牌补上。"

msgid "The piles build down by alternate color. Sequences may be moved, but an empty pile can be only be filled with a"
msgstr "牌堆依红黑交替往下叠。顺子可以移动，但空堆只能用一张"

msgid "The piles build down by rank regardless of suit. Only one card can be moved at a time. Empty piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "牌堆不分花色，依点数往下叠。一次只能移动一张牌。空堆不能补牌。"

msgid "The playing field, where the main action occurs. Usually allows building."
msgstr "主要的游戏区域，大部分动作都在这里进行。通常允许叠牌。"

msgid "The playing piles build down by rank regardless of suit. Only the top card is available for play, and empty rows may be filled with any single card."
msgstr "牌列堆不分花色，依点数往下叠。只有最上面那张牌可以出，空的横排可用任何单张牌补上。"

msgid "The playing piles build down by rank, regardless of suit. A king may be played on an ace. An empty pile can receive any card, or sequence."
msgstr "牌列堆不分花色，依点数往下叠。K 可以出在 A 上。空堆可以放任何一张牌或顺子。"

msgid "The playing piles build down by same suit. Only the top card is available for play, and empty rows cannot be filled. When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon to the tableau piles until each pile has at least three cards. If the piles already have at least three cards each, the remaining talon cards can be dealt one at a time."
msgstr "牌列堆依同花色往下叠。只有最上面那张牌可以出，空的横排不能补牌。没有步可走时，可以从牌山发牌到牌列堆，让每堆至少补到三张。若各堆已有至少三张，牌山剩下的牌就能逐张翻出。"

msgid "The preset option determines the configuration that the solver uses. The different configurations affect how the solver goes about trying to find a solution. More details on the different preset options can be found on the fc-solve website."
msgstr "默认选项决定解题器使用的配置。不同配置会影响解题器寻找解法的方式。各默认选项的详细说明可在 fc-solve 网站找到。"

msgid "The queen of hearts is placed on top of the deck and the king on the bottom."
msgstr "红心 Q 放在整副牌最上面，红心 K 放在最下面。"

msgid "The ranks of a full sequence of cards, from ace to king, will total 91. But there are other possible sequences too."
msgstr "从 A 到 K 的完整顺子，点数总和为 91。但还有其他可能的顺子。"

msgid "The red face cards and aces are removed from the deck."
msgstr "从这副牌中移除红色的人头牌与 A。"

msgid "The red foundations are built down by same suit from king to ace, while the black foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "红色王牌区依同花色从 K 往下叠到 A，黑色王牌区依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K。所有牌移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The release packages have been updated to use the latest version of Python, and all the dependent libraries."
msgstr "发行包已更新为使用最新版本的 Python 与所有依赖库。"

msgid "The remainder of the deck after all the original cards have been dealt and are usually kept faced down."
msgstr "原本的牌全部发完后剩下的牌，通常面朝下放置。"

msgid "The remaining cards are dealt to eight piles of twelve cards each. Cards from the tableau can be moved to appropriate foundations. When there are no moves left, you are allowed additional redeals by taking each tableau piles, and dealing the cards from it to other tableau piles, starting from it and going right. You are allowed to redeal each pile once, going from left to right."
msgstr "剩下的牌发成八堆、每堆十二张。牌列的牌可以移到合适的王牌区。没有步可走时，允许额外的循环发牌：拿起每一堆牌列，从该堆开始往右，把其中的牌发到其他牌列堆。每堆都由左而右允许循环发牌一次。"

msgid "The remaining six tableau piles on the top half of the tableau are built down by same color, and only red cards are allowed to be built. The last six tableau piles on the bottom half are built up by same color, with only black cards allowed to be built on. A single red card in the bottom tableau can be switched with a single black card in the top. Empty piles in the tableau are immediately filled with the top card from the waste pile. If the waste and talon are empty, they can be filled with any card."
msgstr "牌列上半部剩下的六堆牌列堆依同色往下叠，而且只准放红色的牌。下半部最后六堆依同色往上叠，只准放黑色的牌。下方牌列的一张红色牌可以和上方的一张黑色牌互换。牌列中的空堆会立刻用弃牌堆顶牌补满。若弃牌堆与牌山都空了，就可以用任何牌补上。"

msgid "The remaining two cards are dealt to reserves, and can be moved to an appropriate tableau pile at any time."
msgstr "剩下的两张牌发到预备堆，随时可以移到合适的牌列堆。"

msgid "The requirement to provide Installation Information does not include a requirement to continue to provide support service, warranty, or updates for a work that has been modified or installed by the recipient, or for the User Product in which it has been modified or installed. Access to a network may be denied when the modification itself materially and adversely affects the operation of the network or violates the rules and protocols for communication across the network."
msgstr "提供安装信息的要求，并不包含必须持续为受让人修改或安装的作品、或进行修改或安装时所在的用户产品提供支持服务、保证或更新。当修改本身严重影响网络运作，或违反跨网络通信的规则与协议时，可以拒绝提供网络访问。"

msgid "The reserve piles can hold a single card and are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "每个预备堆只能放一张牌，并会自动由弃牌堆或牌山补满。"

msgid "The reserve stack will take any four cards from the rows."
msgstr "预备堆可从横排放入任意四张牌。"

msgid "The reserve stack will take any single card from the rows."
msgstr "预备堆可从横排放入任意一张牌。"

msgid "The row stacks and reserve stacks grow from the middle and are laid out open, but only the outer card is in play."
msgstr "横排堆与预备堆都从中间向外增长、摊开排列，但只有最外面那张牌可以使用。"

msgid "The row stacks build down in alternate color. Sequences may be moved, and spaces may be filled by any"
msgstr "横排堆依红黑交替往下叠。顺子可以移动，空位则可以用任何"

msgid "The rows are built up in same suit by threes, so in sequences of the following:"
msgstr "横排依同花色每次加 3 往上叠，也就是形成如下顺子："

msgid "The rows build down in rank in the same suit. The foundations build with cards of the same rank in suit order. Any card may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "横排依同花色、点数往下叠。王牌区依花色顺序放入相同点数的牌。空的横排可以放任何一张牌。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build from fourth to first. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable on the tableau. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Any card or correctly ordered pile may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "横排依花色从第一级叠到第四级。王牌区则从第四级叠到第一级。第三与第四级（废牌）在牌列中不能互相替换。牌不能从王牌区拿出。任何一张牌或顺序正确的牌堆都可以放到空的横排上。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build from fourth to first. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable on the tableau. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time and there is no redeal."
msgstr "横排依花色从第一级叠到第四级。王牌区则从第四级叠到第一级。第三与第四级（废牌）在牌列中不能互相替换。牌不能从王牌区拿出。牌从牌山每次发三张，且不循环发牌。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build from fourth to first. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable on the tableau. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. Any card or sequence stack may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "横排依花色从第一级叠到第四级。王牌区则从第四级叠到第一级。第三与第四级（废牌）在牌列中不能互相替换。牌不能从王牌区拿出。牌从牌山每次发三张。任何一张牌或成顺的牌堆都可以放到空的横排上。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build from fourth to first. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable on the tableau. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. Only first rank cards or correctly ordered piles may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "横排依花色从第一级叠到第四级。王牌区则从第四级叠到第一级。第三与第四级（废牌）在牌列中不能互相替换。牌不能从王牌区拿出。牌从牌山每次发三张。只有第一级的牌或顺序正确的牌堆可以放到空的横排上。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build from fourth to first. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable on the tableau. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Only first rank cards or correctly ordered piles may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "横排依花色从第一级叠到第四级。王牌区则从第四级叠到第一级。第三与第四级（废牌）在牌列中不能互相替换。牌不能从王牌区拿出。只有第一级的牌或顺序正确的牌堆可以放到空的横排上。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build in ascending suit order from Pine to Phoenix by rank. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable on the tableau. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time and there is no limit to the number of redeals. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Only first rank cards may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "横排依花色从第一级叠到第四级。王牌区依花色递增顺序（从松到凤）按点数叠放。第三与第四级（废牌）在牌列中不能互相替换。牌从牌山每次发三张，循环发牌次数不限。牌不能从王牌区拿出。只有第一级的牌可以放到空的横排上。"

msgid "The sample plugins provided on the PySolFC website and any plugin files generated by the Solitaire Wizard are fully vetted, and safe to use."
msgstr "PySolFC 网站提供的示例插件，以及接龙法师生成的所有插件文件，都经过完整审核，可安心使用。"

msgid "The set of cards used. Most games use a STANDARD DECK, but games that use a DOUBLE DECK, a JOKER DECK, or a STRIPPED DECK are not uncommon."
msgstr "所使用的牌组。多数游戏使用标准副牌，但使用双副牌、鬼牌副牌或精简副牌的游戏并不少见。"

msgid "The seven free cells (also called the"
msgstr "七个自由格（也称为"

msgid "The seven piles build down by same suit, wrapping around from Ace to King. Empty spaces may only be filled by a card or a sequence one below the Beak's rank."
msgstr "七堆依同花色往下叠，并从 A 循环到 K。空位只能用比 Beak 低一点数的牌或顺子补上。"

msgid "The single foundation is built up by same suit, starting with the ace of clubs, through the king of clubs. Once the king has been played, the ace of the next suit is the next card to be played to the foundation. The sequence of suits is as follows:"
msgstr "那个唯一的王牌区依同花色往上叠，从梅花 A 开始，一路叠到梅花 K。K 出完后，接着要出下一花色的 A 到王牌区。花色顺序如下："

msgid "The single foundation is started with the ace of hearts. After the ace of hearts is played, it is built up by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from king to ace as needed. The game is won if all cards are moved to this one foundation."
msgstr "那个唯一的王牌区以红心 A 起头。红心 A 出上之后，就不分花色、依点数往上叠，必要时可从 K 转角接到 A。所有牌都移入这个王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "The sixes and sevens are dealt to two rings of foundation piles. Eight cards are dealt to eight tableau piles. The foundations with the sevens are built up by suit to king, while the foundations with the sixes are built down by suit to aces."
msgstr "6 与 7 会发成两圈王牌区。八张牌发到八个牌列堆。有 7 的王牌区依花色往上叠到 K，有 6 的王牌区依花色往下叠到 A。"

msgid "The solvers may need to be installed separately to use them, depending on your PySol configuration."
msgstr "视你的 PySol 设定而定，解题器可能需要另行安装才能使用。"

msgid "The subtype of the cardset. Usually 0 - for French type cardsets, a value of 1 is used if there are jokers. For Puzzle type cardsets, it is the number of pieces per row/column."
msgstr "牌组的子类型。通常为 0——法式牌组若有鬼牌就使用 1。谜题类牌组则为每横排／每直行的块数。"

msgid "The table tiles look strange"
msgstr "桌面牌块看起来怪怪的"

msgid "The tableau cards are dealt in twelve piles of eight card. The eight aces are dealt to start the foundations. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Any valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Only kings can be played in empty piles."
msgstr "牌列的牌发成十二堆、每堆八张。八张 A 会发下去起头王牌区。牌列堆不分花色、依点数往下叠。任何有效的顺子都能在牌列堆之间移动。空堆只能放 K。"

msgid "The tableau consists of four piles, starting with one card each. The cards can be stacked according to the following rules"
msgstr "牌列由四堆组成，每堆开始各一张牌。牌可以依下列规则叠放"

msgid "The tableau consists of one reserve stack and five row stacks. Fourteen cards are dealt to the reserve stack and one card each to the row stacks. When a row stack is emptied it must be filled from the reserve stack first. When the reserve stack is empty any card can be played on an empty row stack. Wizards are wild - any card can be played on them, and they can be played on any card. The Wizards have ranks like the suit cards corresponding to Ace through Four. If a Wizard is played in it's proper rank position the row can still be moved, otherwise, the full sequence can't be moved. The row stacks build down in rank by alternate colors."
msgstr "牌列由一个预备堆和五个横排堆组成。十四张牌发到预备堆，每个横排堆各发一张。横排堆被清空时，必须先用预备堆补满。预备堆空了之后，空的横排堆就可以放任何一张牌。法师是万用牌——任何牌都可以放在法师上，法师也可以放在任何牌上。法师有和花色牌一样的点数，分别对应 A 到 4。若法师放在它正确的点数位置，该横排仍可整体移动，否则整条顺子就不能移动。横排堆依红黑交替、点数往下叠。"

msgid "The tableau consists of one reserve stack, one Trumps only row stack, and five row stacks. Fourteen cards are dealt to the reserve stack and one card each to the row stacks. When a row stack is emptied it must be filled from the reserve stack first. When the reserve stack is empty any card can be played on an empty row stack. The Trumps only stack is left empty and can be played on at will. The row stacks build down in rank by alternate colors. The Trumps can be played as either color. The Trumps only row stack also builds down in rank. It will accept a stack of cards that contains suit cards as long as the bottom card is a Trump. The foundations build up in rank by suit."
msgstr "牌列由一个预备堆、一个只放将牌的横排堆，以及五个横排堆组成。十四张牌发到预备堆，每个横排堆各发一张。横排堆被清空时，必须先用预备堆补满。预备堆空了之后，空的横排堆就可以放任何一张牌。只放将牌的那个横排堆保持空置，可随意放牌。横排堆依红黑交替、点数往下叠。将牌可以当任一色使用。只放将牌的横排堆也依点数往下叠，只要最下面那张是将牌，它就能接受包含花色牌的整堆牌。王牌区依花色、点数往上叠。"

msgid "The tableau consists of one reserve stack, two Trumps only row stacks, and nine row stacks. Twenty-eight cards are dealt to the reserve stack and one card each to the row stacks. When a row stack is emptied it must be filled from the reserve stack first. When the reserve stack is empty any card can be played on an empty row stack. The Trumps only stacks are left empty and can be played on at will. The row stacks build down in rank by alternate colors. The Trumps can be played as either color. The Trumps only row stacks also build down in rank. They will accept a stack of cards that contains suit cards as long as the bottom card is a Trump. The foundations build up in rank by suit."
msgstr "牌列由一个预备堆、两个只放将牌的横排堆，以及九个横排堆组成。二十八张牌发到预备堆，每个横排堆各发一张。横排堆被清空时，必须先用预备堆补满。预备堆空了之后，空的横排堆就可以放任何一张牌。只放将牌的横排堆保持空置，可随意放牌。横排堆依红黑交替、点数往下叠。将牌可以当任一色使用。只放将牌的横排堆也依点数往下叠，只要最下面那张是将牌，它们就能接受包含花色牌的整堆牌。王牌区依花色、点数往上叠。"

msgid "The tableau consists of sixteen piles of six cards, and may be built up or down by suit. When building tableau piles, sequences can turn the corner, so aces may be played on kings and vice versa. However, this cannot be done in the foundation."
msgstr "牌列由十六堆、每堆六张组成，可依花色往上或往下叠。叠牌列堆时顺子可以转角，所以 A 可以放在 K 上，反之亦然。但王牌区不能这样做。"

msgid "The tableau consists of twenty piles of three cards, and may be built up or down by suit. When building tableau piles, sequences can turn the corner, so aces may be played on kings and vice versa. However, this cannot be done in the foundation."
msgstr "牌列由二十堆、每堆三张组成，可依花色往上或往下叠。叠牌列堆时顺子可以转角，所以 A 可以放在 K 上，反之亦然。但王牌区不能这样做。"

msgid "The tableau is arranged in thirteen piles of four cards each. Cards can be moved from the tableau to a reserve, which is built up by rank, regardless of suit. A sequence of cards can then be moved from the reserve to the foundation (single cards can't be moved)."
msgstr "牌列排成十三堆、每堆四张。牌可以从牌列移到预备堆，预备堆不分花色、依点数往上叠。接着可以从预备堆把顺子移到王牌区（单张牌不能移动）。"

msgid "The tableau is arranged in thirteen piles of four cards each. The row builds up or down by rank ignoring color and suit, wrapping around from King to Ace and from Ace to King."
msgstr "牌列排成十三堆、每堆四张。横排不分花色与颜色，依点数往上或往下叠，并可从 K 循环到 A、从 A 循环到 K。"

msgid "The tableau is built down by alternate color. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Cards from the reserve can be moved to the tableau or foundation, but cards cannot be moved to the reserves."
msgstr "牌列依红黑交替往下叠。任何一张牌或有效的顺子都能在牌列堆之间移动。预备堆的牌可以移到牌列或王牌区，但牌不能移进预备堆。"

msgid "The tableau is dealt in a circle of twelve piles, similar to the twelve numbers on a clock, with a thirteenth pile placed in the middle. Each pile represents cards of the number in that position on a clock, with Jacks in the 11 o'clock pile and queens in the 12 o'clock pile. Kings go in the middle."
msgstr "牌列发成十二堆围成一圈，就像时钟上的十二个数字，第十三堆放在中央。每堆代表该钟点位置的点数，J 放在 11 点那堆，Q 放在 12 点那堆。K 放在中央。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Cards from the reserve row can be moved to an appropriate tableau or foundation pile, but building on this reserve row is not allowed. Empty piles in this row are immediately filled from the adjacent reserve pile."
msgstr "牌列堆依红黑交替往下叠，任何一张牌或有效的顺子都能在牌列堆之间移动。预备横排的牌可以移到合适的牌列堆或王牌区，但不可以在这条预备横排上叠牌。该横排的空堆会立刻由相邻的预备堆补上。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, with any face-up card or valid sequence of cards being movable. Once the top card is moved, the two below it can be flipped face-up and played. Empty piles cannot be filled, except for the final single card, where a king or sequence of cards starting with a king can be played."
msgstr "牌列堆依红黑交替往下叠，任何面朝上的牌或有效的顺子都可以移动。最上面那张移走后，下面那两张就能翻到面朝上并出牌。空堆不能补牌，只有最后那张单牌除外，那一堆可以放 K 或以 K 开头的顺子。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built down by alternate color. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles. Empty tableau piles are immediately filled from the top card of the reserve. If the reserve is empty, only sevens or sequences of cards starting with a seven can be moved to tableau piles. You can also move cards from the top of the reserve to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "牌列堆依红黑交替往下叠。任何一张牌或有效的顺子都能在堆之间移动。空的牌列堆会立刻用预备堆顶牌补满。预备堆空了之后，只能把 7 或以 7 开头的顺子移到牌列堆。你也可以把预备堆最上面的牌移到牌列或王牌区。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built down by same suit. Single cards can be moved between tableau piles, or cards from the reserve can be moved to a tableau pile. Empty tableau piles are immediately filled from the reserve. Foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king."
msgstr "牌列堆依同花色往下叠。单张牌能在牌列堆之间移动，预备堆的牌也可以移到牌列堆。空的牌列堆会立刻由预备堆补上。王牌区依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built down, regardless of suit. However, sequences that are all of the same suit are preferred because these are available for further movement. An empty tableau pile can only be filled by a king."
msgstr "牌列堆不分花色往下叠。不过全为同一花色的顺子较为理想，因为它们还能继续移动。空的牌列堆只能用 K 补上。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built in a pyramid-esque layout, with all cards dealt to alternating rows of ten and eleven cards. Each card forms a tableau pile which can be built down by alternate color. Only single cards can be moved, though sequences can be moved based on the number of six open free cells. The bottom layer cards can be filled with a king when empty, but the remaining layers cannot be filled."
msgstr "牌列堆排成类似金字塔的版面，所有牌发成 10 张与 11 张交错的横排。每张牌各自成一堆，可依红黑交替往下叠。一次只能移动单张牌，但顺子能否移动取决于六个自由格中空下几个。底层的空堆可以用 K 补上，其余层不能补。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built in a pyramid-esque layout, with eleven cards in the top layer, ten cards in the middle, and nine on the bottom. Each card forms a tableau pile which can be built down by alternate color. The three bottom layer cards can be filled with a king when empty, but the remaining layers cannot be filled."
msgstr "牌列堆排成类似金字塔的版面，上层 11 张、中层 10 张、下层 9 张。每张牌各自成一堆，可依红黑交替往下叠。下层那三张形成的空堆可以用 K 补上，其余层不能补。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built in a pyramid-esque layout, with eleven cards in the top layer, ten cards in the middle, and nine on the bottom. The remaining cards are dealt out to the top layer. Each card forms a tableau pile which can be built down by alternate color, but cards can be moved regardless of sequence. The bottom layer cards can be filled with a king when empty, but the remaining layers cannot be filled."
msgstr "牌列堆排成类似金字塔的版面，上层 11 张、中层 10 张、下层 9 张，剩下的牌都发到上层。每张牌各自成一堆，可依红黑交替往下叠，但移动时不必是顺子。底层的空堆可以用 K 补上，其余层不能补。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built in a pyramid-esque layout, with five cards in the top layer, four cards in the middle, and three in the bottom. Each card forms a tableau pile which can be built down by alternate color. The three bottom layer cards can be filled with any card when empty, but the remaining layers cannot be filled. Cards in the lower layers can only be flipped if the two cards overlapping them are removed."
msgstr "牌列堆排成类似金字塔的版面，上层 5 张、中层 4 张、下层 3 张。每张牌各自成一堆，可依红黑交替往下叠。下层那三张形成的空堆可以用任何牌补上，其余层不能补。下层的牌必须等压住它的两张牌都被移走才能翻开。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built in four pyramid-esque \"walls\", with each wall having four cards in the top layer, three in the middle, and two in the bottom. One wall is facing in each direction, and the cards on the edge of the top layer are shared between the adjoining walls. The tableau and foundation are placed in the center of the four walls."
msgstr "牌列堆排成四面类似金字塔的「墙」，每面上层 4 张、中层 3 张、下层 2 张。四面墙各朝一个方向，上层边缘的牌由相邻的两面墙共用。牌列与王牌区放在四面墙的中央。"

msgid "The tableau piles are built in seventeen sets of three cards, with two in the back row face-down, and a third face-up card overlapping them. The final card is dealt separately."
msgstr "牌列堆排成十七组、每组三张，后面两张面朝下，第三张面朝上叠在它们上面。最后一张牌单独发出。"

msgid "The tableau piles build down by suit, and the foundations build up by suit. Only one card can be moved at a time, and empty spaces cannot be filled."
msgstr "牌列堆依花色往下叠，王牌区依花色往上叠。一次只能移动一张牌，空位不能补牌。"

msgid "The tableau piles can contain a max of 4 cards each. Each tableau pile is to be built up to total 10. Aces equal 1 and face cards have a value of 0. Tens are wild and can equal any value from 0 to 10. Once played, a card in a tableau pile cannot be moved. The goal of the game is to build each pile with four cards with a total value of 10."
msgstr "每个牌列堆最多放 4 张牌。每堆要叠到总值 10。A 算 1，人头牌算 0。10 是万用牌，可以当 0 到 10 的任何数值。牌一旦放进牌列堆就不能再移动。游戏目标是把每堆都凑成四张、总值 10。"

msgid "The tableau piles start with eight cards dealt, and six reserve stacks of four cards each are also dealt. The tableau piles are built up or down by same suit, though only one card can be moved at a time. Cards from the reserve may be moved to tableau piles or foundations, but not other reserve piles. Any card may be played in an empty space on the tableau."
msgstr "牌列堆一开始各发八张，另外还发六个预备堆、每堆四张。牌列堆依同花色往上或往下叠，但一次只能移动一张牌。预备堆的牌可以移到牌列堆或王牌区，但不能移到其他预备堆。牌列的空堆可以放任何一张牌。"

msgid "The tableau stacks are built down by suit. Any sequence of cards in the tableau stacks may be moved to another appropriate tableau stack. The game is won when four stacks contain complete sequences from king to ace."
msgstr "牌列堆依花色往下叠。牌列堆中的任何顺子都可以移到其他合适的牌列堆。有四个牌列堆分别含完整 K 到 A 的顺子时即获胜。"

msgid "The tableau wraps around at the end of rows and from the bottom-right to the top-left."
msgstr "牌列在横排末端会循环，右下角也会连回左上角。"

msgid "The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable in this version of"
msgstr "第三与第四级（废牌）的牌在本版本下列玩法中不能互相替换"

msgid "The tiles are laid out in a particular pattern. Each Mahjongg game is played the same, only with a different layout - usually resembling a figure of some sort, related to the name of the layout."
msgstr "牌块会排成特定的花样。每局麻将的玩法都相同，只是版面不同——通常形状像某种图案，也和版面的名称相关。"

msgid "The tiles are played to an grid of eight rows of twelve columns each. At the start of the game, a tile is placed in each corner, and two are placed in two diagonally adjacent spaces in the center. The initially placed tiles include one of each color and one of each symbol."
msgstr "牌块放到八排、每排十二栏的网格上。开局时四个角落各放一块，中央两个对角相邻的格子各放一块。一开始放的牌块包括每种颜色各一块、每种图案各一块。"

msgid "The top card from the reserve can be moved to an appropriate tableau pile or foundation. Any single card can be moved to the reserve, though there can be no more than eighteen cards in the reserve."
msgstr "预备堆最上面那张牌可以移到合适的牌列堆或王牌区。任何一张牌都可以移到预备堆，但预备堆最多不能超过十八张。"

msgid "The top card of each Reserve pile is always available for play on to either the Tableau or the Foundation. There is no building on the Reserve piles."
msgstr "每个预备堆最上面那张牌随时都能出到牌列或王牌区。预备堆上不能叠牌。"

msgid "The top card of each tableau pile can be moved to one of the extra tableau piles or foundations. The foundations are built up by alternate color from ace to king."
msgstr "每个牌列堆最上面那张牌可以移到额外的牌列堆或王牌区。王牌区依红黑交替从 A 往上叠到 K。"

msgid "The top card of the reserve can be moved to the tableau or foundations, but cards cannot be moved to the reserve. Cards are drawn from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the tableau or foundations. One redeal is allowed."
msgstr "预备堆最上面那张牌可以移到牌列或王牌区，但牌不能移进预备堆。牌从牌山逐张翻出，可以移到牌列或王牌区。允许循环发牌一次。"

msgid "The top card of the reserve pile can be moved to any appropriate tableau or foundation."
msgstr "预备堆最上面那张牌可以移到任何合适的牌列或王牌区。"

msgid "The top card of the talon is flipped face-up and can be moved to any valid tableau or foundation pile. No further cards from the talon can be viewed until after the current card has been moved."
msgstr "牌山最上面那张牌会翻到面朝上，可移到任何合法的牌列堆或王牌区。在那张牌移走之前，不能看牌山接下来的牌。"

msgid "The top left card is called the"
msgstr "左上角那张牌称为"

msgid "The traditional rules of Hit or Miss only allow you to go through the deck twice without getting a hit, but this rule is often overlooked due to the extreme difficulty of winning the game it causes. Most computer versions of Hit or Miss do not use this rule, but when this rule is omitted, the game is always won unless the player gets stuck with a multiple of 13 cards left. This version does not use this rule, while Hit or Miss does."
msgstr "中或失（Hit or Miss）的传统规则只允许你翻完整副牌两次而不中一次，但这条规则常常被忽略，因为它会让游戏难到几乎不可能赢。多数电脑版的中或失都不用这条规则，而省略之后，除非玩家卡住且剩下的牌是 13 的倍数，否则一定获胜。这个版本不用这条规则，中或失则用。"

msgid "The two black aces and red kings are moved to the foundations. The remaining cards are dealt to sixteen tableau piles of three cards each. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and an ace or king can fill an empty pile."
msgstr "两张黑色 A 与红色 K 移到王牌区。剩下的牌发成十六个牌列堆、每堆三张。牌列堆依同花色往上或往下叠。牌列堆之间只能移动单张，空堆可以用 A 或 K 补上。"

msgid "The two free cells can hold any - and just one - card."
msgstr "两个自由格可以放任何一张牌，而且只能放一张。"

msgid "The type of the cardset (see types below)"
msgstr "牌组的类型（类型见下方）"

msgid "The unique aspect of Rouge Et Noir is the fact that there are two sets of foundations, built using different methods. The first set is built more traditionally, starting with an ace of each suit, then building up by alternate color to king. The second set is built in a manner more akin to"
msgstr "红与黑（Rouge Et Noir）独特之处在于有两组王牌区，且两组的叠法不同。第一组较为传统，从各花色的 A 开始，依红黑交替往上叠到 K。第二组的叠法比较接近"

msgid "The value of the card. Numbered cards usually have the rank of the associated number. Aces can either be high or low. If low, aces are ranked 1. If high, aces are ranked as 14. J, Q, and K are usually ranked 11, 12, and 13 respectively. However, some games may rank these cards as 10. In such a case, a high ace might be ranked as 11."
msgstr "牌的值。数字牌的点数通常就是它的数字。A 可高可低：当低点时算 1，当高点时算 14。J、Q、K 通常分别为 11、12、13。但有些游戏会把它们算成 10，这种情况下高点 A 可能算 11。"

msgid "The vertical offset of the cards"
msgstr "卡牌的垂直位移量"

msgid "The waste stack will be the biggest problem area. Move cards on the tableau to free up spots for cards on the waste stack."
msgstr "弃牌堆会是最大的难关。挪动牌列上的牌，腾出位置好让弃牌堆的牌能出。"

msgid "The waste stack will be the biggest problem area. Play from it first. Move cards on the tableau to make every play possible before dealing more cards."
msgstr "弃牌堆会是最大的难关。优先从它出牌。在发更多牌之前，先挪动牌列上的牌，让所有能出的牌都出完。"

msgid "The zodiac piles are built up or down by same suit, cards from the equator or waste pile can be moved to the zodiac, but cards cannot be moved between piles in the zodiac, or to the foundations, until later in the game. The equator consists of eight free cells, that can only contain one card each. When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to the equator or zodiac as possible. You can go through the deck as many times as necessary."
msgstr "黄道堆依同花色往上或往下叠。赤道或弃牌堆的牌可以移到黄道，但黄道各堆之间不能互相移牌，游戏前期也不能移到王牌区。赤道由八个自由格组成，每格只能放一张牌。没有步可走时，可以从牌山逐张翻牌，视情况移到赤道或黄道。整副牌可以依需要翻任何次数。"

msgid "Then four points for the next four cards, eight for the next four, then sixteen etc."
msgstr "接着下四张得 4 分，再下四张得 8 分，然后 16 分，依此类推。"

msgid "Then, a six by six grid of tiles should be placed on top of this layer, in the center. A four by four layer is placed centered on top of this, and lastly, a two by two grid is placed on the top."
msgstr "然后在这层上面的中央放一个六乘六的牌块网格，再在它上面的中央放一层四乘四，最后顶层放一个二乘二的网格。"

msgid "There are certain patterns in how you choose to move the wizards that will help you use them most effectively. You'll just have to figure them out..."
msgstr "法师要怎么移动是有规律可循的，掌握之后就能用到最有效率。剩下的得你自己琢磨……"

msgid "There are eight foundations, structured as follows:"
msgstr "共有八个王牌区，结构如下："

msgid "There are eight foundations. Four are built up by suit from ace to king, and the other four are built down from king to ace. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations - it doesn't matter how many cards are in each foundation."
msgstr "共有八个王牌区。四个依花色从 A 往上叠到 K，另外四个从 K 往下叠到 A。所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜——每个王牌区有几张牌并不重要。"

msgid "There are eight tableau piles, divided into two sets. The first set of tableau piles contains four piles, each with seven cards dealt to it, and are built down by alternate color, with only one card being moved at a time. The second set consists of four piles, with six cards dealt to each, and are built down by same suit, and cards can be moved regardless of sequence. Empty piles on the left stacks can be filled with any card, whereas piles on the right can only be filled with kings."
msgstr "共有八个牌列堆，分为两组。第一组四堆，每堆发七张，依红黑交替往下叠，一次只能移动一张。第二组也是四堆，每堆发六张，依同花色往下叠，而且移动时不必是顺子。左边那组的空堆可以用任何牌补上，右边那组只能用 K 补。"

msgid "There are four free cells, located above the first four tableau piles. Each free cell can only contain a card of the same suit as the tableau pile directly below it."
msgstr "共有四个自由格，位于前四个牌列堆的上方。每个自由格只能放与它正下方牌列堆同花色的牌。"

msgid "There are four reserves, each of which can hold one card. If all four reserves hold a card of the same rank, all four of them are moved to the foundation. The game is won when the entire deck is moved to the foundation in this way."
msgstr "共有四个预备堆，每堆可放一张牌。若四个预备堆的牌点数相同，这四张就会全部移到王牌区。整副牌都以此方式移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "There are four sets of four foundations. The first set is built up from ace to king, the second set is built down from king to ace, the third set is built up from seven to king, and the last set is built down from six to ace."
msgstr "共有四组王牌区，每组四个。第一组从 A 往上叠到 K，第二组从 K 往下叠到 A，第三组从 7 往上叠到 K，最后一组从 6 往下叠到 A。"

msgid "There are nine tableau piles, divided into two sets. The first set of tableau piles contains four piles, each with a single card dealt to it, and are built down by alternate color. The second set consists of five piles, with eight cards dealt to each, and are built down by same suit. An additional thirteen cards are dealt to a reserve pile, with only the top card face-up, and a single card is dealt to a foundation, determining the base rank of the foundations."
msgstr "共有九个牌列堆，分为两组。第一组四堆，每堆各发一张，依红黑交替往下叠。第二组五堆，每堆发八张，依同花色往下叠。另有十三张牌发到一个预备堆，只有最上面那张面朝上，还有一张牌发到王牌区，用来决定王牌区的基准点数。"

msgid "There are six free cells, one located above each pair of tableau piles. Any single card can be moved to these free cells, but a card can only be moved from the free cells if both of the tableau piles under the cell are empty."
msgstr "共有六个自由格，每对牌列堆上方各一个。任何一张牌都可以移到这些自由格，但只有该格下方的两个牌列堆都空着时，才能把牌从自由格移走。"

msgid "There are some characteristics common to all the games in this package. Most of them are played with standard 52-card decks, either one or two. The cards in each suit are ranked King high. K stands for King, Q stands for Queen and J stands for Jack. In each game, the cards are piled up in either ascending or descending order, on stacks in the main playing area, called the Tableau, or piles off to the side, called Foundations. Some piles must be built up in sequence within the same suit, and others are built up in suits of alternating colors."
msgstr "这个合集里所有游戏都有几个共通特点。多数用的是一副或两副标准 52 张牌组。每种花色以 K 最大。K 代表 King，Q 代表 Queen，J 代表 Jack。每个游戏中，牌都按递增或递减排叠，放在称为牌列的主要游戏区，或放到旁边称为王牌区的牌堆。有些牌堆必须在同花色内依顺子叠放，另一些则要以红黑交替的花色叠放。"

msgid "There are some characteristics common to all the games played with Hanafuda cards. They are all played with one or more of the Asian flower card decks. This deck is common in a number of Pacific regions including Hawaii. There are twelve suits of four cards each. The suits are associated with the twelve months of the year."
msgstr "所有花札游戏也有共通特点。它们都用一副或多副亚洲花牌牌组。这种牌组在包括夏威夷在内的许多太平洋地区都很常见。共十二种花色、每种四张，各花色对应一年中的十二个月。"

msgid "There are ten tableau piles of five cards (except one with six), and the tableau is built up or down by alternate color, wrapping from ace to king as needed. Cards may only be moved one at a time, and empty spaces may be filled with any card."
msgstr "共有十个牌列堆、每堆五张（其中一堆六张），牌列依红黑交替往上或往下叠，必要时从 A 循环到 K。一次只能移动一张牌，空堆可以用任何牌补上。"

msgid "There are three rows of foundations. The first row is built down by suit, from Jack to Ace. The second row just contains a Queen of the same suit as the foundation above it, and the third similarly gets a single King. Cards cannot be moved to the second or third row foundations until the Jack has been dealt to the first row."
msgstr "共有三排王牌区。第一排依花色从 J 往下叠到 A。第二排只放与其上方王牌区同花色的 Q，第三排同理各放一张 K。J 发到第一排之前，不能把牌移到第二排或第三排的王牌区。"

msgid "There are three sets of foundations. A king of each suit is dealt to the first set, and a two of each suit is dealt to the second set. The foundations with the kings are built down by same suit to ace, while the foundations with the twos are built up by same suit to king. The remaining ace of each suit, can be played in third set of foundations."
msgstr "共有三组王牌区。各花色的 K 发到第一组，各花色的 2 发到第二组。有 K 的王牌区依同花色往下叠到 A，有 2 的王牌区依同花色往上叠到 K。各花色剩下的那张 A 则可以出到第三组王牌区。"

msgid "There are three thirteen card reserves, along with six tableau piles. The topmost card of the reserve may be moved to any appropriate foundation, as may any of the tableau cards. No building is allowed on the tableau, and if a tableau card is moved, it is replaced from the top of the talon."
msgstr "共有三个十三张牌的预备堆，另有六个牌列堆。预备堆最上面的牌以及任何牌列的牌，都可以移到合适的王牌区。牌列上不能叠牌，牌列的牌一旦被移走，就由牌山最上面的牌补上。"

msgid "There are two free cells that cards from the tableau can be moved to, but cards in these free cells can only be moved to the foundations. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations, though it doesn't matter how many cards are in each foundation."
msgstr "有两个自由格可以接收从牌列移来的牌，但自由格里的牌只能移到王牌区。所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜，每个王牌区有几张牌并不重要。"

msgid "There are two jokers in the layout, which are wild cards. Any card can be played on a joker, and a joker can be played on any pile. Jokers can be moved to a fifth joker foundation, but only after all other cards have been moved."
msgstr "版面中有两张鬼牌，都是万用牌。任何牌都可以放在鬼牌上，鬼牌也可以放到任何一堆。鬼牌可以移到第五个鬼牌王牌区，但必须等其他牌都移完之后才行。"

msgid "There are two phases to this game. Alternate between the two phases until game is lost or won. Start with Phase One until Tableau is completely filled. At that point, move to Phase Two. Please note that you cannot begin Phase Two unless Tableau is completely filled. At any point, you can return to Phase One, but remember that you cannot go back to Phase Two unless the tableau is once again filled. An exception to this rule is if the stock and waste are empty."
msgstr "这游戏有两个阶段，两者交替进行直到分出胜负。先从第一阶段开始，直到牌列完全填满，这时进入第二阶段。请注意，牌列没填满就不能开始第二阶段。任何时候都可以回到第一阶段，但记住，牌列再次填满之前不能回到第二阶段。这条规则的例外是牌山与弃牌堆都空了。"

msgid "There are two reserve piles. One can only contain a single king and the other can only contain a single queen."
msgstr "共有两个预备堆。一个只能放一张 K，另一个只能放一张 Q。"

msgid "There are two reserve piles. Single cards may be moved to or from the reserves. The reserve piles can have a max of four cards each, and only the top card from each can be moved."
msgstr "共有两个预备堆。单张牌可以移进或移出预备堆。每个预备堆最多四张，且只能移动最上面那张。"

msgid "There are two rows of foundations, one for odd cards and one for even cards. As such, the odd foundations (the top row) are built 3-5-7-9-J, and the even foundations (the bottom row) are built 2-4-6-8-10-Q. These piles are built up by suit. The kings are not used in this game."
msgstr "共有两排王牌区，一排放奇数点、一排放偶数点。因此奇数王牌区（上排）叠 3-5-7-9-J，偶数王牌区（下排）叠 2-4-6-8-10-Q。这些堆都依花色往上叠。这游戏不用 K。"

msgid "There are two rows of foundations. Each foundation in the top row just receives a King and Queen of the same suit, both of which must be played together when both cards are available (in PySol, move one appropriate card to the other in the tableau, and they will both automatically be moved to the correct foundation). The bottom row of foundations is started with an ace and Jack of the same suit, played in a similar manner, but with the Jack on top. Then, they're built down by same suit from Jack to two."
msgstr "共有两排王牌区。上排每个王牌区只接收同花色的 K 与 Q 各一张，两张都到手时必须一起出（在 PySol 中，把其中一张移到牌列中的另一张上，两张就会自动移到正确的王牌区）。下排王牌区以同花色的 A 与 J 起头，出法类似，但 J 放在上面。之后依同花色从 J 往下叠到 2。"

msgid "There are two sets of foundations - one is built up by suit starting from ace to king, while the other is built down from king to ace. Cards in foundations can't be moved."
msgstr "共有两组王牌区——一组依花色从 A 往上叠到 K，另一组从 K 往下叠到 A。王牌区里的牌不能移动。"

msgid "There are two sets of foundations - one is built up by suit starting from the pre-dealt aces. The other is built down by suit, starting with kings. Cards in foundations can't be moved."
msgstr "共有两组王牌区——一组依花色从事先发好的 A 往上叠，另一组依花色从 K 开始往下叠。王牌区里的牌不能移动。"

msgid "There are two sets of foundations - the set on the left builds up by same suit from ace to king while the set on the right builds down by same suit from king to ace. Cards can be moved between foundations. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "共有两组王牌区——左边一组依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K，右边一组依同花色从 K 往下叠到 A。牌可以在王牌区之间移动。所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "There are two sets of foundations, one built up by same suit from ace to king, and the others built down by same suit from king to ace. Each set contains one foundation of each suit. Cards from the free cells or the tableau can be moved to the foundations, but building on the tableau is not allowed. Empty free cells can be filled with any card from the tableau."
msgstr "共有两组王牌区，一组依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K，另一组依同花色从 K 往下叠到 A。每组都含各花色一个王牌区。自由格或牌列的牌可以移到王牌区，但牌列上不能叠牌。空的自由格可以用牌列中的任何牌补上。"

msgid "There are two sets of foundations. One is built up by same suit from ace to king, while the other is built down by suit from king to ace. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "共有两组王牌区。一组依同花色从 A 往上叠到 K，另一组依花色从 K 往下叠到 A。所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "There are two sets of foundations. One set is built up starting from ace with odd numbered ranks (A-3-5-7-9-J-K) and the other is built up from two with even numbered ranks (2-4-6-8-10-Q)."
msgstr "共有两组王牌区。一组从 A 开始依奇数点数往上叠（A-3-5-7-9-J-K），另一组从 2 开始依偶数点数往上叠（2-4-6-8-10-Q）。"

msgid "There are two sets of foundations. The one on the left is built up by suit from ace to king and the one on the right is built down by suit from king to ace. Each set of foundations gets one pile of each suit."
msgstr "共有两组王牌区。左边一组依花色从 A 往上叠到 K，右边一组依花色从 K 往下叠到 A。每组王牌区各含每种花色一堆。"

msgid "There are two thirteen card reserves, along with four tableau piles. The topmost card of the reserve may be moved to any appropriate foundation, as may any of the tableau cards. No building is allowed on the tableau, and if a tableau card is moved, it is replaced from the top of the talon."
msgstr "共有两个十三张牌的预备堆，另有四个牌列堆。预备堆最上面的牌以及任何牌列的牌，都可以移到合适的王牌区。牌列上不能叠牌，牌列的牌一旦被移走，就由牌山最上面的牌补上。"

msgid "There is a single free cell that can hold a max of 8 cards. Any single card can be moved to the reserve, and the top card can be moved to the foundation or tableau."
msgstr "只有一个自由格，最多可放 8 张牌。任何一张牌都可以移到这个预备堆，最上面那张则可以移到王牌区或牌列。"

msgid "There is a single reserve pile, that can hold a max of four cards. Only cards from the tableau can be moved to the reserve, and the top card of the reserve can be moved back to the tableau or foundations. When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to tableau piles or foundations. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "只有一个预备堆，最多放四张牌。只有牌列的牌可以移到预备堆，预备堆最上面那张可以移回牌列或王牌区。没有步可走时，可以从牌山逐张翻牌，移到牌列堆或王牌区。不允许循环发牌。"

msgid "There is an additional reserve pile. Aces from the waste stack (not the tableau) may be moved to this reserve. This reserve controls a single redeal - when the talon is empty, you can take one card from the bottom of the tableau for each card in the reserve, and use these cards to build a new talon. You can only do this once."
msgstr "另有一个额外的预备堆。弃牌堆（不是牌列）中的 A 可以移到这个预备堆。这个预备堆控制一次循环发牌——牌山空了时，预备堆每有一张牌，就能从牌列底部取一张，用这些牌组成新的牌山。这个动作只能做一次。"

msgid "There is no building on the 2 reserve stacks. Cards can only be moved to other stacks from there."
msgstr "两个预备堆上都不能叠牌。那里的牌只能移到其他牌堆。"

msgid "There is no other playing on the piles. You win when the tableau piles are all gone."
msgstr "牌堆上没有其他出牌方式。牌列堆全部清空就获胜。"

msgid "There is no redeal."
msgstr "不循环发牌。"

msgid "There is one additional tableau pile that is set aside from the others. An ace can be dealt to start this pile, and it can be built up by same suit like the other."
msgstr "另有一堆牌列堆独立于其他堆之外。可以发一张 A 到这堆起头，之后和其他堆一样依同花色往上叠。"

msgid "There is only a single foundation pile, built up by rank regardless of suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary, starting from any rank. The game is won if all cards are moved to this one foundation."
msgstr "只有一个王牌区，不分花色、依点数往上叠，必要时可从 K 循环到 A，并可从任意点数起头。所有牌都移入这个王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "There is only one foundation, built up or down by rank, regardless of suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to this foundation in a single sequence."
msgstr "只有一个王牌区，不分花色、依点数往上或往下叠。所有牌都以同一段顺子移入这个王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "There is only one set of foundations - the foundations are built from ace to king, and then wrap around."
msgstr "只有一组王牌区——王牌区从 A 叠到 K，之后再循环。"

msgid "Thirteen Down"
msgstr "十三往下（Thirteen Down）"

msgid "Thirteen Packs"
msgstr "十三堆（Thirteen Packs）"

msgid "Thirteen Up"
msgstr "十三往上（Thirteen Up）"

msgid "Thirteen cards are dealt to a reserve called the frog. If an ace would be dealt to this reserve, it is dealt to the foundations instead."
msgstr "十三张牌发到一个称为青蛙（frog）的预备堆。若本应发到这个预备堆的是 A，就改发到王牌区。"

msgid "Thirteen cards are dealt to the tableau. Pairs of cards that total ten can be moved to the foundation, and the spaces are filled from the talon."
msgstr "十三张牌发到牌列。点数合计十的牌对可以移到王牌区，空出来的地方再由牌山补牌。"

msgid "Thirty cards are dealt to six piles of five cards each, with the remaining two cards set aside as reserve cards. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, though only sequences of cards of the same suit can be moved together. The reserve cards can be moved to appropriate tableau or foundation piles at any time."
msgstr "三十张牌发成六堆、每堆五张，剩下的两张另存为预备牌。牌列堆不分花色、依点数往下叠，但只有同花色的牌才能成顺一起移动。预备牌随时可以移到合适的牌列堆或王牌区。"

msgid "Thirty is played with a deck of only 32 cards, including the 7 through ace of each suit."
msgstr "三十（Thirty）用只有 32 张的副牌玩，各花色只含 7 到 A。"

msgid "Thirty-Six Card Tableau"
msgstr "三十六张牌列（Thirty-Six Card Tableau）"

msgid "Thirty-six cards are dealt to three rows of twelve cards each. A card is available if the pile directly below it is empty (cards in the bottom row are always available). Tableau piles are built down by suit, and only single cards can be moved, but cards can only be moved if both are available, and the card is being moved to a higher row than it's currently in. Empty piles can be filled with any available card from the lower row, or the waste."
msgstr "三十六张牌发成三排、每排十二张。若某张牌正下方那堆已空，该牌才可以使用（下排的牌随时可用）。牌列堆依花色往下叠，且只能移动单张；而且必须两张都可用、并且是移到比目前更高的一排，才能移动。空堆可以用下方任何可用的牌或弃牌堆的牌补上。"

msgid "This 32-card solitaire starts with the entire deck shuffled and dealt out in three rows and two extra reserves at the top. All Sevens from the rows are then dealt to the foundations thereby making initial free spaces."
msgstr "这款 32 张牌接龙开局时把整副牌洗牌后发成三排，上方另加两个预备堆。接着把各排所有的 7 发到王牌区，因此出现最初的空位。"

msgid "This 52-card solitaire starts with the entire deck shuffled and dealt out in four rows. The aces are then moved to the left end of the layout, making 4 initial free spaces. You may move to a space only the card that matches the left neighbor in suit, and is one greater in rank. Kings are high, so no cards may be placed to their right (they create dead spaces)."
msgstr "这款 52 张牌接龙开局时把整副牌洗牌后发成四排。接着把 A 移到版面最左端，做出 4 个初始空位。只有花色与左邻相同、点数大一的牌才能移到空位。K 最大，所以 K 的右边不能放牌（会造成死位）。"

msgid "This difficult variant of Pyramid is based on the Gnome AisleRiot rules. It is called \"Thirteen\" there, but renamed Pyramid Thirteen here to avoid confusion with the game"
msgstr "这款难度较高的金字塔（Pyramid）变体是以 Gnome AisleRiot 的规则为基础。在那里它名为「Thirteen」，此处改名为 Pyramid Thirteen，以避免与游戏"

msgid "This error occurs if you're trying to run an older version of PySolFC with Python 3.10. If you are using Python 3.10 or later, please upgrade your version of PySolFC to 2.14.0 or later - older versions are not compatible with Python 3.10."
msgstr "这个错误发生在你试着用 Python 3.10 执行较旧版本的 PySolFC 时。若你使用 Python 3.10 或更新版本，请把 PySolFC 升级到 2.14.0 或更新版本——旧版与 Python 3.10 不兼容。"

msgid "This game can have \"unbeatable\" deals. For instance, if the second rank card of suit \"a\" is on the first rank card of suit \"b\", and the second rank card of \"b\" is on the first rank card of \"a\", neither second rank card can be moved. You've lost. It's also possible to play yourself into a similar situation."
msgstr "这游戏可能出现「不可能过关」的牌局。例如，若花色 a 的第二点数那张牌压在花色 b 的第一点数那张牌上，而 b 的第二点数那张又压在 a 的第一点数那张上，这两张第二点数的牌就都动不了，你已经输了。也可能你自己玩成类似的情况。"

msgid "This game has no relation to"
msgstr "这游戏与下列玩法无关"

msgid "This game is also known as Cotillion."
msgstr "这游戏也称为舞会（Cotillion）。"

msgid "This game is also known as Sultan of Turkey, or less commonly, Emperor of Germany."
msgstr "这游戏也称为土耳其苏丹（Sultan of Turkey），较少见的称呼是德国皇帝（Emperor of Germany）。"

msgid "This game is also known as The Four Continents."
msgstr "这游戏也称为四大洲（The Four Continents）。"

msgid "This game is based on the story of Rosamund Clifford, the mistress of King Henry II of England. As per the story, they conducted their affairs inside a maze called \"Rosamund's Bower\"."
msgstr "这游戏取材自罗莎蒙德·克利福德（Rosamund Clifford）的故事，她是英王亨利二世的情妇。据传说，两人在一座名为「罗莎蒙德的玫瑰亭」的迷宫里幽会。"

msgid "This game is known by many names, such as"
msgstr "这游戏有许多名称，例如"

msgid "This game is one of a series of games that have names ending in \"pati\" which transliterates as \"lord of\". Ashwapati means \"Lord of Horses\". The names are the names of the suits in a twelve suit Ganjifa deck."
msgstr "这游戏是一系列名称以「pati」结尾的游戏之一，pati 音译为「之主」。Ashwapati 的意思是「马之主」。这些名字是十二花色甘吉发牌组中各花色的名称。"

msgid "This game is one of a series of games that have names ending in \"pati\" which transliterates as \"lord of\". Dhanpati means \"Lord of Treasure\". The names are the names of the suits in a twelve suit Ganjifa deck."
msgstr "这游戏是一系列名称以「pati」结尾的游戏之一，pati 音译为「之主」。Dhanpati 的意思是「财之主」。这些名字是十二花色甘吉发牌组中各花色的名称。"

msgid "This game is one of a series of games that have names ending in \"pati\" which transliterates as \"lord of\". Gajapati means \"Lord of Elephants\". The names are the names of the suits in a twelve suit Ganjifa deck."
msgstr "这游戏是一系列名称以「pati」结尾的游戏之一，pati 音译为「之主」。Gajapati 的意思是「象之主」。这些名字是十二花色甘吉发牌组中各花色的名称。"

msgid "This game is one of a series of games that have names ending in \"pati\" which transliterates as \"lord of\". Garhpati means \"Lord of Forts\". The names are the names of the suits in a twelve suit Ganjifa deck."
msgstr "这游戏是一系列名称以「pati」结尾的游戏之一，pati 音译为「之主」。Garhpati 的意思是「堡之主」。这些名字是十二花色甘吉发牌组中各花色的名称。"

msgid "This game is one of a series of games that have names ending in \"pati\" which transliterates as \"lord of\". Narpati means \"Lord of Men\". The names are the names of the suits in a twelve suit Ganjifa deck."
msgstr "这游戏是一系列名称以「pati」结尾的游戏之一，pati 音译为「之主」。Narpati 的意思是「人之主」。这些名字是十二花色甘吉发牌组中各花色的名称。"

msgid "This game is one of a series of games that have names ending in \"pati\" which transliterates as \"lord of\". Tipati means \"Lord (Highest/Queen) of Women\". The names are the names of the suits in a twelve suit Ganjifa deck."
msgstr "这游戏是一系列名称以「pati」结尾的游戏之一，pati 音译为「之主」。Tipati 的意思是「女之主（最高／王后）」。这些名字是十二花色甘吉发牌组中各花色的名称。"

msgid "This game is played with one stripped deck."
msgstr "这游戏用一副精简副牌玩。"

msgid "This game is played with three stripped decks, including only the cards with a rank from six through king."
msgstr "这游戏用三副精简副牌玩，只含各花色 6 到 K 的牌。"

msgid "This game is played with two stripped decks, consisting of the seven through king and ace of each suit. One ace is dealt to the foundations, and the remaining cards are dealt evenly to seven tableau piles."
msgstr "这游戏用两副精简副牌玩，含各花色 7 到 K 以及 A。一张 A 发到王牌区，其余的牌平均发成七堆牌列。"

msgid "This game is played with two stripped decks, containing only the sevens through kings of each suit, plus the aces. Cards are dealt to seven piles of seven cards, with every other card dealt face-down (the second, fourth, and sixth cards in each pile will be face-down). When dealing, any ace that would be dealt face-up is moved directly to the foundations."
msgstr "这游戏用两副精简副牌玩，只含各花色的 7 到 K，外加 A。牌发成七堆、每堆七张，每隔一张发成暗牌（每堆的第 2、4、6 张为暗牌）。发牌时若 A 会被发成明牌，就直接移到王牌区。"

msgid "This game is traditionally known as Rainbow - it is often renamed Rainbow Fan to avoid confusion with"
msgstr "这游戏传统上称为彩虹（Rainbow）——常改名为彩虹扇（Rainbow Fan），以避免与下列玩法混淆"

msgid "This game only uses the ranks from ace through jack. The kings and queens are removed."
msgstr "这游戏只使用 A 到 J 的点数，K 与 Q 都移除。"

msgid "This game was invented by Albert H. Morehead and Geoffrey Mott-Smith."
msgstr "这游戏由阿尔伯特·H·莫尔黑德（Albert H. Morehead）与杰弗里·莫特-史密斯（Geoffrey Mott-Smith）发明。"

msgid "This game was taught to KPatience developer Paul Olav Tvete by his grandfather. In KPatience, it goes by the name Grandfather, but it is often known as Tvete's Grandfather to differentiate it from another game more commonly known as"
msgstr "这游戏是 KPatience 开发者保尔·奥拉夫·特夫特（Paul Olav Tvete）的祖父教给他的。在 KPatience 中它名为 Grandfather，但外界常称它为 Tvete's Grandfather，以与另一个更常称为"

msgid "This game was taught to me by a wonderful woman. Neither she nor I knows where the game originated (it was taught to her by her older sister). This game is dedicated to her. Note: it was taught to her by her *other* older sister. So it really shouldn't be called Lara's game. But that's what I'm used to calling it, so thus it remains."
msgstr "这游戏是一位很棒的女性教给我的。我和她都不晓得它源自何处（是她姐姐教她的）。这个游戏要献给她。附注：其实是她*另一位*姐姐教她的，所以严格来说不该叫 Lara 的游戏。但我已经习惯这样叫它，所以名字就这样留着了。"

msgid "This is a classic puzzle game. At the start of the game, one card is removed. The remaining cards are removed by jumping over neighbour cards, and the space beyond the neighbour must be empty."
msgstr "这是经典的跳格益智游戏。开局时先移除一张牌，之后要靠跳过相邻的牌来移除其余的牌，而被跳过那张牌后面的格子必须是空的。"

msgid "This is a classic solitaire game that probably dates back to the nineteenth century. It is known by many names, such as"
msgstr "这是经典的接龙游戏，历史大概可回溯到十九世纪。它有很多名称，例如"

msgid "This is a four deck version of"
msgstr "这是下列玩法的四副牌版本"

msgid "This is a more difficult variant of"
msgstr "这是难度较高的变体玩法，改编自"

msgid "This is a more traditional two deck FreeCell game than"
msgstr "这是比下列玩法更传统的两副牌 FreeCell 游戏"

msgid "This is a two-deck variation of"
msgstr "这是下列玩法的两副牌变体"

msgid "This is a variant of"
msgstr "这是下列玩法的变体"

msgid "This is a very hard game - try"
msgstr "这是难度很高的游戏——可以试试"

msgid "This is a very simple game, which takes its name from the shape of the layout. 20 cards are dealt to the tableau - a row of 1, a row of 2 below it, a row of 3 below that, a row of 4 below that, and two rows of 5 at the bottom."
msgstr "这是很简单的游戏，名称来自版面形状。牌列发 20 张：上面一排 1 张，其下一排 2 张，再下一排 3 张，再下一排 4 张，底部两排各 5 张。"

msgid "This is an interesting combination of"
msgstr "这是下列玩法的有趣组合"

msgid "This is entirely a game of skill: if you lose, you just weren't paying attention. Your first priority should be to expose all the face-down cards and get the rest of the Reserve into play. Also, do not play a card onto a Foundation simply because you can (Aces are OK; Twos are probably safe as well): you may need it for building in the Tableau. You will find that you do not need to calculate very long sequences to finish the game, but sometimes a bit of calculation is necessary to expose the buried cards. Sometimes the piles can grow longer than can be displayed in the window. This usually isn't a problem, since you can break up the pile fairly often when other plays become available. Here's something that's a lot of fun: If you have arranged the cards in proper sequence, playing as few to the Foundations as possible during the game, one press of the \"Auto\" button can play 90 or more cards to the Foundations. It is possible to have every card in the Tableau at the end of the game, even the Aces; the \"Auto\" button shoots them all up to the Foundations in one long riffle!"
msgstr "这完全是靠技巧的游戏：输了，只代表你当时不够专心。头等要务是把所有暗牌都翻开，并让预备堆剩下的牌上场。另外，别因为放得下就把牌放到王牌区（A 没问题；2 大概也安全）：牌列叠牌时你可能还需要它。你会发现不必算很长的顺子就能过关，但有时候还是得算一下才能翻出埋着的牌。有时牌堆会长得超出窗口能显示的范围。这通常不是问题，因为只要其他地方有步可走，你就能常常拆开那堆。有个很好玩的：若你把牌都排成了正确顺序、过程中又尽量少放牌到王牌区，按一次「自动」按钮就能把 90 张以上的牌一路送进王牌区。一局结束时甚至可能所有牌都还在牌列里，连 A 也在——「自动」按钮会把它们一长溜全数送上王牌区！"

msgid "This is my favorite"
msgstr "这是我最喜欢的"

msgid "This is the correct, original variant of the game All in a Row."
msgstr "这是一字排开（All in a Row）正确且最初的变体玩法。"

msgid "This is the two deck version of"
msgstr "这是下列玩法的两副牌版本"

msgid "This one is for people who want a mindless distraction. It's a good way to learn the suits and ranks of the flower cards. The foundations build from fourth rank to first, by suits. Any fourth rank card can be played on any open foundation stack, but a game doesn't count as a win unless the suits are in their proper order. That means Pine is at 1 o'clock, Plum at 2 o'clock etc. Once a card is played on a foundation stack it can't be taken off except by undoing the move. There can be no more than eight cards in a row."
msgstr "这一款适合想无脑放空的人，也是认识花牌花色与点数的好方法。王牌区依花色从第四级叠到第一级。任何第四级的牌都能放到任何已开张的王牌区，但花色若没排在正确顺序就不算获胜。也就是说松在 1 点、梅在 2 点，依此类推。牌一旦放到王牌区，除了复原该步之外就不能拿下来。每排最多八张牌。"

msgid "This only applies to fresh deals. If you manually enter a specific game number, that exact number is dealt as-is and is not guaranteed to be solvable."
msgstr "这只适用于新发的牌局。若你手动输入特定的游戏编号，就会照原样发出那个编号的牌，不保证能解。"

msgid "This simple game is known by many names, such as"
msgstr "这简单的游戏有许多名称，例如"

msgid "This solitaire is played with two separate decks. The first deck is shuffled and dealt out in four rows. The second deck is shuffled and becomes the talon."
msgstr "这款接龙用两副分开的牌玩。第一副牌洗牌后发成四排，第二副牌洗牌后成为牌山。"

msgid "This solitaire starts with the entire deck shuffled and dealt out in five rows, four of fourteen cards and one of twenty-two. The Aces and one of trumps are then removed making 5 initial free spaces. You may move to a space only the card that matches the left neighbor in suit, and is one greater in rank. The row of 22 is built in a sequence using the trump suit, but the other four rows can be built in any suit. Kings and the Fool/Skiz are high, so no cards may be placed to their right (they create dead spaces)."
msgstr "这款接龙开局时把整副牌洗牌后发成五排，其中四排各十四张、一排二十二张。接着移除 A 与一张将牌，做出 5 个初始空位。只有花色与左邻相同、点数大一的牌才能移到空位。那排 22 张要用将牌花色连成顺子，其余四排则可用任何花色。K 与愚者／Skiz 最大，所以它们右边不能放牌（会造成死位）。"

msgid "This solitaire starts with the entire deck shuffled and dealt out in four rows. The Aces are then removed making 4 initial free spaces. You may move to a space only the card that matches the left neighbor in suit, and is one greater in rank. Kings are high, so no cards may be placed to their right (they create dead spaces)."
msgstr "这款接龙开局时把整副牌洗牌后发成四排。接着移除 A，做出 4 个初始空位。只有花色与左邻相同、点数大一的牌才能移到空位。K 最大，所以 K 的右边不能放牌（会造成死位）。"

msgid "This solitaire starts with the entire deck shuffled and dealt out to 54 piles. The Kings are then removed making a total of 6 initial free spaces."
msgstr "这款接龙开局时把整副牌洗牌后发成 54 堆。接着移除 K，总共做出 6 个初始空位。"

msgid "This tutorial may be incomplete. It is given as is, without any warranty, to help players customize their own cardsets. You are welcome to send any suggestions to:"
msgstr "这份教学可能不完整。它原封不动地提供、不含任何保证，目的是帮助玩家自定义自己的牌组。欢迎你把任何建议寄到："

msgid "This tutorial was created under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 3 or later. You can redistribute it as is and/or modify it."
msgstr "这份教学依 GNU General Public License 第 3 版或更新版本的条款建立。你可以原样再分发及（或）修改它。"

msgid "This two deck FreeCell variation was invented by Thomas Warfield. For a more traditional variation, see"
msgstr "这款两副牌的 FreeCell 变体由 Thomas Warfield 发明。想看较传统的变体，请见"

msgid "This version of All in a Row is a"
msgstr "这个一字排开（All in a Row）版本是一种"

msgid "Thomas Gellekum &lt;tg@ihf.rwth-aachen.de&gt;"
msgstr "Thomas Gellekum &lt;tg@ihf.rwth-aachen.de&gt;"

msgid "Thornq"
msgstr "Thornq"

msgid "Though you are allowed to deal cards from the talon one at a time, these cards cannot be manually moved to the frame, picture, or foundation, and simply determines which card is dealt next when an empty spot is formed in the picture. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "虽然允许从牌山逐张翻牌，但这些牌不能手动移到外框、图画或王牌区，它们只用来决定图画中出现空位时下一张要发哪张牌。不允许循环发牌。"

msgid "Thoughtful"
msgstr "深思（Thoughtful）"

msgid "Three Card Fan"
msgstr "三张扇（Three Card Fan）"

msgid "Three Peaks (Open)"
msgstr "三峰（Three Peaks）（开放）"

msgid "Three Peaks (Scored)"
msgstr "三峰（Three Peaks）（计分）"

msgid "Three Peaks (Scored/Open)"
msgstr "三峰（Three Peaks）（计分／开放）"

msgid "Three Peaks scoring"
msgstr "三峰（Three Peaks）计分方式"

msgid "Three Pharaohs"
msgstr "三法老（Three Pharaohs）"

msgid "Three adjacent tiles: 4 points"
msgstr "三块相邻：4 分"

msgid "Three cards are dealt to each of 34 tableau piles, with a 35th having the remaining two cards. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit, and only single cards can be moved between piles. Empty tableau piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "三张牌发到 34 个牌列堆，第 35 堆放剩下那两张。牌列堆依同花色往上或往下叠，堆之间只能移动单张。空的牌列堆不能补牌。"

msgid "Three cards are dealt to each of eight tableau piles, and a single ace is dealt to a foundation."
msgstr "三张牌发到八个牌列堆，并发一张 A 到王牌区。"

msgid "Three cards are dealt to each of eleven piles, the first one face-down, and the remaining two face-up. The piles are grouped into one set of three and the remaining eight."
msgstr "三张牌发到十一堆，每堆第一张面朝下、剩下两张面朝上。这些堆分成一组三堆，以及其余的八堆。"

msgid "Three cards are dealt to eight tableau piles. These tableau piles are built down by rank regardless of suit. Empty piles cannot be filled - therefore all Kings are placed at the bottom of a pile during the initial dealing."
msgstr "三张牌发到八个牌列堆。这些牌列堆不分花色、依点数往下叠。空堆不能补牌——因此最初发牌时所有 K 都要放在某堆最下面。"

msgid "Three fir-trees"
msgstr "三棵枞树（Three fir-trees）"

msgid "Three-Deck game type. 3 decks. 2 redeals."
msgstr "三副牌游戏类型。3 副牌。2 次循环发牌。"

msgid "Three-Deck game type. 3 stripped decks. No redeal."
msgstr "三副牌游戏类型。3 副精简副牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Tile Puzzle"
msgstr "牌块拼图（Tile Puzzle）"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 10x10"
msgstr "牌块拼图 10x10"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 3x3"
msgstr "牌块拼图 3x3"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 4x4"
msgstr "牌块拼图 4x4"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 5x5"
msgstr "牌块拼图 5x5"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 6x6"
msgstr "牌块拼图 6x6"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 7x7"
msgstr "牌块拼图 7x7"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 8x8"
msgstr "牌块拼图 8x8"

msgid "Tile Puzzle 9x9"
msgstr "牌块拼图 9x9"

msgid "Tiles are drawn from the talon one at a time, and can be played to the main playing area. A tile can only be played if it is adjacent to another tile, either horizontally or vertically, and if it matches the adjacent tile's color or symbol. If a tile is placed next to at least two other tiles, one must match by color and another by symbol. If it is played next to four other tiles, it must match two by color and two by symbol."
msgstr "牌块从牌山逐张取出，可放到主游戏区。牌块只有在与另一块横向或纵向相邻，且颜色或图案相符时才能放。若某块旁边至少有两块，则必须有一块颜色相符、另一块图案相符。若四边都有牌，就必须两边颜色相符、两边图案相符。"

msgid "Tiles may be removed from the tableau only in matching pairs and only if both tiles are free. A tile is free if there are no tiles on top of it and no tiles either to the right or left of it."
msgstr "牌列中的牌块只能两两配对移除，而且两块都得是自由牌块。牌块上方没有牌，且左右两侧至少有一边没有牌，即视为自由牌块。"

msgid "Tiles of a number of different colors are dealt to the board. Tiles may be swapped with adjacent tiles, if they would create a line of three or more tiles of the same color in a row. The resulting lines of three or more are removed, and all tiles directly above them will fall to fill in the gap. New tiles are dropped in to fill the gaps. The tiles will cascade, and any new lines of three are removed, until there aren't any left."
msgstr "不同颜色的牌块会发到棋盘上。若相邻的两块互换后能排成同色三连以上的直线，就可以互换。形成的三连以上会被移除，正上方的牌块会落下补齐缺口，新牌块也会落下填补。牌块会连锁掉落，新形成的三连一并移除，直到没有残留为止。"

msgid "Tiles of a number of different colors are dealt to the board. You may remove a group of two or more adjacent tiles of the same color. Once a group is removed, all tiles directly above them will fall to fill in the gap. If a column is emptied, the adjacent columns will slide to the left to fill in the gap."
msgstr "不同颜色的牌块会发到棋盘上。你可以移除两块以上相邻的同色牌块。移除后，正上方的牌块会落下补齐缺口。若整栏被清空，隔壁各栏会向左滑动补齐缺口。"

msgid "To \"convey\" a work means any kind of propagation that enables other parties to make or receive copies. Mere interaction with a user through a computer network, with no transfer of a copy, is not conveying."
msgstr "「流布」一件作品，是指任何让其他人得以制作或接收副本的传播行为。纯粹透过电脑网络与用户互动、而未传输任何副本，不算流布。"

msgid "To \"modify\" a work means to copy from or adapt all or part of the work in a fashion requiring copyright permission, other than the making of an exact copy. The resulting work is called a \"modified version\" of the earlier work or a work \"based on\" the earlier work."
msgstr "「修改」一件作品，是指以需要著作权授权的方式复制或改编该作品的全部或部分，而非制作完全相同的副本。由此产生的作品称为前作的「修改版」或「基于」前作的作品。"

msgid "To \"propagate\" a work means to do anything with it that, without permission, would make you directly or secondarily liable for infringement under applicable copyright law, except executing it on a computer or modifying a private copy. Propagation includes copying, distribution (with or without modification), making available to the public, and in some countries other activities as well."
msgstr "「传播」一件作品，是指对该作品做的任何事——若未经授权，会使你依适用的著作权法直接或间接需为侵权负责——但在电脑上执行或修改私人副本除外。传播包括复制、发行（有无修改皆可）、公开提供，在某些国家还包括其他活动。"

msgid "To get awarded for a perfect game the remaining card must be in the position of the initial free space."
msgstr "要拿到完美局的奖励，剩下的那张牌必须位于最初的空位上。"

msgid "To get awarded for a perfect game you must reach the maximum score of 100 points. You can reach this by restarting the game."
msgstr "要拿到完美局的奖励，必须达到 100 分的满分。重新开始游戏就能达成。"

msgid "To get awarded for a perfect game you must reach the maximum score of 40 points. You can reach this by restarting the game."
msgstr "要拿到完美局的奖励，必须达到 40 分的满分。重新开始游戏就能达成。"

msgid "To get awarded for a perfect game you must reach the maximum score of 60 points. You can reach this by restarting the game."
msgstr "要拿到完美局的奖励，必须达到 60 分的满分。重新开始游戏就能达成。"

msgid "To get awarded for a perfect game you must reach the maximum score of 75 points. You can reach this by restarting the game."
msgstr "要拿到完美局的奖励，必须达到 75 分的满分。重新开始游戏就能达成。"

msgid "To remove all cards between the king and queen of hearts"
msgstr "移除红心 K 与红心 Q 之间的牌"

msgid "To slay a monster and remove it from the tableau, three additional cards must be placed on it."
msgstr "要消灭怪兽并把它从牌列移除，必须再叠上额外三张牌。"

msgid "To solve this, you will need to plan carefully when placing the cards onto the stacks - one wrong move and you'll never be able to untangle the mess."
msgstr "要解开这局，你在把牌放到堆上时就得仔细规划——一步走错，就再也理不清这团乱麻。"

msgid "To use the solver, first run a game that's compatible with the solver, and then set the configuration settings."
msgstr "要使用解题器，先玩一局与解题器兼容的游戏，再设置配置。"

msgid "Toad in the Hole"
msgstr "洞中之蟾蜍（Toad in the Hole）"

msgid "Top - Ace of Spades"
msgstr "最上方 - 黑桃 A"

msgid "Tours du Alice"
msgstr "爱丽丝之游（Tours du Alice）"

msgid "Tower - Tens represent wizards - the ten of each suit can be played to the appropriate tower at any time."
msgstr "塔 - 10 代表法师 - 各花色的 10 随时都能出到对应的塔上。"

msgid "Tower of Babel"
msgstr "巴别塔（Tower of Babel）"

msgid "Tower of Hanoi"
msgstr "河内塔（Tower of Hanoi）"

msgid "Tower of Hanoi game type. 3+ cards. No redeal."
msgstr "河内塔游戏类型。3+ 张牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Towers"
msgstr "塔（Towers）"

msgid "Translations"
msgstr "翻译"

msgid "Travellers"
msgstr "旅人（Travellers）"

msgid "Treasure Hunt"
msgstr "寻宝（Treasure Hunt）"

msgid "Treasure Trove"
msgstr "宝藏（Treasure Trove）"

msgid "Tri Peaks"
msgstr "三峰变体（Tri Peaks）"

msgid "Triple Easthaven"
msgstr "三重东港（Triple Easthaven）"

msgid "Triplets"
msgstr "三同张（Triplets）"

msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "疑难解答"

msgid "Trueno font"
msgstr "Trueno 字体"

msgid "Trumps Only = 9"
msgstr "纯将牌 = 9"

msgid "Try"
msgstr "试试"

msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "再试一次"

msgid "Try to build down in suit whenever possible. Try to score as many points as you can as this game is very hard to win."
msgstr "尽可能依花色往下叠。尽量多拿分数，因为这游戏很难赢。"

msgid "Try to go for an empty space."
msgstr "设法做出一个空位。"

msgid "Try to keep a row open to the canvas."
msgstr "设法保留一条能通到王牌区的横排。"

msgid "Try to keep a row open to the canvas. Keep one or both of the reserves open until all the cards are dealt."
msgstr "设法保留一条能通到王牌区的横排。牌没发完之前，保留一个或两个预备堆空着。"

msgid "Try to keep a row open to the canvas. Keep the reserve stack open until all the cards are dealt."
msgstr "设法保留一条能通到王牌区的横排。牌发完之前都让预备堆保持空着。"

msgid "Tut's Tomb"
msgstr "图坦王墓（Tut's Tomb）"

msgid "Twelve cards are dealt into twelve tableau piles. These piles are built down by suit. Only one card can be moved at a time. Any card can be used to fill empty piles in the tableau. The kings are dealt to eight foundation piles, which are built up by same suit, wrapping from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "十二张牌发成十二个牌列堆。这些堆依花色往下叠。一次只能移动一张牌。牌列的空堆可用任何牌补上。K 发到八个王牌区，这些王牌区依同花色往上叠，必要时从 K 循环到 A。"

msgid "Twelve cards are dealt into twelve tableau piles. These piles are built down by suit. Only one card can be moved at a time. Cards can be dealt from the stock one at a time and moved to the foundations or the tableau. No redeals are allowed."
msgstr "十二张牌发成十二个牌列堆。这些堆依花色往下叠。一次只能移动一张牌。牌可从牌山逐张翻出，移到王牌区或牌列。不允许循环发牌。"

msgid "Twelve cards are dealt into twelve tableau piles. These piles are built up by suit. Only one card can be moved at a time. Any card can be used to fill empty piles in the tableau. Eight foundation piles are built down by same suit, starting from the kings."
msgstr "十二张牌发成十二个牌列堆。这些堆依花色往上叠。一次只能移动一张牌。牌列的空堆可用任何牌补上。八个王牌区依同花色从 K 开始往下叠。"

msgid "Twelve cards are dealt to the tableau. Cards are removed in groups of four, consisting of one face card, and three cards of different ranks that total 18 - this is done by moving all four cards to a special reserve pile. Aces are removed singly. After each set is removed, the empty spaces are filled from the talon."
msgstr "十二张牌发到牌列。牌以四张一组移除，每组含一张人头牌与三张点数不同、合计 18 的牌——移除方式是把这四张都移到一个特殊的预备堆。A 单独移除。每移除一组，空出的位置就由牌山补满。"

msgid "Twelve cards are dealt to twelve tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, wrapping from ace to king as necessary. Any valid card or sequence of cards can be moved between piles, and any sequence can be moved to empty piles."
msgstr "十二张牌发到十二个牌列堆。牌列堆不分花色、依点数往下叠，必要时从 A 循环到 K。任何合法的牌或顺子都能在堆之间移动，任何顺子都能移到空堆。"

msgid "Twelve cards are dealt to twelve tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down in rank, regardless of suit. Cards may be moved between tableau piles, one at a time. An empty tableau pile is filled with the top card from the talon."
msgstr "十二张牌发到十二个牌列堆。牌列堆不分花色、依点数往下叠。牌可逐张在牌列堆之间移动。空的牌列堆由牌山顶牌补上。"

msgid "Twelve cards are dealt to twelve tableau piles. Tableau piles can be built down by same suit, and any valid card or sequence of cards can be moved between piles. Empty tableau piles are immediately filled with a card from the talon - if the talon is empty, any card or sequence can be moved to an empty pile."
msgstr "十二张牌发到十二个牌列堆。牌列堆可依同花色往下叠，任何合法的牌或顺子都能在堆之间移动。空的牌列堆会立刻由牌山补一张——牌山空了之后，任何牌或顺子都能移到空堆。"

msgid "Twelve piles of four cards are dealt, and the aces are dealt to the foundations. Tableau piles are built up or down by suit and foundations are built up by suit. Any card can be used to fill empty piles."
msgstr "发十二堆、每堆四张，A 发到王牌区。牌列堆依花色往上或往下叠，王牌区依花色往上叠。空堆可用任何牌补上。"

msgid "Twelve piles of four cards each are dealt to the tableau. Pairs of cards that total eleven can be moved to the foundation. When there are no moves left, cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time and paired off with the tableau cards. When a tableau pile is empty, it is filled from the top card of the waste, or talon if the waste is empty."
msgstr "牌列发成十二堆、每堆四张。点数合计 11 的牌对可以移到王牌区。没有步可走时，牌山可逐张翻出，与牌列的牌配对。牌列堆空了，就由弃牌堆顶牌补上；弃牌堆也空时改用牌山。"

msgid "Twelve tableau piles of four cards are dealt and the aces are moved to the foundations at the start of the game."
msgstr "发十二个牌列堆、每堆四张，开局时把 A 移到王牌区。"

msgid "Twenty cards are dealt to twenty piles."
msgstr "二十张牌发成二十堆。"

msgid "Twenty cards are dealt to twenty piles. An ace and a king of each suit is dealt to the foundation piles."
msgstr "二十张牌发成二十堆。各花色的 A 与 K 发到王牌区。"

msgid "Twenty cards are dealt to twenty reserve piles, with an ace and a king of each suit dealt to the foundations. The foundations with aces are built up by suit from ace to king, while the ones with kings are built down from king to ace."
msgstr "二十张牌发到二十个预备堆，各花色的 A 与 K 发到王牌区。有 A 的王牌区依花色从 A 往上叠到 K，有 K 的则从 K 往下叠到 A。"

msgid "Twenty five cards are dealt to the Braid when the game begins. The foundations build in ascending suit order from Pine to Paulownia by rank. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time and two redeals are allowed. Cards may not be played from the foundations."
msgstr "开局时 25 张牌发到辫子（Braid）牌列。王牌区依花色递增顺序（从松到泡桐）按点数叠放。牌从牌山逐张翻出，允许循环发牌两次。牌不能从王牌区拿出。"

msgid "Twenty points are added for the second peak."
msgstr "第二座峰加 20 分。"

msgid "Two adjacent tiles: 2 points"
msgstr "两块相邻：2 分"

msgid "Two deck type. 2 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "两副牌类型。2 副牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Two redeals are allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "允许循环发牌两次。所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "Two redeals are allowed. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "允许循环发牌两次。所有牌都移入王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "Two tiles left: 100 points"
msgstr "剩两块：100 分"

msgid "Two-Deck game type. 2 decks. 16 redeals."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。2 副牌。16 次循环发牌。"

msgid "Two-Deck game type. 2 decks. 4 redeals."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。2 副牌。4 次循环发牌。"

msgid "Two-Deck game type. 2 decks. 8 redeals."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。2 副牌。8 次循环发牌。"

msgid "Two-Deck game type. 2 decks. No redeals."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。2 副牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Two-Deck game type. 2 decks. Varying number of redeals."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。2 副牌。循环发牌次数不定。"

msgid "Two-Deck game type. 2 stripped decks. 1 redeal."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。2 副精简副牌。1 次循环发牌。"

msgid "Two-Deck game type. Two Hanafuda decks. No redeal."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。两副花札牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Two-deck game type. 2 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "两副牌游戏类型。2 副牌。不循环发牌。"

msgid "Two-handed play"
msgstr "双人玩法"

msgid "Twos"
msgstr "成双（Twos）"

msgid "USA = 1018"
msgstr "美国 = 1018"

msgid "Uintah is a variation of"
msgstr "尤因塔（Uintah）是下列玩法的变化版"

msgid "Ukrainian Solitaire"
msgstr "乌克兰接龙（Ukrainian Solitaire）"

msgid "Ultimately, the first, second, fourth, and fifth cards in each stack will become the base cards for the final foundations."
msgstr "到最后，每堆的第一、二、四、五张牌会成为最终王牌区起头的牌。"

msgid "Uncle Walter's"
msgstr "沃尔特叔叔（Uncle Walter's）"

msgid "Uncover the deepest row stacks first. Move cards around on the tableau to open spots for cards from the waste stack."
msgstr "先把最深的横排堆翻开。挪动牌列上的牌，腾出位置好让弃牌堆的牌能出。"

msgid "Uncover the deepest row stacks first. Move cards on the tableau to allow playing cards from the waste stack."
msgstr "先把最深的横排堆翻开。挪动牌列上的牌，好让弃牌堆的牌出得掉。"

msgid "Uncover the deepest row stacks first. Play is simple but the odds against winning this one are high."
msgstr "先把最深的横排堆翻开。玩法简单，但获胜概率很低。"

msgid "Under Siege"
msgstr "围城（Under Siege）"

msgid "Under the original rules for this game, there was no limit to the number of cards that could be removed at once. But in this variant, the entire deck can always be removed in the first move, so most modern variants limit the number of cards that can be removed at once."
msgstr "依这游戏原本的规则，一次移除的牌数量没有限制。但这个变体中第一回合总能移光整副牌，所以多数现代变体会限制一次能移除的张数。"

msgid "Undo/Redo"
msgstr "复原／重做"

msgid "Undocumented key bindings"
msgstr "未说明的按键绑定"

msgid "Unfortunately the Tcl/Tk toolkit lacks a sprite concept, so there is a lot of (invisible double-buffered) redraw going on when dragging cards around."
msgstr "可惜 Tcl/Tk 工具包没有 sprite（精灵图）的概念，所以拖拽牌时会进行大量（看不见的双缓冲）重绘。"

msgid "Unlike Montana, no redeals are allowed."
msgstr "不同于蒙大拿（Montana），不允许循环发牌。"

msgid "Unlike most pairing type games, you won't need to move all cards to the foundation, because it is mathematically impossible to do so. However, after winning the game, if you click \"Back to Game\", it's often possible to pair off a few more cards, leaving as few as four cards left in the end."
msgstr "不像多数配对类游戏，你不必把所有牌都移到王牌区，因为那在数学上不可能。不过获胜后若点「返回游戏」，通常还能再配对几张，最后只剩四张。"

msgid "Up and Up is a variation of"
msgstr "上上（Up and Up）是下列玩法的变化版"

msgid "Updating"
msgstr "更新"

msgid "Upside-Down Pyramid"
msgstr "倒置金字塔（Upside-Down Pyramid）"

msgid "Use \"Super Move\" feature"
msgstr "使用「批次移动」功能"

msgid "Use the reserve stack to allow buried cards to play. The best time to use it is just before the redeal. Once played to the reserve a card may only be played from it to a foundation."
msgstr "用预备堆让埋在下面的牌能出。最好用的时机是循环发牌前一刻。牌一旦放到预备堆，就只能从那里移往王牌区。"

msgid "Using ttk and configobj as shipped in the python dist (instead of forked versions)"
msgstr "改用 Python 发行版内附的 ttk 与 configobj（而非分支版本）"

msgid "VALUE"
msgstr "VALUE"

msgid "Vacancies"
msgstr "空缺（Vacancies）"

msgid "Valentine is a game of pure luck. It was mostly designed as a way to kill time."
msgstr "情人节（Valentine）是一款纯靠运气的游戏，当初主要是为了打发时间而设计。"

msgid "Vanishing Cross"
msgstr "消失十字（Vanishing Cross）"

msgid "Various cleanups."
msgstr "多项整理修正。"

msgid "Vassal"
msgstr "附庸（Vassal）"

msgid "Vehicles = 25"
msgstr "交通工具 = 25"

msgid "Version 3, 29 June 2007"
msgstr "版本 3，2007 年 6 月 29 日"

msgid "Video Games = 26"
msgstr "电子游戏 = 26"

msgid "View original PySol credits"
msgstr "查看原始 PySol 制作名单"

msgid "View original PySol release notes"
msgstr "查看原始 PySol 发行说明"

msgid "View partially overlapped cards"
msgstr "查看部分重叠的牌"

msgid "Vineyard was invented by Peter Voke, and was first created in the Solitaire Wizard of the Pretty Good Solitaire app. It has since been ported to many other solitaire apps."
msgstr "葡萄园（Vineyard）由 Peter Voke 设计，最早是在 Pretty Good Solitaire 应用程序的接龙法师中做出来的，之后已移植到许多其他接龙程序。"

msgid "Virginia Reel is a variation of"
msgstr "维吉尼亚里尔（Virginia Reel）变体自"

msgid "VirusTotal"
msgstr "VirusTotal"

msgid "Viruses on Linux"
msgstr "Linux 上的病毒"

msgid "Visit the official"
msgstr "造访官方"

msgid "Vladimir Marangozov &lt;Vladimir.Marangozov@inrialpes.fr&gt;"
msgstr "Vladimir Marangozov &lt;Vladimir.Marangozov@inrialpes.fr&gt;"

msgid "Volker Weidner for getting me into Solitaire"
msgstr "Volker Weidner 带我入门接龙"

msgid "WARNING:"
msgstr "警告："

msgid "WASTE"
msgstr "弃牌堆"

msgid "WILD CARD"
msgstr "万用牌"

msgid "WIZARD"
msgstr "法师"

msgid "WRAP AROUND"
msgstr "循环"

msgid "Washington's Favorite"
msgstr "华盛顿的最爱（Washington's Favorite）"

msgid "Watch"
msgstr "观看"

msgid "Wave Motion was invented by David Bernazzani. Its name is a reference to the anime series Space Battleship Yamato, also called Star Blazers."
msgstr "波动（Wave Motion）由 David Bernazzani 发明。游戏名致敬动画剧集「宇宙战舰大和号」（又称 Star Blazers）。"

msgid "We have been asked about the fact that some anti viruses, including those on"
msgstr "我们常被问到，有些防毒软件，包括那些在"

msgid "We now provide a Microsoft Windows binary installer again, thanks to the great work of"
msgstr "我们如今再度提供 Microsoft Windows 安装程序，这全亏"

msgid "Weavers"
msgstr "织工（Weavers）"

msgid "When a hand is dealt 52 points are subtracted from the score."
msgstr "每发一手牌，会从分数中扣掉 52 分。"

msgid "When a same suit sequence is created that goes all the way from king to ace, it is immediately moved to a foundation pile. The game is won if all cards are moved to this foundation pile."
msgstr "同花色顺子从 K 一路完整到 A 时，会立刻整组移到一个王牌区堆。所有牌都移到该王牌区堆即获胜。"

msgid "When a tableau pile is empty, four cards from the talon are dealt to fill it. When there are no moves left, you can deal four cards from the talon to each tableau pile."
msgstr "牌列堆空了，就从牌山发四张补满。没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发四张。"

msgid "When all the cards are removed from the tableau ten points are added for each card remaining in the talon."
msgstr "牌列的所有牌都被移走时，牌山每剩一张加 10 分。"

msgid "When all the pieces have been restored to their correct order, with the blank space in the bottom right corner, the final piece will be dealt to the tableau and the game has been won. Every Matrix game can be solved."
msgstr "当所有牌块都恢复正确顺序、空格位于右下角时，最后一块会发到牌列，游戏即获胜。每个矩阵（Matrix）局都可解。"

msgid "When no more cards can be moved to the foundations, you can deal one card from the talon to each tableau pile. Once the talon is empty, you can move single cards between tableau piles, building them up or down by same suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有牌能移到王牌区时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。牌山发完后，可在牌列堆之间单张移动，依同花色递增或递减叠放。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible click on the talon for a redeal. The cards are not re-shuffled, but re-dealt in packs of 4 cards. Note that due to the way redealing is done, if no cards have been moved since the last redeal, the cards will end up in the same layout as before. This usually means the game is lost."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山可循环发牌。牌不重新洗牌，而是以 4 张为一组重发。注意，由于循环发牌的进行方式，若自上次循环发牌后没移动过任何牌，牌会回到跟原本相同的排列。这通常意味着输了。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, click on the Talon. Three more cards will be dealt."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山，会再发三张。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, click on the talon. All cards on the tableau will be re-shuffled and redealt in the same manner, with only the top cards again being visible. Six redeals are allowed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山。牌列所有牌会重新洗牌，以同样方式重发，照样只有最上面那张可见。可循环发牌六次。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, click on the talon. One card will be added to each"
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山，会各加一张牌到每个"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, click on the talon. One card will be added to each of the playing piles, except for the last turn where only 7 cards will be dealt."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山。会往每个牌列堆各加一张牌，只有最后一轮例外，那轮只发 7 张。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, click on the talon. The cards will be shifted up and the empty spaces at the bottom will be filled."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山。牌会往上移位，底部的空位会补满。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, click on the talon. Three more cards will be dealt."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山，会再发三张。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and can move them to the tableau. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if you can move all eight same suit sequences to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌并移到牌列。不循环发牌。能把八组同花顺子全移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When no more moves are possible, you can redeal by taking the first tableau pile and dealing the cards from it evenly to the tableau piles. For the next redeal, you do the same with the second pile, and so on until you go through all eight piles."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可把第一个牌列堆收起，将其中的牌平均发回各牌列堆来循环发牌。下次循环发牌对第二堆做同样的事，依此类推，直到八堆都轮完。"

msgid "When no more sensible moves are available, click on the talon. One card will be added to each of the playing piles (this includes the at this time free spaces too)."
msgstr "没有像样的步可走时，点牌山。会往每个牌列堆各加一张牌（也包括当时空着的位置）。"

msgid "When no moves can be made, cards still out of sequence are reshuffled and dealt face up after the ends of the partial sequences, leaving a card space after each sequence, so that each row looks like a partial sequence followed by a space, followed by enough cards to make a row of 13."
msgstr "无步可走时，仍未排入顺子的牌会重新洗牌，正面朝上发在各未完成顺子的尾端之后，每个顺子后面留一个牌位空档，使每一横排看起来是：一个未完成顺子、一个空档，再补上凑满一排 13 张所需的牌。"

msgid "When no moves can be made, cards still out of sequence are reshuffled and dealt face up after the ends of the partial sequences, leaving a card space after each sequence, so that each row looks like a partial sequence followed by a space, followed by enough cards to make a row of 14 or 22, depending on the row. Four redeals are allowed."
msgstr "无步可走时，仍未排入顺子的牌会重新洗牌，正面朝上发在各未完成顺子的尾端之后，每个顺子后面留一个牌位空档，使每一横排看起来是：一个未完成顺子、一个空档，再补上凑满一排 14 或 22 张所需的牌（视该排而定）。可循环发牌四次。"

msgid "When no moves can be made, cards still out of sequence are reshuffled and dealt face up after the ends of the partial sequences, leaving a card space after each sequence, so that each row looks like a partial sequence followed by a space, followed by enough cards to make a row of 14."
msgstr "无步可走时，仍未排入顺子的牌会重新洗牌，正面朝上发在各未完成顺子的尾端之后，每个顺子后面留一个牌位空档，使每一横排看起来是：一个未完成顺子、一个空档，再补上凑满一排 14 张所需的牌。"

msgid "When play begins, the leftmost column is filled with four goal cards of different ranks, one from each suit. The next two columns to the right are the byte stacks. They can be filled with cards of the same rank as the goal card in that row. The four right most columns are the bit stacks. They can be filled with cards of the same suit as the goal card in the respective row if their least significant bit matches the corresponding bit on the goal card."
msgstr "开局时，最左一栏填入四张点数各不相同的目标牌，每个花色各一张。右边相邻的两栏是字节堆，可放入与该横排目标牌点数相同的牌。最右的四栏是位堆，只要牌的最低位与该横排目标牌的对应位相符，即可放入同花色的牌。"

msgid "When play comes to a standstill, you can deal two cards to each of the reserve piles from the stock. When there are only eight cards left in the stock, you instead deal one of those cards to each tableau stack."
msgstr "游戏停滞时，可从牌山对每个预备堆各发两张。牌山只剩八张时，改为对每个牌列堆各发一张。"

msgid "When playing Spider, you are not allowed to deal more cards if there are any empty piles. If there aren't enough cards left to put one in each pile, the game is lost. Part of the game is planning ahead when to deal more cards to avoid this situation."
msgstr "玩蜘蛛（Spider）时，只要有空堆就不能再发牌。若剩牌不足以每堆各放一张，就算输。游戏的一部分就是要事先规划何时发牌，避免这种情况。"

msgid "When the cards are dealt, one card of each rank is placed on the four foundation stacks. The remaining 44 cards are dealt to the tableau. Cards from the tableau can be played on the foundations by rank, in circular suit order. That is, Plum 1 plays on Pine 1, Rose 2 plays on Iris 2, and Pine 3 plays on Phoenix 3. Gaji is wild. It can play on any card in the tableau and any card can play on Gaji. Any card can also be played on the canvas. Gaji will only play in its proper position on the foundation. Cards play on the tableau by suit in descending rank order. There can be no more than twelve cards in a row. Once a card is played on a foundation stack it can't be taken off except by undoing the move."
msgstr "发牌完成后，四个王牌区堆各放一张、点数互不相同。剩下 44 张发到牌列。牌列的牌可按点数、依花色循环顺序放到王牌区。也就是说：李 1 放在松 1 上，玫瑰 2 放在鸢尾 2 上，松 3 放在凤 3 上。Gaji 是万用牌，可放在牌列任何牌上，任何牌也可放在 Gaji 上。任何牌也都能放到王牌区。只有 Gaji 必须放在王牌区的正确位置。牌列依花色以点数递减叠放。每排最多十二张。牌一旦放到王牌区堆，除了复原该步外不能取回。"

msgid "When the hand is dealt, the twenty reserve stacks of the pagoda are filled with cards. The twelve foundation stacks on the right are labeled with the names of the twelve suits. Cards are played on the foundations first upwards from the fourth rank to the first, then downwards from first to fourth. When the first card is played on a foundation, the label changes from the suit name to \"Rising\". When the fifth card is played, the label changes to \"Setting\". When the last card is played, the label reverts to the suit name. Cards can be played on the foundations from the reserve stacks or from the waste stack. An empty foundation will only accept the fourth rank card of the correct suit. Cards are dealt from the talon four at a time, and there is only one round."
msgstr "发牌时，宝塔的二十个预备堆会先填满牌。右侧十二个王牌区堆以十二个花色名称标记。放入王牌区的牌先从第四点数往上排到第一点数，再从第一点数往下排到第四点数。王牌区放入第一张牌时，标签从花色名改为「上升」。放入第五张时改为「下降」。放入最后一张时标签改回花色名。可从预备堆或弃牌堆放到王牌区。空的王牌区只收正确花色的第四点数牌。牌山每次发四张，且只发一轮。"

msgid "When the talon is empty, the discarded cards are shuffled to form a new talon, and play continues until you get stuck by one of the Bogey's cards, or you win by moving all cards to the columns."
msgstr "牌山发完后，舍出的牌会洗牌组成新牌山，继续玩直到被某张 Bogey 牌卡住，或把全部牌移到各栏而获胜。"

msgid "When there are no more moves, you can deal one card from the talon to each of the nine tableau piles. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对九个牌列堆各发一张。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no more moves, you can deal one card from the talon to each tableau pile. If the tableau is empty, you're allowed one redeal. For this redeal, the deck is shuffled, and redealt as before, only this time, after all of the seven piles have seven cards, any remaining cards are dealt to the bottom of the piles face-up, until the deck is empty."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。牌列全空时可循环发牌一次。这次循环发牌会把副牌洗牌，照原本方式重发，只是当七个牌堆都各有七张后，剩余的牌一律正面朝上发到各堆底部，直到副牌发完。"

msgid "When there are no more possible moves, click on the talon. Three cards will be moved from the talon to the waste pile directly to its right."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，点牌山。会从牌山移三张到它右边正旁的弃牌堆。"

msgid "When there are no moves available, deal an additional card from the stock onto each tableau pile. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "无步可走时，从牌山对每个牌列堆各补发一张。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, cards can be dealt from the tableau one at a time, and moved to the tableau or foundations. Only one redeal is allowed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，移到牌列或王牌区。只能循环发牌一次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time, and moved to an appropriate tableau or foundation pile. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，放到合适的牌列堆或王牌区堆。不循环发牌。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, cards can be flipped from the talon one at a time, and moved to either the tableau, foundations, or the waste pile. Once moved to the waste pile, a card cannot be moved to the tableau or foundations. One redeal is allowed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张翻牌，移到牌列、王牌区或弃牌堆。牌一旦进弃牌堆，就不能再移到牌列或王牌区。可循环发牌一次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, cards from the talon can be dealt to each of three waste piles, which can then be moved to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，牌山的牌可发到三个弃牌堆，再从弃牌堆移到牌列或王牌区。不循环发牌。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, deal a card to each tableau and reserve pile, from left to right. Cards dealt to the reserves are dealt face-down, but when the stock is empty, both full reserves are flipped face-up. After the stock is empty, you can combine all six piles to form a new stock, and redeal. You can do this a max of three times. After the third redeal, the reserves are no longer used, and cards are only dealt to tableau piles."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，由左到右对每个牌列堆与预备堆各发一张。发到预备堆的牌面朝下，但牌山发完时，两座已满的预备堆会一起翻成正面。之后可把全部六堆合并成新牌山循环发牌，最多三次。第三次循环发牌后就不再用预备堆，只对牌列堆发牌。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, deal one card from the talon to each of the tableau piles, arranged so only the top card is visible. The game is won if all the aces through tens are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张，只露出最上面那张。把 A 到 10 全部移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, five cards are dealt from the talon. Any of these five cards can be moved to the tableau or foundations. If there are no more moves, the remaining of these five cards are placed aside, and five new cards are dealt. This continues until the talon is empty."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，从牌山发五张。这五张中任一张都可移到牌列或王牌区。若仍无步可走，这五张剩下的会放到一旁，再发新的五张。如此持续到牌山发完。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, one card can be dealt from the stock to each tableau pile."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山顶对每个牌列堆各发一张。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, one card can be dealt to each tableau pile from the stock. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, the card from each reserve can be moved to the top of the associated tableau pile, and eight new cards are dealt to the reserve."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可把每个预备堆的牌移到所属牌列堆顶，再对预备堆发八张新牌。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, the remaining cards on the tableau can be reshuffled and redealt. Two redeals are allowed. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，牌列剩下的牌可重新洗牌重发。可循环发牌两次。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, the remaining tableau cards can be reshuffled and redealt. This can be done twice per game."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，牌列剩下的牌可洗牌重发，一局可做两次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, the remaining tableau cards can be shuffled, and redealt in the same manner as described above. This can be done twice."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，牌列剩下的牌可洗牌，并以上述同样方式重发，可做两次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, the tableau piles can be shuffled with the remaining talon and redealt in the same manner as above. This can be done up to twice per game."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可把牌列堆与牌山剩牌一起洗牌，按上述方式重发，一局最多两次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can combine the tableau piles, starting with the last pile dealt. Then, without shuffling, they are redealt in the same manner. After the first redeal, the restrictions as to which cards can be dealt to which foundation no longer apply. Two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从最后发的堆开始合并各牌列堆，不洗牌照原方式重发。第一次循环发牌后，哪张牌能进哪个王牌区的限制就不再适用。可循环发牌两次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal a single card from the deck to each of the reserve piles."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从副牌对每个预备堆各发一张。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the stock to each of five waste piles, and the cards from these waste piles can be moved to tableau or foundation piles. When the stock is empty, you can combine the waste piles to form a new stock and redeal. You are allowed four redeals, though during each redeal, you use one fewer waste pile than you did on the previous deal."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山发牌到五个弃牌堆，弃牌堆的牌可移到牌列堆或王牌区堆。牌山发完时，可把弃牌堆合并成新牌山循环发牌。可循环发牌四次，但每次循环发牌用的弃牌堆要比上次少一个。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time and can move them to the tableau, foundations, or an empty free cell. No redeals are allowed. The foundations are built up by alternate color from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，移到牌列、王牌区或空的自由格。不循环发牌。王牌区依红黑交替从 A 递增叠放到 K。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time and move them to the tableau or foundations. Once the reserve is empty, cards from the Bastille can be moved to the bottom of the reserve one at a time."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，移到牌列或王牌区。预备堆一旦清空，可把巴士底狱的牌一张一张移到预备堆底部。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and can move them to appropriate tableau or foundation piles. You can go through the talon as many times as necessary. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，放到合适的牌列堆或王牌区堆。牌山可不限次数来回发。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to a tableau, foundation, or reserve. No redeals are allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，移到牌列、王牌区或预备堆。不循环发牌。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to appropriate tableau or foundation piles. You can go through the deck as many times as necessary."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，放到合适的牌列堆或王牌区堆。副牌可不限次数来回发。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to the tableau or foundation. Two redeals are allowed. The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，移到牌列或王牌区。可循环发牌两次。王牌区依同花色从 A 递增叠放到 K。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to the tableau or foundations if possible. You are allowed one redeal, so you can go through the deck twice."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，能移到牌列或王牌区就移。可循环发牌一次，也就是牌山可发完两轮。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon one at a time. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon three at a time, and move the top card to appropriate row piles. You can deal through the deck as many times as needed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山每次发三张，把最上一张放到合适的横排堆。牌山可不限次数来回发。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon to fill the empty spaces in the tableau. If there are no empty spaces, you can deal an additional row of ten cards below the current one. Once there are more than three rows, only cards with no card directly above or below them can be moved."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山发牌补满牌列中的空位。没有空位时，可在现有排面下方多发一排十张。一旦超过三排，只有上下都没有紧邻牌的牌才能移动。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards from the talon, one to each tableau pile. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards one at a time from the talon and move them to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌并移到牌列或王牌区。不循环发牌。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards one at a time from the talon, and move them to an appropriate tableau/free cell/foundation pile. No redeal is allowed, so you can only go through the talon once."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌，放到合适的牌列堆、自由格或王牌区堆。不循环发牌，所以牌山只能发一轮。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards one at a time from the talon, and move them to the tableau or foundations. The foundations are built up by same color from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张发牌并移到牌列或王牌区。王牌区依同色从 A 递增叠放到 K。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal cards three at a time from the talon, and move them to an appropriate foundation. Two redeals are allowed, so you can go through the deck three times. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山每次发三张，放到合适的王牌区。可循环发牌两次，也就是副牌可发完三轮。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal four additional cards from the deck to each of the reserve piles."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从副牌对每个预备堆各多发四张。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each empty tableau space. The game is won if all cards are removed, except the picture cards, which are in their respective spaces."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个空的牌列位置各发一张。除人头牌外全部移走、人头牌各就各位即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each of the four reserve piles. The game is won if all cards have been moved to foundations (it doesn't matter which foundations are empty, and how many cards are in each)."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对四个预备堆各发一张。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜（不管哪些王牌区空着、每堆各放几张）。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each of the tableau piles. Once the talon is empty, you can build tableau piles up or down regardless of suit, and can move any card to the foundation, regardless of its position. Empty tableau piles cannot be filled. At this point, once there are no moves left, you can combine the tableau piles to form a new talon and redeal. You are allowed two redeals."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张，只露出最上一张。牌山发完后，牌列堆不论花色都可递增或递减叠放，任何牌都可移到王牌区而不计位置。空的牌列堆不能补牌。此时若无步可走，可把牌列堆合并成新牌山循环发牌。可循环发牌两次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each tableau pile."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each tableau pile. However, if a tableau pile has a valid alternate color sequence at the top of it, starting with a king, that pile is skipped. The game is won if all cards are grouped into sequences and moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。但若某牌列堆顶端已有从 K 起头的有效红黑交替顺子，该堆就跳过。所有牌排成顺子并移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each tableau pile. The foundations are built up from queen to jack, turning the corner from king to ace. The jacks in the reserve can only be moved to the foundations. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。王牌区从 Q 递增叠放到 J，K 之后循环回 A。预备堆里的 J 只能移到王牌区。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each tableau pile. The game is won if all cards are grouped into sequences and moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发一张。所有牌排成顺子并移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to the top of each tableau pile. The game is won when all the cards have been moved to the foundations in one of the aforementioned sequences."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆顶各发一张。所有牌以上述某一种顺子形式移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the top of the stock to each tableau pile."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山顶对每个牌列堆各发一张。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can deal two cards from the talon to each tableau pile, one face-down then one face-up."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山对每个牌列堆各发两张，第一张面朝下、第二张面朝上。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can draw cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to one of three waste piles, or the foundation directly. When the talon is empty, you can place the three waste piles on top of each other to form a new talon and redeal. You can redeal three times per game."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张抽牌，移到三个弃牌堆之一，或直接放到王牌区。牌山发完时，可把三个弃牌堆叠起来变成新牌山循环发牌。一局可循环发牌三次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can draw cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to the tableau or foundations. Two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张抽牌并移到牌列或王牌区。可循环发牌两次。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can draw cards from the talon three at a time, and move them to the tableau or reserve. You can go through the deck as many times as needed."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山每次抽三张，移到牌列或预备堆。副牌可不限次数来回抽。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can draw cards one at a time from the talon, and move them to the foundations if possible. You are allowed one redeal, so you can go through the talon twice. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可从牌山一张一张抽牌，能移到王牌区就移。可循环发牌一次，也就是牌山可发完两轮。所有牌移到王牌区即获胜。"

msgid "When there are no moves left, you can pick up all the foundation piles, combine them, and redeal as before. You're allowed to do this twice per game."
msgstr "没有可走的步时，可收起所有王牌区堆，合并后照原方式重发。一局可做两次。"

msgid "When you are finished moving cards from your hand, draw one card from the talon - this is the Bogey's card. You must immediately play this card to one of the columns. If you cannot do so, the game is lost. Once the Bogey's card has been played, draw cards from the talon until you have a new five card hand, and then you can play these cards as before."
msgstr "打完手里的牌后，从牌山抽一张，这就是 Bogey 牌。必须立刻把这张牌放到其中一栏，做不到就算输。Bogey 牌打出后，从牌山抽牌凑成新的五张手牌，即可照样继续出牌。"

msgid "When you click on the Talon, one card is turned over onto the Waste pile. There is no redeal."
msgstr "点牌山时，会翻一张牌到弃牌堆。不循环发牌。"

msgid "When you click on the talon, one card is played on each stack, except for stacks that are a single sequence starting with a King."
msgstr "点牌山时，会往每堆各放一张牌，但已经是从 K 起头单一顺子的堆除外。"

msgid "When you click on the talon, one card is turned over onto the waste pile. There are 2 redeals."
msgstr "点牌山时，会翻一张牌到弃牌堆。可循环发牌两次。"

msgid "When you click on the talon, one card is turned over onto the waste pile. There is no redeal."
msgstr "点牌山时，会翻一张牌到弃牌堆。不循环发牌。"

